{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UTdbBxFPwffwCpQJrgXmmX","type":"tool_result","content":"3648:### interface GaitSpec\n3690:### type Key\n3990:### bt\n3998:### class BtNode\n4010:### type BtStatus\n4049:### interface CameraKey\n4107:### interface Cue\n4179:### type EaseName\nGUIDE.md:404:const tree = new BehaviorTree(bt.selector('npc', bt.sequence('flee', bt.condition('near?', (b) => b.near), bt.action('run', run)), bt.action('wander', wander)), board); // tree.tick(dt) p\n### type Key\n\n```ts\ntype Key = readonly [number, Pose, Ease?]\n```\n\n`[frame, pose, easeToNextKey?]`\n\n### interface LegDef\n\n- `rest: readonly [number, number]`: Where the foot rests, in the body's space (x right, z forward; y ignored).\n- `partners?: readonly number[]`: Legs that must not be lifting when this one starts a step (its neighbours; mutual, so listing a pair once is enough).\n\n### class LegStepper\n\n### interface GaitSpec\n\nProcedural locomotion cycles with planted feet. Instead of posing every frame, describe\nthe gait (speed, cadence, stance, bounce, arm swing...) and the generator plants each\nfoot on the ground, sliding it backwards at exactly `speed` while it is in stance, then\nswings it forward on an arc — heel strike, roll, toe-off included. Tweak numbers,\nre-run `npm run anim -- check Walk`, look at the sheet.\n\nPhase: the RIGHT heel strikes at frame 0, the left at frames / 2.\n\n- `name: string`\n- `frames: number`: One full cycle (two steps), frames at 30 fps.\n- `speed: number`: Ground speed the cycle is authored for (m/s at playback rate 1).\n- `stance: number`: Fraction of the cycle each foot is on the ground. Walk ≈ 0.55–0.6, run ≈ 0.3.\n- `hip: number`: Mean pelvis height offset from rest (m); negative bends the knees.\n- `bob?: number`: Pelvis bounce amplitude (m), twice per cycle.\n- `low?: number`: Cycle fraction at which the pelvis is lowest (default: walk just after contact, run mid-stance).\n- `squash?: number`: Squash at the lowest point (e.g. 0.05 = 5 % shorter, wider).\n- `lift?: number`: How high the lowest point of the swinging foot clears the floor at its peak (m).\n- `liftPeak?: number`: Where in the swing (0..1) the foot is highest (default 0.4).\n- `reach?: number`: Shift the whole stride forward (m).\n- `swingReach?: number`: Extra forward throw of the swinging foot late in the swing, before it settles (m).\n- `swingDelay?: number`: Swing timing: 0 = even, + = the foot hangs back then whips forward (running).\n### interface CameraKey\n\n- `at: number`: Time (s) the camera is exactly here.\n- `position: V3`\n- `target: V3`: The point it looks at.\n- `fov?: number`: Vertical field of view (degrees); default the previous key's, or 50.\n- `cut?: boolean`: Jump here instead of gliding from the key before (a cut to a new shot).\n\n### class CameraShake\n\n- `trauma: number`\n### interface Cue\n\n- `at: number`\n- `name?: string`\n- `run: () => void`\n- `cosmetic?: boolean`: Cosmetic (a sound, a puff of dust): not run when the scene is skipped past it. Cues that change the world (a door left open, an item given) are run on skip so the world ends up\n\n### DECAL_SHAPES\n\nselector sequence steps parallel condition action wait inverter succeeder repeat cooldown\n(e,t,n)=>new u_e(e,t,n)\n(e,t)=>new l_e(e,t)\nIdle:60L IdleLook:102L Teeter:30L Tiptoe:18L Walk:12L Run:12L Skid:18 SkidTurn:12 StepUp:8 StepDown:8 Crouch:40L CrouchWalk:12L CrouchSlide:20L ProneDown:16 Prone:60L Crawl:36L GetUpFront:21 Sit:60L SitDown:16 StandUp:16 LieDown:30 LieIdle:60L Sleep:90L GetUp:24 Jump:20 JumpUp:20 DoubleJump:22 TripleJump:30 Backflip:30 SideFlip:26 LongJump:36 WallKick:20 WallSlide:20L Fall:16L Dive:12 BellySlide:20L GroundPoundSpin:9 GroundPound:10 GroundPoundLand:15 Land:10 HardLand:30 Slide:20L Hang:40L ShimmyRight:20L ShimmyLeft:20L PullUp:27 ClimbIdle:40L Climb:24L Push:30L PushIdle:40L Grab:40L Pull:30L Punch:10 Punch2:10 Kick:14 SweepKick:18 JumpKick:14 Wave:44 Victory:48 Hurt:20 Slash1:12 Slash2:12 Slash3:18 Slam:24 LeapSlam:28 Spin:12L Cast:16 CastBig:22 CastWeapon:16 CastBigWeapon:22 BowDraw:18 BowRelease:12 Roll:14 Charge:14 Shout:20 HitReact:10 Death:36 Triumph:40\n{\"name\":\"Hurt\",\"fast\":true,\"frames\":20,\"grounded\":true,\"keys\":[[0,{\"Pelvis\":{\"r\":[0,0,0],\"p\":[0,-0.025,0],\"s\":1},\"Torso\":[4,0,0],\"Head\":[-4,0,0],\"ArmR\":[6,0,-9],\"ForearmR\":[-22,0,0],\"HandR\":[-10,0,0],\"ArmL\":[6,0,9],\"ForearmL\":[-22,0,0],\"HandL\":[-10,0,0],\"LegR\":{\"r\":[-19.312,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"ShinR\":{\"r\":[34.927,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"FootR\":{\"r\":[-15.614,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"LegL\":{\"r\":[-11.443,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"ShinL\":{\"r\":[35.454,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\"\n[\"Pelvis\",\"Torso\",\"Head\",\"ArmR\",\"ForearmR\",\"HandR\",\"ArmL\",\"ForearmL\",\"HandL\",\"LegR\",\"ShinR\",\"FootR\",\"LegL\",\"ShinL\",\"FootL\"]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"f1c2897b-0d97-409a-b8f3-c866fbe88093","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:41:13.798Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"3648:### interface GaitSpec\n3690:### type Key\n3990:### bt\n3998:### class BtNode\n4010:### type BtStatus\n4049:### interface CameraKey\n4107:### interface Cue\n4179:### type EaseName\nGUIDE.md:404:const tree = new BehaviorTree(bt.selector('npc', bt.sequence('flee', bt.condition('near?', (b) => b.near), bt.action('run', run)), bt.action('wander', wander)), board); // tree.tick(dt) p\n### type Key\n\n```ts\ntype Key = readonly [number, Pose, Ease?]\n```\n\n`[frame, pose, easeToNextKey?]`\n\n### interface LegDef\n\n- `rest: readonly [number, number]`: Where the foot rests, in the body's space (x right, z forward; y ignored).\n- `partners?: readonly number[]`: Legs that must not be lifting when this one starts a step (its neighbours; mutual, so listing a pair once is enough).\n\n### class LegStepper\n\n### interface GaitSpec\n\nProcedural locomotion cycles with planted feet. Instead of posing every frame, describe\nthe gait (speed, cadence, stance, bounce, arm swing...) and the generator plants each\nfoot on the ground, sliding it backwards at exactly `speed` while it is in stance, then\nswings it forward on an arc — heel strike, roll, toe-off included. Tweak numbers,\nre-run `npm run anim -- check Walk`, look at the sheet.\n\nPhase: the RIGHT heel strikes at frame 0, the left at frames / 2.\n\n- `name: string`\n- `frames: number`: One full cycle (two steps), frames at 30 fps.\n- `speed: number`: Ground speed the cycle is authored for (m/s at playback rate 1).\n- `stance: number`: Fraction of the cycle each foot is on the ground. Walk ≈ 0.55–0.6, run ≈ 0.3.\n- `hip: number`: Mean pelvis height offset from rest (m); negative bends the knees.\n- `bob?: number`: Pelvis bounce amplitude (m), twice per cycle.\n- `low?: number`: Cycle fraction at which the pelvis is lowest (default: walk just after contact, run mid-stance).\n- `squash?: number`: Squash at the lowest point (e.g. 0.05 = 5 % shorter, wider).\n- `lift?: number`: How high the lowest point of the swinging foot clears the floor at its peak (m).\n- `liftPeak?: number`: Where in the swing (0..1) the foot is highest (default 0.4).\n- `reach?: number`: Shift the whole stride forward (m).\n- `swingReach?: number`: Extra forward throw of the swinging foot late in the swing, before it settles (m).\n- `swingDelay?: number`: Swing timing: 0 = even, + = the foot hangs back then whips forward (running).\n### interface CameraKey\n\n- `at: number`: Time (s) the camera is exactly here.\n- `position: V3`\n- `target: V3`: The point it looks at.\n- `fov?: number`: Vertical field of view (degrees); default the previous key's, or 50.\n- `cut?: boolean`: Jump here instead of gliding from the key before (a cut to a new shot).\n\n### class CameraShake\n\n- `trauma: number`\n### interface Cue\n\n- `at: number`\n- `name?: string`\n- `run: () => void`\n- `cosmetic?: boolean`: Cosmetic (a sound, a puff of dust): not run when the scene is skipped past it. Cues that change the world (a door left open, an item given) are run on skip so the world ends up\n\n### DECAL_SHAPES\n\nselector sequence steps parallel condition action wait inverter succeeder repeat cooldown\n(e,t,n)=>new u_e(e,t,n)\n(e,t)=>new l_e(e,t)\nIdle:60L IdleLook:102L Teeter:30L Tiptoe:18L Walk:12L Run:12L Skid:18 SkidTurn:12 StepUp:8 StepDown:8 Crouch:40L CrouchWalk:12L CrouchSlide:20L ProneDown:16 Prone:60L Crawl:36L GetUpFront:21 Sit:60L SitDown:16 StandUp:16 LieDown:30 LieIdle:60L Sleep:90L GetUp:24 Jump:20 JumpUp:20 DoubleJump:22 TripleJump:30 Backflip:30 SideFlip:26 LongJump:36 WallKick:20 WallSlide:20L Fall:16L Dive:12 BellySlide:20L GroundPoundSpin:9 GroundPound:10 GroundPoundLand:15 Land:10 HardLand:30 Slide:20L Hang:40L ShimmyRight:20L ShimmyLeft:20L PullUp:27 ClimbIdle:40L Climb:24L Push:30L PushIdle:40L Grab:40L Pull:30L Punch:10 Punch2:10 Kick:14 SweepKick:18 JumpKick:14 Wave:44 Victory:48 Hurt:20 Slash1:12 Slash2:12 Slash3:18 Slam:24 LeapSlam:28 Spin:12L Cast:16 CastBig:22 CastWeapon:16 CastBigWeapon:22 BowDraw:18 BowRelease:12 Roll:14 Charge:14 Shout:20 HitReact:10 Death:36 Triumph:40\n{\"name\":\"Hurt\",\"fast\":true,\"frames\":20,\"grounded\":true,\"keys\":[[0,{\"Pelvis\":{\"r\":[0,0,0],\"p\":[0,-0.025,0],\"s\":1},\"Torso\":[4,0,0],\"Head\":[-4,0,0],\"ArmR\":[6,0,-9],\"ForearmR\":[-22,0,0],\"HandR\":[-10,0,0],\"ArmL\":[6,0,9],\"ForearmL\":[-22,0,0],\"HandL\":[-10,0,0],\"LegR\":{\"r\":[-19.312,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"ShinR\":{\"r\":[34.927,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"FootR\":{\"r\":[-15.614,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"LegL\":{\"r\":[-11.443,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"ShinL\":{\"r\":[35.454,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\"\n[\"Pelvis\",\"Torso\",\"Head\",\"ArmR\",\"ForearmR\",\"HandR\",\"ArmL\",\"ForearmL\",\"HandL\",\"LegR\",\"ShinR\",\"FootR\",\"LegL\",\"ShinL\",\"FootL\"]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpect