{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G17DdDj3FMZMdRX5U9vW4K","type":"tool_result","content":"### class BtNode\n\n- `new BtNode(name: string, kind: string)`\n- `status: Status | null`: Status at the last tick that reached this node.\n- `visited: number`: The tree's tick count when this node last ran.\n- `readonly children: BtNode<B>[]`\n- `tree: BehaviorTree<B> | null`: The tree it belongs to: a node keeps its own state, so it can be in one tree only.\n- `readonly name: string`\n- `readonly kind: string`\n- `run(b: B, dt: number, tree: BehaviorTree<B>): Status`: Tick this node (keeps `status` and `visited` for the trace).\n- `halt(b: B): void`: Interrupted: forget any progress, and tell actions that were running to stop.\n\n### type BtStatus\n\n```ts\ntype BtStatus = 'success' | 'failure' | 'running'\n```\n\nBehaviour trees: an agent's decisions as a tree of small nodes, ticked every step. Each tick\na node answers success, failure or running (still at it). Selectors try their children in\npriority order until one doesn't fail; sequences run theirs in order until one doesn't\nsucceed. Both are reactive: every tick starts again from the first child, so a higher\npriority (flee!) takes over at once, and whatever was running below it is halted.\n\n  const tree = new BehaviorTree(\nsuccess 10\nrunning 11\n1585:### interface ExplosionOptions\n1586-\n1587-- `radius?: number`\n1588-- `impulse?: number`: Speed change (m/s) at the centre, fading to 0 at the radius. Default 10.\n1589-- `up?: number`: Extra upward share (0..1): blasts throw things up. Default 0.4.\n1590-\n1591-### interface Field\n1592-\n1593-- `enabled: boolean`","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"6d9a9351-b5a1-4b9b-b07c-9801d52de6a4","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:49:46.003Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### class BtNode\n\n- `new BtNode(name: string, kind: string)`\n- `status: Status | null`: Status at the last tick that reached this node.\n- `visited: number`: The tree's tick count when this node last ran.\n- `readonly children: BtNode<B>[]`\n- `tree: BehaviorTree<B> | null`: The tree it belongs to: a node keeps its own state, so it can be in one tree only.\n- `readonly name: string`\n- `readonly kind: string`\n- `run(b: B, dt: number, tree: BehaviorTree<B>): Status`: Tick this node (keeps `status` and `visited` for the trace).\n- `halt(b: B): void`: Interrupted: forget any progress, and tell actions that were running to stop.\n\n### type BtStatus\n\n```ts\ntype BtStatus = 'success' | 'failure' | 'running'\n```\n\nBehaviour trees: an agent's decisions as a tree of small nodes, ticked every step. Each tick\na node answers success, failure or running (still at it). Selectors try their children in\npriority order until one doesn't fail; sequences run theirs in order until one doesn't\nsucceed. Both are reactive: every tick starts again from the first child, so a higher\npriority (flee!) takes over at once, and whatever was running below it is halted.\n\n  const tree = new BehaviorTree(\nsuccess 10\nrunning 11\n1585:### interface ExplosionOptions\n1586-\n1587-- `radius?: number`\n1588-- `impulse?: number`: Speed change (m/s) at the centre, fading to 0 at the radius. Default 10.\n1589-- `up?: number`: Extra upward share (0..1): blasts throw things up. Default 0.4.\n1590-\n1591-### interface Field\n1592-\n1593-- `enabled: boolean`","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01G17DdDj3FMZMdRX5U9vW4K","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkgDqoGrnvaij4FfHKgr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017yx7wjgTXLRWx5khU5QzBw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\ncat > src/actors/rig.js <<'EOF'\n// People on the hero rig: one set of compiled clips, split into legs and upper body, shared by everyone.\nimport { THREE, buildModel, compileClips, setLookLayer, HERO_CLIPS, HERO_RIG } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { PEOPLE_CLIPS } from '../art/clips.js';\nconst { AnimationMixer, AnimationClip, LoopOnce, LoopRepeat } = THREE;\nlet CACHE = null;\nfunction clips() {\n  if (CACHE) return CACHE;\n  const sample = buildModel('soldier-a', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n  const all = compileClips([...HERO_CLIPS, ...PEOPLE_CLIPS], { ...HERO_RIG, spine: undefined }, sample);\n  const whole = {}, lower = {}, upper = {};\n  const isLeg = (t) => /^(Pelvis|Leg|Shin|Foot)/.test(t.name);\n  for (const c of all) {\n    whole[c.name] = c;\n    lower[c.name] = new AnimationClip(`${c.name}.lo`, c.duration, c.tracks.filter(isLeg));\n    upper[c.name] = new AnimationClip(`${c.name}.up`, c.duration, c.tracks.filter((t) => !isLeg(t)));\n  }\n  CACHE = { whole, lower, upper };\n  return CACHE;\n}\nexport function makePerson(modelId, palette) {\n  const build = buildModel(modelId, { catalog: MODELS, palette });\n  const object = build.object;\n  setLookLayer(object, 'actors');\n  object.traverse((o) => { if (o.isMesh) { o.castShadow = true; o.receiveShadow = false; } });\n  return { object, anim: new PersonAnim(object), build };\n}\nexport class PersonAnim {\n  lowerName = ''; upperName = ''; one = null;\n  constructor(object) {\n    this.object = object; this.mixer = new AnimationMixer(object); this.c = clips(); this.actions = new Map();\n  }\n  act(kind, name) {\n    const key = `${kind}:${name}`;\n    let a = this.actions.get(key);\n    if (!a) { const clip = this.c[kind][name]; if (!clip) return null; a = this.mixer.clipAction(clip); this.actions.set(key, a); }\n    return a;\n  }\n  /** Lower and upper body on loops; a name for both plays one whole clip. */\n  set(lower, upper = lower, fade = 0.2) {\n    if (lower !== this.lowerName) {\n      const n = this.act('lower', lower), o = this.lowerName && this.act('lower', this.lowerName);\n      if (n) { n.reset().setLoop(LoopRepeat).play(); if (o) o.crossFadeTo(n, fade, false); this.lowerName = lower; }\n    }\n    if (upper !== this.upperName && !this.one) {\n      const n = this.act('upper', upper), o = this.upperName && this.act('upper', this.upperName);\n      if (n) { n.reset().setLoop(LoopRepeat).play(); if (o) o.crossFadeTo(n, fade, false); this.upperName = upper; }\n    } else if (this.one) this.pendingUpper = upper;\n  }\n  /** A one-shot on the upper body, then back to the loop. */\n  shot(name, speed = 1) {\n    const n = this.act('upper', name); if (!n) return;\n    const cur = this.one ?? (this.upperName && this.act('upper', this.upperName));\n    n.reset().setLoop(LoopOnce, 1); n.clampWhenFinished = true; n.timeScale = speed; n.play();\n    if (cur && cur !== n) cur.crossFadeTo(n, 0.05, false);\n    this.one = n; this.oneDur = n.getClip().duration / speed; this.oneT = 0;\n  }\n  speed(lowerRate) { const a = this.lowerName && this.act('lower', this.lowerName); if (a) a.timeScale = lowerRate; }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this.one) {\n      this.oneT += dt;\n      if (this.oneT >= this.oneDur) {\n        const back = this.act('upper', this.pendingUpper ?? this.upperName);\n        if (back) { back.reset().setLoop(LoopRepeat).play(); this.one.crossFadeTo(back, 0.12, false); this.upperName = this.pendingUpper ?? this.upperName; }\n        this.one = null; this.pendingUpper = null;\n      }\n    }\n    this.mixer.update(dt);\n  }\n  stop() { this.mixer.stopAllAction(); this.lowerName = ''; this.upperName = ''; this.one = null; }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/soldier.js <<'EOF'\n// A soldier is data plus an optional view. In a Cash Run client he is a puppet with no brain and no collider.\nimport { THREE, CharacterController, Ragdoll, HERO_RAGDOLL, BehaviorTree, bt, buildModel, setLookLayer } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { TUNING } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { clamp, lerp, wrapAngle, hash2 } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { F } from '../world/fire.js';\nconst { Vector3 } = THREE;\nconst _a = new Vector3(), _b = new Vector3(), _d = new Vector3();\nconst SKINS = ['plum', 'red', 'orange', 'sand'];\nconst FACTIONS = {\n  concord: [{ cloth: 'slate', dark: 'night', hat: 'navy', strap: 'white' }, { cloth: 'slate', dark: 'navy', hat: 'navy', strap: 'white' }, { cloth: 'night', dark: 'slate', hat: 'navy', strap: 'mist' }],\n  harvest: [{ cloth: 'sand', dark: 'red', hat: 'red', strap: 'orange' }, { cloth: 'orange', dark: 'plum', hat: 'red', strap: 'sand' }, { cloth: 'red', dark: 'sand', hat: 'red', strap: 'plum' }],\n  deserter: [{ cloth: 'mist', dark: 'plum', hat: 'night', strap: 'red' }, { cloth: 'slate', dark: 'red', hat: 'orange', strap: 'plum' }],\n};\nconst MODELS_BY_HAT = ['soldier-a', 'soldier-b', 'soldier-c', 'soldier-d'];\nconst HP = { rifle: 70, mg: 110, sniper: 60, rocket: 70, driver: 60 };\nconst SPEED = { rifle: 4.2, mg: 3.4, sniper: 3.8, rocket: 3.6, driver: 4.2 };\n\nfunction makeTree(s) {\n  const b = bt;\n  return new BehaviorTree(b.selector('brain',\n    b.sequence('burn', b.condition('on fire?', (o) => o.burning > 0), b.action('panic', (o, dt) => o.brainBurn(dt))),\n    b.sequence('flee fire', b.condition('fire near?', (o) => o.fireNear()), b.action('crosswind', (o, dt) => o.brainFleeFire(dt))),\n    b.sequence('dodge', b.condition('grenade?', (o) => o.dodgeT > 0), b.action('dodge', (o, dt) => o.brainDodge(dt))),\n    b.sequence('combat', b.condition('alert?', (o) => o.state === 'alert'), b.action('fight', (o, dt) => o.brainCombat(dt))),\n    b.sequence('search', b.condition('searching?', (o) => o.state === 'searching' || o.state === 'suspicious'), b.action('look', (o, dt) => o.brainSearch(dt))),\n    b.action('duty', (o, dt) => o.brainDuty(dt))), s);\n}\nlet NEXT_ID = 1;\nexport class Soldier {\n  kind = 'soldier'; active = false; dead = false; x = 0; y = 0; z = 0; yaw = 0; hp = 70; maxHp = 70; state = 'idle'; suspicion = 0; burning = 0; dodgeT = 0; target = null; lastKnown = null; searchT = 0; fireCool = 0; burstLeft = 0; burstPause = 0; reactT = 0; repositionT = 0; goal = null; path = null; pathI = 0; pathWait = false; moveWanted = 0; aimYaw = 0; jamT = 0; barkCool = 0; sees = false; panicDir = 0; dutyT = 0; sleeping = false; hasRagdoll = false; goalSeat = null;\n  puppet = false;\n  constructor(game, id) { this.game = game; this.id = id ?? NEXT_ID++; }\n  /** Body and view, once, then reused from the pool. */\n  makeBody(ctx) {\n    if (!this.cc) {\n      this.cc = new CharacterController(ctx.physics, { position: [this.x, this.y + 0.1, this.z], radius: 0.32, halfHeight: 0.56, speed: 4, jumpSpeed: 0, gravity: -24 });\n      ctx.physics.tag(this.cc.collider, 'npc');\n      this.game.hitMap.set(this.cc.collider.handle, { kind: 'soldier', ref: this });\n    }\n  }\n  makeView(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.view || !g.views) return;\n    const r = g.rng.look;\n    const pal = r.pick(FACTIONS[this.faction]);\n    const p = makePerson(r.pick(MODELS_BY_HAT), { ...pal, skin: r.pick(SKINS) });\n    const gun = buildModel('npc-rifle', { catalog: MODELS });\n    setLookLayer(gun.object, 'actors');\n    gun.object.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\n    gun.object.position.set(0, -0.08, 0.04);\n    p.object.getObjectByName('HandR').add(gun.object);\n    this.view = p; this.gunObj = gun.object;\n    ctx.scene.add(p.object);\n    this.doll = null;\n  }\n  spawn(ctx, { faction, role = 'rifle', x, z, yaw = 0, squad, duty = 'guard', fixed = false, y }) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.faction = faction; this.role = role; this.squad = squad ?? null; this.duty = duty; this.fixed = fixed;\n    this.x = x; this.z = z; this.y = y ?? g.world.heightAt(x, z); this.yaw = yaw; this.home = { x, z, y: this.y };\n    this.hp = this.maxHp = HP[role] * TUNING.enemyHealth;\n    this.dead = false; this.state = 'idle'; this.suspicion = 0; this.burning = 0; this.dodgeT = 0; this.target = null; this.lastKnown = null; this.goal = null; this.path = null; this.active = true; this.sees = false; this.fireCool = 0; this.jamT = 0; this.dutyT = g.rng.ai.range(0, 3); this.sleeping = false; this.reactT = 0;\n    if (!this.puppet) {\n      this.makeBody(ctx);\n      this.cc.teleport([x, this.y + 0.08, z]);\n      this.cc.speed = SPEED[role];\n      this.cc.collider.setEnabled(true);\n      this.tree = this.tree ?? makeTree(this);\n      this.tree.halt();\n    }\n    this.makeView(ctx);\n    if (this.view) {\n      if (this.doll) { this.doll.disable(); this.doll = null; }\n      this.view.object.visible = true;\n      this.view.object.position.set(x, this.y, z); this.view.object.rotation.set(0, yaw, 0);\n      this.view.anim.stop();\n      this.view.anim.set('Idle', 'Idle');\n      if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = true;\n    }\n    return this;\n  }\n  despawn() {\n    this.active = false;\n    if (this.cc) { this.cc.teleport([this.home?.x ?? 0, -40, this.home?.z ?? 0]); this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false); }\n    if (this.doll) { this.doll.disable(); this.doll = null; }\n    if (this.view) this.view.object.visible = false;\n  }\n  fromBehind(px, pz) {\n    if (this.state === 'alert' && this.sees) return false;\n    const dx = px - this.x, dz = pz - this.z;\n    const d = wrapAngle(Math.atan2(dx, dz) - this.yaw);\n    return Math.abs(d) > 1.8;\n  }\n  hurt(a, who, dir, zone, opts = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.dead) return;\n    const fromPlayer = who === 'player';\n    if (g.dev.oneHit && fromPlayer) a = 9999;\n    this.hp -= a;\n    if (fromPlayer || who?.kind === 'buddy') { this.alertTo(g.player.feet.x, g.player.feet.z, who === 'player' ? 'player' : who); if (this.squad) this.squad.angry = true; }\n    else if (who?.kind === 'soldier' && who.faction !== this.faction) { this.target = who; this.state = 'alert'; }\n    if (g.round) { g.round.onSoldierHurt(this, a, who, opts); }\n    if (this.hp <= 0) { this.die(who, dir, zone, opts); return; }\n    if (this.view && this.reactCool <= 0) { /* flinch at most so often */ }\n    this.view?.anim.shot('HitReact', 1.2);\n    g.voice.bark(this, 'hit');\n    if (this.state !== 'alert') this.state = 'alert';\n  }\n  die(who, dir, zone, opts = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.dead = true;\n    this.burningAtDeath = this.burning > 0;\n    this.burning = 0;\n    if (this.cc) { this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false); }\n    if (this.squad) this.squad.onDeath(this);\n    g.events.emit('kill', this, who, zone);\n    if (who === 'player' || opts.seat != null) { g.ledger.add('paid', 1); }\n    g.voice.bark(this, 'ally-down-near');\n    // Keep a gun on the ground, worn.\n    if (!g.round && this.gunObj && !opts.noDrop) g.actors.dropGun(this);\n    if (this.view) {\n      if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = false;\n      this.view.anim.stop();\n      const vel = dir ? [dir.x * (zone === 'blast' ? 9 : 3.2), (zone === 'blast' ? 5 : 1.2), dir.z * (zone === 'blast' ? 9 : 3.2)] : [0, 1, 0];\n      try {\n        this.doll = new Ragdoll(g.ctx.physics, this.view.object, HERO_RAGDOLL);\n        this.doll.enable({ velocity: vel });\n        this.corpseT = 25;\n      } catch { this.doll = null; this.view.object.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2; }\n    }\n  }\n  ignite() {\n    if (this.dead || this.burning > 0 || this.game.round?.isClient) return;\n    this.burning = 5; this.state = 'burn';\n    this.panicDir = this.game.rng.ai.range(0, 6.28);\n    this.game.events.emit('soldier-burning', this);\n    this.game.voice.bark(this, 'burning');\n    this.view?.anim.set('BurnPanic', 'BurnPanic', 0.1);\n  }\n  alertTo(x, z, tgt) {\n    if (this.dead) return;\n    const was = this.state;\n    this.lastKnown = { x, z };\n    this.state = 'alert';\n    this.suspicion = 1;\n    if (tgt) this.target = tgt;\n    if (was !== 'alert') {\n      this.reactT = TUNING.enemyReaction;\n      this.game.voice.bark(this, 'spotted');\n      if (this.squad) this.squad.share(x, z, this);\n      this.sleeping = false;\n    }\n  }\n  // ---- senses, at 10 Hz ----\n  perceive(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const tgt = g.actors.pickTarget(this);\n    this.sees = false;\n    if (!tgt) { if (this.state === 'alert' && !this.lastKnown) this.state = 'searching'; this.target = null; return; }\n    const tx = tgt.x, tz = tgt.z, ty = tgt.eyeY;\n    const dx = tx - this.x, dz = tz - this.z, dist = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n    const vis = g.actors.visionFor(this, tgt, dist);\n    let seen = false;\n    if (dist < vis && !this.sleeping) {\n      const ang = Math.abs(wrapAngle(Math.atan2(dx, dz) - this.yaw));\n      if (ang < (60 * Math.PI) / 180 || dist < 3 || this.state === 'alert') seen = this.hasLOS(tgt, tx, ty, tz, dist);\n    }\n    this.sees = seen;\n    if (seen) {\n      this.target = tgt.ref ?? tgt;\n      this.targetInfo = tgt;\n      this.lastKnown = { x: tx, z: tz };\n      const rate = lerp(1.6, 0.45, clamp(dist / vis, 0, 1));\n      this.suspicion = clamp(this.suspicion + dt * rate, 0, 1);\n      if (this.suspicion >= 0.34 && this.state === 'idle') { this.state = 'suspicious'; this.searchT = 6; g.voice.bark(this, 'suspicious'); }\n      if (this.suspicion >= 1 && this.state !== 'alert') this.alertTo(tx, tz, tgt.ref ?? tgt);\n      if (this.state === 'alert') this.lastSeenT = 0;\n    } else {\n      if (this.state !== 'alert') this.suspicion = clamp(this.suspicion - dt * 0.12, 0, 1);\n      this.lastSeenT = (this.lastSeenT ?? 0) + dt;\n      if (this.state === 'alert' && this.lastSeenT > 6) { this.state = 'searching'; this.searchT = 20; g.voice.bark(this, 'lost'); }\n    }\n  }\n  hasLOS(tgt, tx, ty, tz, dist) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    _a.set(this.x, this.y + (this.crouchAim ? 1.1 : 1.5), this.z);\n    _d.set(tx - _a.x, ty - _a.y, tz - _a.z); const l = _d.length() || 1; _d.multiplyScalar(1 / l);\n    const hit = g.ctx.physics.castRay(_a, _d, l + 0.3, [], this.cc?.body);\n    if (!hit) return true;\n    const ent = g.hitMap.get(hit.collider.handle);\n    if (ent && (ent.kind === tgt.kind || ent.ref === tgt.ref || ent.kind === 'vehicle' && tgt.inVehicle)) return true;\n    return hit.distance >= l - 0.5;\n  }\n  fireNear() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.fixed) return false;\n    if (this.fireCheckT > 0) return this.fireIsNear;\n    this.fireCheckT = 0.5;\n    this.fireIsNear = false;\n    const wx = g.wind.x, wz = g.wind.z;\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 2; i++) {\n      if (g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x - wx * 5 * i, this.z - wz * 5 * i) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x + 5 * i, this.z) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x - 5 * i, this.z) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z + 5 * i) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z - 5 * i)) { this.fireIsNear = true; break; }\n    }\n    if (g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z)) this.ignite();\n    return this.fireIsNear;\n  }\n  // ---- brain actions, at 10 Hz ----\n  brainBurn(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.burning -= dt;\n    this.panicDir += g.rng.ai.range(-1.1, 1.1) * dt * 4;\n    this.goal = null; this.steerDir = this.panicDir; this.moveWanted = 6.5;\n    this.yaw = this.panicDir;\n    if (this.burnLight == null) this.burnLight = 1;\n    // Spread fire to the cells crossed.\n    const id = g.fire.idOf(this.x, this.z);\n    if (id >= 0 && g.fire.state[id] === 0 && g.fire.fuel[id] > 0) g.fire.lightCell(id, 'spread');\n    if (this.burnBark === undefined || (this.burnBark -= dt) <= 0) { this.burnBark = 1.2; g.voice.bark(this, 'burning'); }\n    this.hp -= (this.maxHp / 5) * dt;\n    if (this.burning <= 0 || this.hp <= 0) { this.hp = 0; this.die(this.lastFireBy ?? 'fire', null, 'fire'); }\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainFleeFire(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.state = this.state === 'idle' ? 'suspicious' : this.state;\n    // Crosswind, away from the flames.\n    const a = g.wind.dir + Math.PI / 2 * (this.id % 2 ? 1 : -1);\n    this.steerDir = Math.atan2(Math.cos(a), Math.sin(a));\n    this.goal = null; this.moveWanted = 6.2;\n    this.yaw = this.steerDir;\n    if (g.rng.ai.chance(dt * 0.5)) g.voice.bark(this, 'fire');\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainDodge(dt) {\n    this.dodgeT -= dt; this.goal = null; this.moveWanted = 6; this.steerDir = this.dodgeDir ?? 0; return 'running';\n  }\n  brainCombat(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const tgt = this.targetInfo;\n    const lk = this.lastKnown ?? (tgt ? { x: tgt.x, z: tgt.z } : null);\n    if (!lk) { this.state = 'searching'; this.searchT = 12; return 'running'; }\n    const dx = lk.x - this.x, dz = lk.z - this.z, dist = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n    this.aimYaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n    this.reactT -= dt;\n    this.repositionT -= dt;\n    if (this.jamT > 0) { this.jamT -= dt; this.moveWanted = 0; this.goal = null; return 'running'; }\n    // Move: cover first, re-position every 4 to 8 s; one flanks.\n    if (!this.fixed && this.repositionT <= 0) {\n      this.repositionT = g.rng.ai.range(4, 8);\n      const flank = this.squad && this.squad.flanker === this;\n      if (flank) {\n        const side = this.id % 2 ? 1 : -1, nx = dz / (dist || 1), nz = -dx / (dist || 1);\n        this.setGoal(lk.x + nx * side * 18 - (dx / (dist || 1)) * 14, lk.z + nz * side * 18 - (dz / (dist || 1)) * 14);\n      } else {\n        const c = g.actors.nearestCover(this, lk);\n        if (c) this.setGoal(c.x, c.z);\n        else if (dist > 28) this.setGoal(this.x + (dx / dist) * 12 + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6), this.z + (dz / dist) * 12 + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6));\n        else this.setGoal(this.x + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6), this.z + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6));\n      }\n    }\n    this.moveWanted = this.goal ? (this.role === 'mg' ? 3 : 4.6) : 0;\n    // Shoot: bursts of 3 to 5.\n    this.yaw = this.aimYaw;\n    if (this.sees && this.reactT <= 0 && !g.noShooting) {\n      if (this.burstLeft > 0) { /* fixedUpdate fires */ }\n      else if ((this.burstPause -= dt) <= 0) {\n        this.burstLeft = this.role === 'mg' ? g.rng.ai.int(6, 10) : this.role === 'sniper' ? 1 : g.rng.ai.int(3, 5);\n        this.burstPause = this.role === 'sniper' ? g.rng.ai.range(2.4, 4) : g.rng.ai.range(0.9, 2);\n        if (this.role === 'rocket' && g.rng.ai.chance(0.5)) { this.fireRocket(); this.burstLeft = 0; this.burstPause = 6; }\n      }\n    }\n    if (dist < 25 && !this.sees && this.goal == null) this.setGoal(lk.x, lk.z);\n    this.view?.anim.set(this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'Run' : 'Idle', this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'AimWalk' : 'AimIdle');\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainSearch(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.searchT -= dt;\n    if (this.lastKnown && !this.goal && !this.fixed) {\n      const d = Math.hypot(this.lastKnown.x - this.x, this.lastKnown.z - this.z);\n      if (d > 3) this.setGoal(this.lastKnown.x, this.lastKnown.z);\n      else this.lastKnown = null;\n    }\n    this.moveWanted = this.goal ? 2.6 : 0;\n    if (!this.goal) this.yaw += Math.sin(g.time * 0.6 + this.id) * dt * 1.2;\n    if (this.searchT <= 0) { this.state = 'idle'; this.suspicion = 0; this.lastKnown = null; this.goal = null; g.voice.bark(this, 'giveup'); }\n    this.view?.anim.set(this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'Walk' : 'Idle', 'AimIdle');\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainDuty(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.dutyT -= dt;\n    const night = g.clock.isNight();\n    if (this.duty === 'march') {\n      if (this.marchTo && !this.goal) { if (Math.hypot(this.marchTo.x - this.x, this.marchTo.z - this.z) > 5) this.setGoal(this.marchTo.x, this.marchTo.z); else { this.marchTo = null; this.duty = 'guard'; } }\n      this.moveWanted = 4.2;\n      this.view?.anim.set('Run', 'AimWalk');\n      return 'running';\n    }\n    if (this.dutyT <= 0) {\n      this.dutyT = g.rng.ai.range(4, 10);\n      this.sleeping = false;\n      if (this.duty === 'patrol' && !this.fixed) {\n        const a = g.rng.ai.range(0, 6.28), r = g.rng.ai.range(6, 26);\n        this.setGoal(this.home.x + Math.cos(a) * r, this.home.z + Math.sin(a) * r);\n      } else if (!this.fixed && night && g.rng.ai.chance(0.25)) { this.sleeping = true; this.dutyT = 30; }\n      else this.yawGoal = g.rng.ai.range(-3.14, 3.14);\n    }\n    if (this.yawGoal != null) this.yaw += wrapAngle(this.yawGoal - this.yaw) * Math.min(1, dt * 1.5);\n    this.moveWanted = this.goal ? 1.6 : 0;\n    if (this.view) {\n      if (this.sleeping) this.view.anim.set('Sleep', 'Sleep');\n      else if (this.moveWanted > 0) this.view.anim.set('Walk', 'Walk');\n      else this.view.anim.set('Idle', 'Idle');\n    }\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  setGoal(x, z) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.goal = { x, z };\n    this.path = null; this.pathI = 0;\n    if (Math.hypot(x - this.x, z - this.z) > 14 && !g.world.nav.lineOfSight(this.x, this.z, x, z)) g.actors.requestPath(this);\n  }\n  // ---- per fixed step: legs and trigger ----\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.dead || !this.active || this.puppet) return;\n    this.fireCheckT = (this.fireCheckT ?? 0) - dt;\n    // Steering.\n    const mv = _d.set(0, 0, 0);\n    if (this.moveWanted > 0) {\n      let dirx = 0, dirz = 0;\n      if (this.goal) {\n        let tx = this.goal.x, tz = this.goal.z;\n        if (this.path && this.pathI < this.path.length) { const p = this.path[this.pathI]; tx = p[0]; tz = p[2]; if (Math.hypot(tx - this.x, tz - this.z) < 1.6) this.pathI++; }\n        const dx = tx - this.x, dz = tz - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n        if (Math.hypot(this.goal.x - this.x, this.goal.z - this.z) < 1.5) { this.goal = null; this.path = null; }\n        else if (l > 0.01) { dirx = dx / l; dirz = dz / l; }\n        if (this.state !== 'alert') this.yaw = Math.atan2(dirx, dirz);\n      } else if (this.steerDir != null) { dirx = Math.sin(this.steerDir); dirz = Math.cos(this.steerDir); }\n      mv.set(dirx, 0, dirz);\n      this.cc.speed = this.moveWanted;\n    }\n    // Stuck in water? He goes round.\n    if (g.ground.isWater(this.x + mv.x * 2, this.z + mv.z * 2) && !g.ground.isFord(this.x, this.z) && !g.world.nav.walkable(this.x + mv.x * 2, this.z + mv.z * 2)) mv.set(0, 0, 0);\n    this.cc.setInput(mv, false, false);\n    this.cc.fixedUpdate(dt);\n    const f = this.cc.feet;\n    this.x = f.x; this.y = f.y; this.z = f.z;\n    // Trigger.\n    this.fireCool -= dt;\n    if (this.burstLeft > 0 && this.fireCool <= 0) this.shootOnce();\n    // Burning in burning grass.\n    if (this.burning > 0 && g.tick % 12 === 0) ctx.particles.burst('vehicle-flame', [this.x, this.y + 1, this.z], { count: 3 });\n  }\n  shootOnce() {\n    const g = this.game, tgt = this.targetInfo;\n    if (!tgt || this.jamT > 0) { this.burstLeft = 0; return; }\n    this.burstLeft--;\n    this.fireCool = this.role === 'mg' ? 0.09 : this.role === 'sniper' ? 0.6 : 0.13;\n    const ox = this.x, oy = this.y + 1.42, oz = this.z;\n    const dx = tgt.x - ox, dy = tgt.y + 1 - oy, dz = tgt.z - oz, dist = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n    const moving = tgt.fast ? 1.4 : 1;\n    const errDeg = (lerp(1.2, 5, clamp(dist / 80, 0, 1.4)) / TUNING.enemyAccuracy) * moving * (this.role === 'sniper' ? 0.45 : 1);\n    const e = (errDeg * Math.PI) / 180, r = g.rng.ai;\n    const yaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz) + r.range(-e, e), pitch = Math.atan2(dy, dist) + r.range(-e, e);\n    const cx = Math.sin(yaw) * Math.cos(pitch), cy = Math.sin(pitch), cz = Math.cos(yaw) * Math.cos(pitch);\n    const hit = g.damage.bullet(ox + cx * 0.5, oy, oz + cz * 0.5, cx, cy, cz, this.role === 'sniper' ? 300 : 180, this.role === 'mg' ? 11 : this.role === 'sniper' ? 26 : 9, this);\n    g.fx.tracer(ox + cx * 0.6, oy, oz + cz * 0.6, ox + cx * (hit?.distance ?? 100), oy + cy * (hit?.distance ?? 100), oz + cz * (hit?.distance ?? 100));\n    if (dist < 240) g.sfx.at(this.role === 'mg' ? 'gun-mg-far' : 'gun-tractor-far', ox, oz, { max: 280, volume: 0.9 });\n    this.view?.anim.shot('FireRecoil', 1);\n    // Whip past the ear.\n    if (hit && g.hasPlayer) { const pd = Math.hypot(hit.x - g.player.feet.x, hit.z - g.player.feet.z); if (pd < 5 && r.chance(0.5)) g.sfx.play('bullet-whip', { volume: 0.5, pitch: r.range(-3, 3) }); }\n    // His gun jams too: an opening for you.\n    if (r.chance(0.012)) { this.burstLeft = 0; this.jamT = r.range(2.2, 3.6); this.view?.anim.shot('UnjamSwear'); g.voice.bark(this, 'jammed'); g.sfx.at('gun-jam', ox, oz, { max: 40 }); g.events.emit('soldier-jam', this); }\n    if (r.chance(0.02) && this.goal == null) g.voice.bark(this, 'fighting');\n  }\n  fireRocket() {\n    const g = this.game, tgt = this.targetInfo;\n    if (!tgt) return;\n    const ox = this.x, oy = this.y + 1.5, oz = this.z;\n    g.projectiles.spawn('soldier_rocket', ox, oy, oz, tgt.x - ox, tgt.y + 1 - oy, tgt.z - oz, this);\n    g.sfx.at('gun-tube', ox, oz, { max: 300 });\n    this.view?.anim.shot('FireRecoil', 0.6);\n  }\n  /** Per frame: pose. Puppets take theirs from snapshots. */\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    if (!this.active) return;\n    const view = this.view;\n    if (!view) return;\n    if (this.dead) {\n      if (this.doll) {\n        this.doll.sync();\n        this.corpseT -= dt;\n        if (this.corpseT <= 0 && this.doll.active) this.doll.disable();\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n    const alpha = ctx.physics.alpha;\n    if (this.cc && !this.puppet) { const f = this.cc.interpolatedFeet(alpha); view.object.position.set(f.x, f.y, f.z); }\n    else view.object.position.set(this.x, this.y, this.z);\n    view.object.rotation.y = this.yaw;\n    const moving = this.moveWanted;\n    if (moving > 0) view.anim.speed(moving > 4 ? moving / 6.5 : moving / 2.2); else view.anim.speed(1);\n    if (Math.hypot(this.x - this.game.camPos.x, this.z - this.game.camPos.z) < 160) view.anim.update(dt);\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/actors.js <<'EOF'\n// Everyone who walks: squads by site with a simulation bubble, buddies, civilians, fauna, ground guns, the nav queue.\nimport { THREE, Boids, buildModel, compileClips, setLookLayer, InstancedBodies } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { TUNING } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { SITES, POSTS } from '../content/sites.js';\nimport { Soldier } from './soldier.js';\nimport { Buddy, BUDDIES } from './buddy.js';\nimport { Civilians } from './civilian.js';\nimport { Fauna } from './fauna.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { clamp, lerp, hash2, wrapAngle } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { WEAPONS } from '../content/weapons.js';\nconst { Vector3 } = THREE;\nconst BUBBLE = 260, BUBBLE_OUT = 300;\nexport class Squad {\n  members = []; angry = false; alive = 0; flanker = null; clearedAt = null; live = false; alertUntil = 0;\n  constructor(game, key, def) { this.game = game; this.key = key; this.def = def; this.alive = def.n; }\n  share(x, z, from) {\n    for (const m of this.members) {\n      if (m === from || m.dead || !m.active) continue;\n      if (m.state !== 'alert') { m.lastKnown = { x, z }; m.state = 'searching'; m.searchT = 20; m.sleeping = false; if (Math.hypot(m.x - x, m.z - z) < 70) { m.state = 'alert'; m.reactT = TUNING.enemyReaction + 0.4; m.targetInfo = from.targetInfo; } }\n      else m.lastKnown = { x, z };\n    }\n    this.flanker = this.flanker && !this.flanker.dead ? this.flanker : (this.members.find((m) => !m.dead && m !== from && m.role === 'rifle') ?? null);\n  }\n  onDeath(s) {\n    this.alive = Math.max(0, this.alive - 1);\n    if (this.alive === 0) { this.clearedAt = this.game.clock.abs; this.game.events.emit('squad-cleared', this.key, this); }\n  }\n}\nexport class Actors {\n  soldiers = []; pool = []; squads = new Map(); buddies = []; pathQueue = []; dropped = []; heardT = 0; extra = [];\n  scriptedFeverHold = false; bubbleT = 0; nearbyCoverT = 0;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; this.civilians = new Civilians(game); this.fauna = new Fauna(game); }\n  build(ctx) {\n    for (const [key, s] of Object.entries(SITES)) if (s.squad) this.addSquadDef(key, { ...s.squad, at: s.at, tower: s.squad.tower, site: s });\n    for (const [key, p] of Object.entries(POSTS)) this.addSquadDef(key, { faction: p.faction, n: p.n, at: p.at, post: p, yaw: p.yaw });\n    for (const b of Object.keys(BUDDIES)) this.buddies.push(new Buddy(this.game, b));\n    this.civilians.build(ctx);\n    this.fauna.build(ctx);\n  }\n  addSquadDef(key, def) { const sq = new Squad(this.game, key, def); this.squads.set(key, sq); return sq; }\n  reset() {\n    for (const s of this.soldiers) s.despawn();\n    this.pool.push(...this.soldiers); this.soldiers.length = 0;\n    for (const sq of this.squads.values()) { sq.members = []; sq.alive = sq.def.n; sq.clearedAt = null; sq.live = false; sq.angry = false; sq.disabled = false; sq.forceLive = false; }\n    this.pathQueue.length = 0;\n    for (const d of this.dropped) { this.game.ctx.scene.remove(d.object); this.game.interact.remove(d.usable); }\n    this.dropped.length = 0;\n    for (const b of this.buddies) b.resetAll();\n    this.civilians.reset();\n    this.fauna.reset();\n  }\n  /** Hand back a soldier from the pool. */\n  makeSoldier(ctx, o) {\n    const s = this.pool.pop() ?? new Soldier(this.game);\n    this.soldiers.push(s);\n    s.spawn(ctx, o);\n    return s;\n  }\n  release(s) {\n    s.despawn();\n    const i = this.soldiers.indexOf(s);\n    if (i >= 0) this.soldiers.splice(i, 1);\n    this.pool.push(s);\n  }\n  // ---- the bubble ----\n  squadOrigin(sq) { return sq.def.at; }\n  liveSquad(ctx, sq) {\n    sq.live = true;\n    const def = sq.def, g = this.game;\n    const [cx, cz] = def.at;\n    const r = g.rng.ai;\n    const count = sq.alive;\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      const a = (i / Math.max(1, count)) * Math.PI * 2 + r.range(-0.4, 0.4), rad = def.post ? r.range(3, 8) : r.range(6, Math.max(10, (def.site?.r ?? 20) * 0.5));\n      let x = cx + Math.cos(a) * rad, z = cz + Math.sin(a) * rad;\n      if (!g.world.nav.walkable(x, z)) { x = cx + r.range(-2, 2); z = cz + r.range(-2, 2); }\n      let role = 'rifle';\n      const opts = {};\n      if (def.tower && i === 0) { role = 'sniper'; opts.fixed = true; x = cx + def.tower[0]; z = cz + def.tower[1]; opts.y = g.world.heightAt(x, z) + 4.6; }\n      else if (i === count - 1 && count >= 5) role = 'mg';\n      else if (i === 2 && count >= 8) role = 'rocket';\n      const s = this.makeSoldier(ctx, { faction: def.faction, role, x, z, yaw: r.range(-3, 3), squad: sq, duty: def.duty ?? (i % 3 === 2 ? 'patrol' : 'guard'), ...opts });\n      sq.members.push(s);\n    }\n    sq.flanker = sq.members.find((m) => m.role === 'rifle') ?? null;\n    g.events.emit('squad-live', sq.key);\n  }\n  sleepSquad(sq) {\n    for (const m of sq.members) if (m.active) this.release(m);\n    sq.members = [];\n    sq.live = false;\n  }\n  updateBubble(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.round?.isClient) return;\n    const f = g.anchor();\n    for (const sq of this.squads.values()) {\n      if (sq.disabled) { if (sq.live) this.sleepSquad(sq); continue; }\n      if (sq.def.when && !sq.def.when()) { if (sq.live) this.sleepSquad(sq); continue; }\n      const [cx, cz] = sq.def.at, d = Math.hypot(cx - f.x, cz - f.z);\n      if (!sq.live && (d < BUBBLE || sq.forceLive) && sq.alive > 0) this.liveSquad(ctx, sq);\n      else if (sq.live && d > BUBBLE_OUT && !sq.forceLive) this.sleepSquad(sq);\n      // A cleared post re-mans after postRemanHours; the source's instant respawn is an annoyance we do not copy.\n      if (sq.alive === 0 && sq.clearedAt != null && !sq.def.noReman && g.clock.abs - sq.clearedAt >= TUNING.postRemanHours && d > 120) {\n        if (sq.def.post || sq.def.remans) { sq.alive = sq.def.n; sq.clearedAt = null; if (sq.live) this.sleepSquad(sq); g.events.emit('squad-remanned', sq.key); }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // ---- targets and senses ----\n  playerInfo() {\n    const g = this.game, f = g.player.feet;\n    return { kind: 'player', ref: 'player', x: f.x, y: f.y, z: f.z, eyeY: f.y + (g.player.stance === 'crouch' ? 0.9 : 1.45), fast: g.player.speedNow > 5, inVehicle: !!g.player.seat };\n  }\n  /** Who this soldier is angry at right now: the player, a buddy, the other army when the truce is over. */\n  pickTarget(s) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (s.pickT > 0 && s.cachedTarget) { s.pickT -= 0.1; if (s.cachedTarget.refresh) s.cachedTarget.refresh(); return s.cachedTarget; }\n    s.pickT = 0.5;\n    let best = null, bd = 1e9;\n    if (g.round) {\n      for (const m of g.round.liveMercs()) {\n        const d = Math.hypot(m.x - s.x, m.z - s.z);\n        if (d < bd) { bd = d; best = m.targetInfo(); }\n      }\n      s.cachedTarget = best;\n      return best;\n    }\n    if (g.hasPlayer && this.hostileToPlayer(s) && !g.dev.invisible) {\n      const p = this.playerInfo();\n      bd = Math.hypot(p.x - s.x, p.z - s.z); best = p;\n      best.refresh = () => { const q = this.playerInfo(); Object.assign(best, q); };\n    }\n    for (const b of this.buddies) {\n      if (!b.active || b.dead || b.isDown) continue;\n      const d = Math.hypot(b.x - s.x, b.z - s.z);\n      if (d < bd && d < 60) { bd = d; best = b.targetInfo(); }\n    }\n    if (g.story.war) {\n      for (const o of this.soldiers) {\n        if (!o.active || o.dead || o.faction === s.faction) continue;\n        const d = Math.hypot(o.x - s.x, o.z - s.z);\n        if (d < bd && d < 80) { bd = d; const w = o; best = { kind: 'soldier', ref: w, x: w.x, y: w.y, z: w.z, eyeY: w.y + 1.4, fast: false, refresh() { this.x = w.x; this.y = w.y; this.z = w.z; this.eyeY = w.y + 1.4; } }; }\n      }\n    }\n    s.cachedTarget = best;\n    return best;\n  }\n  hostileToPlayer(s) {\n    const g = this.game, f = g.player.feet;\n    // Inside Mile Forty, while the truce holds, nobody shoots.\n    if (g.story.truce && Math.hypot(f.x - SITES['mile-forty'].at[0], f.z - SITES['mile-forty'].at[1]) < SITES['mile-forty'].noFire) return false;\n    if (g.story.pass === s.faction && !s.squad?.angry) {\n      const inner = this.innerYard(s.faction);\n      if (inner && Math.hypot(f.x - inner.x, f.z - inner.z) < inner.r) return true;\n      return false;\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n  innerYard(faction) {\n    const site = faction === 'concord' ? SITES['fort-clement'] : faction === 'harvest' ? SITES.granary : null;\n    return site ? { x: site.at[0], z: site.at[1], r: site.inner } : null;\n  }\n  visionFor(s, tgt, dist) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    let v = TUNING.enemyVision * (s.role === 'sniper' ? 1.8 : 1);\n    if (tgt.kind === 'player') {\n      const p = g.player;\n      if (p.stance === 'crouch') v *= 0.55;\n      if (p.inGrass && g.ground.kindAt(p.feet.x, p.feet.z) !== 1) v *= p.stance === 'crouch' || !p.moving ? 0.6 : 0.85;\n      if (g.clock.isNight()) { v *= 0.45; if (g.time < p.litUntil || g.body.burning > 0 || g.fireView.nearestDist < 30) v *= 2; }\n    } else if (g.clock.isNight()) v *= 0.6;\n    return v;\n  }\n  /** A shot rings out: everyone inside the radius wakes. */\n  heardGunshot(x, z, radius, who) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    for (const s of this.soldiers) {\n      if (!s.active || s.dead) continue;\n      const d = Math.hypot(s.x - x, s.z - z);\n      if (d > radius) continue;\n      s.sleeping = false;\n      if (who === 'player' && s.squad && g.story.pass === s.faction && d < 60) s.squad.angry = true;\n      if (s.state === 'idle' || s.state === 'suspicious') { s.state = 'searching'; s.searchT = 20; s.lastKnown = { x: x + g.rng.ai.range(-12, 12), z: z + g.rng.ai.range(-12, 12) }; if (s.barkCool <= 0) { g.voice.bark(s, 'heard'); s.barkCool = 5; } }\n      else if (s.state === 'searching') s.lastKnown = { x: x + g.rng.ai.range(-8, 8), z: z + g.rng.ai.range(-8, 8) };\n    }\n    this.civilians.heard(x, z, radius);\n    this.fauna.scare(x, z, radius);\n  }\n  nearestCover(s, from) {\n    const list = s.squad?.def.site?.cover;\n    const g = this.game;\n    let best = null, bd = 1e9;\n    if (list) {\n      const [cx, cz] = s.squad.def.at;\n      for (const [dx, dz] of list) {\n        const x = cx + dx, z = cz + dz, d = Math.hypot(x - s.x, z - s.z);\n        if (d < bd) { bd = d; best = { x, z }; }\n      }\n    }\n    if (best && bd < 28) {\n      // Stand on the far side from the threat.\n      const ax = best.x - from.x, az = best.z - from.z, l = Math.hypot(ax, az) || 1;\n      return { x: best.x + (ax / l) * 1.4, z: best.z + (az / l) * 1.4 };\n    }\n    for (const t of g.treeColliders) {\n      const d = Math.hypot(t.x - s.x, t.z - s.z);\n      if (d < 12 && d < bd) { bd = d; const ax = t.x - from.x, az = t.z - from.z, l = Math.hypot(ax, az) || 1; best = { x: t.x + (ax / l) * 1.2, z: t.z + (az / l) * 1.2 }; }\n    }\n    return best;\n  }\n  requestPath(s) { if (!this.pathQueue.includes(s)) this.pathQueue.push(s); }\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    // Paths: at most 2 per step.\n    for (let i = 0; i < 2 && this.pathQueue.length; i++) {\n      const s = this.pathQueue.shift();\n      if (s.dead || !s.active || !s.goal) continue;\n      s.path = g.world.nav.path([s.x, s.y, s.z], [s.goal.x, s.y, s.goal.z]);\n      s.pathI = 1;\n      if (!s.path) { s.goal = null; }\n    }\n    // Brains at 10 Hz, spread across steps.\n    const tick = g.tick;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.soldiers.length; i++) {\n      const s = this.soldiers[i];\n      if (!s.active || s.dead || s.puppet) continue;\n      if ((tick + s.id) % 6 === 0) {\n        s.barkCool -= 0.1;\n        if (!s.burning) s.perceive(0.1);\n        s.tree.tick(0.1);\n      }\n      s.fixedUpdate(ctx, dt);\n    }\n    for (const b of this.buddies) b.fixedUpdate(ctx, dt);\n    this.civilians.fixedUpdate(ctx, dt);\n    if (tick % 30 === 0) this.updateBubble(ctx);\n    if (tick % 60 === 7) this.tidyCorpses();\n  }\n  tidyCorpses() {\n    const f = this.game.anchor();\n    // Corpses far outside the bubble go back to the pool.\n    for (let i = this.soldiers.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      const s = this.soldiers[i];\n      if (s.dead && !s.squad?.live && Math.hypot(s.x - f.x, s.z - f.z) > 200) this.release(s);\n    }\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    for (const s of this.soldiers) s.update(ctx, dt);\n    for (const b of this.buddies) b.update(ctx, dt);\n    this.civilians.update(ctx, dt);\n    this.fauna.update(ctx, dt);\n    for (const d of this.dropped) if (d.object) d.object.rotation.y += 0;\n  }\n  /** A gun off the ground starts at condition 20 to 55. */\n  dropGun(s) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.dropped.length > 14) { const old = this.dropped.shift(); g.ctx.scene.remove(old.object); g.interact.remove(old.usable); }\n    const id = g.rng.ai.chance(0.82) ? 'tractor' : g.rng.ai.chance(0.5) ? 'mule' : 'm38';\n    const cond = g.rng.ai.int(20, 55);\n    const x = s.x + g.rng.ai.range(-0.5, 0.5), z = s.z + g.rng.ai.range(-0.5, 0.5), y = g.world.heightAt(x, z);\n    const build = buildModel('ground-gun', { catalog: MODELS });\n    build.object.position.set(x, y + 0.02, z); build.object.rotation.y = g.rng.ai.range(0, 6.28);\n    setLookLayer(build.object, 'actors');\n    g.ctx.scene.add(build.object);\n    const d = { object: build.object, id, cond };\n    d.usable = g.interact.add({ x, y: y + 0.2, z, r: 2, verb: () => `TAKE THE ${WEAPONS[id].name}`, when: () => !g.player.seat, onUse: () => { g.weapons.give(id, cond, true); g.ctx.scene.remove(build.object); g.interact.remove(d.usable); this.dropped.splice(this.dropped.indexOf(d), 1); g.sfx.play('gun-equip'); g.events.emit('pickup-gun', id); } });\n    this.dropped.push(d);\n  }\n  // ---- buddies ----\n  buddy(id) { return this.buddies.find((b) => b.id === id); }\n  rescuer() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    return this.buddies.find((b) => b.met && !b.dead && g.clock.abs >= b.spentUntil && g.clock.abs >= b.woundedUntil) ?? null;\n  }\n  startRescue(b) { b.rescue(); }\n  liveBuddies() { return this.buddies.filter((b) => b.met && !b.dead); }\n  anyStateCounts() { let live = 0; for (const s of this.soldiers) if (s.active && !s.dead) live++; return live; }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/buddy.js <<'EOF'\n// Hired friends: a named person with trust, a rescue, an alternate plan, and an end. The same brain walks the Cash Run's hired guns.\nimport { THREE, CharacterController, buildModel, setLookLayer } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { TUNING } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { clamp, wrapAngle } from '../core/rng.js';\nconst { Vector3 } = THREE;\nexport const BUDDIES = {\n  ines: { id: 'ines', name: 'INES', model: 'ines', perk: 'range', voice: 'ines', rescueR: 500 },\n  dov: { id: 'dov', name: 'DOV', model: 'dov', perk: 'charges', voice: 'dov', rescueR: 300 },\n  mags: { id: 'mags', name: 'MAGS', model: 'mags', perk: 'medic', voice: 'mags', rescueR: 300 },\n  pell: { id: 'pell', name: 'PELL', model: 'pell', perk: 'none', voice: 'pell', rescueR: 0, guide: true },\n};\nexport class Buddy {\n  kind = 'buddy'; met = false; dead = false; trust = 0; spentUntil = 0; woundedUntil = 0; active = false; hp = 200; isDown = false; downT = 0; burningDown = false; x = 0; y = 0; z = 0; yaw = 0; goal = null; fireCool = 0; following = true; burstLeft = 0; burstPause = 0; moveWanted = 0;\n  constructor(game, id) { this.game = game; this.id = id; this.def = BUDDIES[id]; }\n  get name() { return this.def.name; }\n  resetAll() { this.met = false; this.dead = false; this.trust = 0; this.spentUntil = 0; this.woundedUntil = 0; this.despawn(); }\n  targetInfo() { const b = this; return { kind: 'buddy', ref: this, x: b.x, y: b.y, z: b.z, eyeY: b.y + 1.45, fast: false, refresh() { this.x = b.x; this.y = b.y; this.z = b.z; this.eyeY = b.y + 1.45; } }; }\n  makeBody(ctx) {\n    if (this.cc) return;\n    this.cc = new CharacterController(ctx.physics, { position: [this.x, this.y + 0.1, this.z], radius: 0.32, halfHeight: 0.56, speed: 5, jumpSpeed: 0, gravity: -24 });\n    ctx.physics.tag(this.cc.collider, 'npc');\n    this.game.hitMap.set(this.cc.collider.handle, { kind: 'buddy', ref: this });\n  }\n  makeView(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.view || !g.views) return;\n    const p = makePerson(this.def.model);\n    const gun = buildModel('npc-rifle', { catalog: MODELS });\n    setLookLayer(gun.object, 'actors');\n    gun.object.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2; gun.object.position.set(0, -0.08, 0.04);\n    p.object.getObjectByName('HandR').add(gun.object);\n    this.view = p; this.gunObj = gun.object;\n    ctx.scene.add(p.object);\n  }\n  /** Put them in the world, fighting beside you. */\n  spawn(ctx, x, z, { hp = 200, goal = null, following = true } = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.x = x; this.z = z; this.y = g.world.heightAt(x, z); this.hp = hp; this.maxHp = hp; this.isDown = false; this.active = true; this.goal = goal; this.following = following; this.burningDown = false; this.downT = 0;\n    this.makeBody(ctx);\n    this.cc.collider.setEnabled(true);\n    this.cc.teleport([x, this.y + 0.1, z]);\n    this.makeView(ctx);\n    if (this.view) { this.view.object.visible = true; this.view.anim.stop(); this.view.anim.set('Idle', 'AimIdle'); if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = true; }\n    g.events.emit('buddy-spawned', this.id);\n  }\n  despawn() {\n    this.active = false; this.isDown = false;\n    if (this.cc) { this.cc.teleport([this.x, -40, this.z]); this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false); }\n    if (this.view) this.view.object.visible = false;\n    if (this.usable) { this.game.interact.remove(this.usable); this.usable = null; }\n  }\n  hurt(a, who) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.isDown || this.dead || !this.active || g.dev.god) return;\n    this.hp -= a;\n    if (this.hp <= 0) this.goDown(false);\n  }\n  /** At 0 they fall, wounded, for 40 s. At their side, Syrette or Finish It. If they are burning they ask you to finish it. */\n  goDown(burning) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.isDown = true; this.downT = 40; this.burningDown = burning; this.hp = 0;\n    this.view?.anim.set('WoundedSit', 'WoundedSit', 0.15);\n    if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = false;\n    g.say(this.id, burning ? \"DON'T LET IT BE THE FIRE. PLEASE. NOT THE FIRE.\" : `${this.name} IS DOWN.`, 4);\n    g.events.emit('buddy-down', this, burning);\n    this.usable = g.interact.add({ x: this.x, y: this.y + 0.8, z: this.z, r: 2.6, wide: true, marker: true, buddy: this,\n      verb: () => (g.body.syrettes > 0 ? 'SYRETTE' : 'NO SYRETTES'), altVerb: () => 'FINISH IT',\n      enabled: () => g.body.syrettes > 0,\n      onUse: () => this.saved(), onAlt: () => this.finish() });\n  }\n  saved() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.body.syrettes <= 0) return;\n    g.body.syrettes--;\n    this.isDown = false; this.hp = this.maxHp * 0.5; this.trust++;\n    if (this.usable) { g.interact.remove(this.usable); this.usable = null; }\n    this.view?.anim.set('Idle', 'AimIdle');\n    if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = true;\n    g.sfx.play('syrette');\n    g.say(this.id, g.dialogue.pick(`${this.id}.saved`), 4);\n    g.ledger.note('saved', this.id);\n    g.events.emit('buddy-saved', this);\n  }\n  finish() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.vm.showProp('p-finish');\n    g.vm.play('FinishIt', { onEnd: () => g.vm.showGun(g.weapons.gun?.id ?? 'cane', false) });\n    g.after(0.85, () => { g.sfx.play('gun-m38'); g.ctx.engine.shake.add(0.2); g.rumble(0.7, 0.15); this.killed('mercy'); });\n  }\n  killed(how) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.dead = true; this.isDown = false;\n    if (this.usable) { g.interact.remove(this.usable); this.usable = null; }\n    if (this.view) { this.view.anim.set('LieIdle', 'LieIdle', 0.3); }\n    if (this.cc) this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false);\n    g.ledger.add('friends', 1);\n    g.ledger.note('friend', this.id, how);\n    g.events.emit('buddy-dead', this, how);\n    g.world.nameOnWall?.(this);\n  }\n  /** Rescue scene: you are dragged backward, they swear, you are up at 40 (Mags 60) and they are spent for a day. */\n  rescue() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const f = g.player.feet;\n    const hp = this.id === 'mags' ? 60 : 40;\n    g.scene.playRescue(this, () => {\n      g.body.hp = hp; g.body.burning = 0; g.body.lastHit = g.time;\n      this.spentUntil = g.clock.abs + 24;\n      if (g.rng.story.chance(TUNING.buddyWoundChance)) { this.woundedUntil = g.clock.abs + 48; g.say(this.id, g.dialogue.pick(`${this.id}.wounded`) ?? 'THAT WAS THE LAST ONE I HAD IN ME.', 3.5); }\n      this.trust = Math.max(0, this.trust);\n      g.ledger.note('rescued', this.id);\n      g.events.emit('rescued', this);\n    });\n  }\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (!this.active || this.dead) return;\n    if (this.isDown) {\n      this.downT -= dt;\n      if (this.burningDown && g.tick % 10 === 0) ctx.particles.burst('vehicle-flame', [this.x, this.y + 0.6, this.z], { count: 2 });\n      if (this.downT <= 0) { g.say('', `${this.name} HAS STOPPED ASKING.`, 3); this.killed('wound'); }\n      return;\n    }\n    if (g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z) && !this.fireProof) this.hurt(6 * dt, 'fire');\n    // Brain: go to a goal or stay near you; shoot what shoots you.\n    if (g.tick % 6 === 0) this.think(ctx);\n    const mv = this.mv ?? (this.mv = new Vector3());\n    mv.set(0, 0, 0);\n    let tx = null, tz = null;\n    if (this.goal) { tx = this.goal.x; tz = this.goal.z; if (Math.hypot(tx - this.x, tz - this.z) < 2) { const done = this.goal.done; this.goal = null; done?.(); } }\n    else if (this.following && g.hasPlayer && !g.player.seat) {\n      const f = g.player.feet, d = Math.hypot(f.x - this.x, f.z - this.z);\n      if (d > 7) { tx = f.x; tz = f.z; }\n    }\n    if (tx != null) {\n      const dx = tx - this.x, dz = tz - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1;\n      mv.set(dx / l, 0, dz / l);\n      this.cc.speed = l > 25 ? 6.4 : 5;\n      if (!this.aimAt) this.yaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n      this.moveWanted = this.cc.speed;\n    } else this.moveWanted = 0;\n    this.cc.setInput(mv, false, false);\n    this.cc.fixedUpdate(dt);\n    const f = this.cc.feet;\n    this.x = f.x; this.y = f.y; this.z = f.z;\n    this.fireCool -= dt;\n    if (this.burstLeft > 0 && this.fireCool <= 0 && this.aimAt) this.shoot(ctx);\n  }\n  think(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.aimAt = null;\n    let bd = 70;\n    for (const s of g.actors.soldiers) {\n      if (!s.active || s.dead) continue;\n      if (g.story.pass === s.faction && !s.squad?.angry) continue;\n      const d = Math.hypot(s.x - this.x, s.z - this.z);\n      if (d < bd && (s.state === 'alert' || d < 30)) { bd = d; this.aimAt = s; }\n    }\n    if (this.aimAt) {\n      this.yaw = Math.atan2(this.aimAt.x - this.x, this.aimAt.z - this.z);\n      this.burstPause -= 0.1;\n      if (this.burstLeft <= 0 && this.burstPause <= 0) { this.burstLeft = g.rng.ai.int(2, 4); this.burstPause = g.rng.ai.range(0.8, 1.6); }\n    }\n  }\n  shoot(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game, t = this.aimAt, r = g.rng.ai;\n    this.burstLeft--; this.fireCool = 0.14;\n    const dx = t.x - this.x, dy = t.y + 1 - (this.y + 1.4), dz = t.z - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dy, dz) || 1;\n    const e = 0.05;\n    const hit = g.damage.bullet(this.x + (dx / l) * 0.6, this.y + 1.4, this.z + (dz / l) * 0.6, dx / l + r.range(-e, e), dy / l + r.range(-e, e), dz / l + r.range(-e, e), 120, 16, this);\n    if (hit) g.fx.tracer(this.x, this.y + 1.4, this.z, hit.x, hit.y, hit.z);\n    g.sfx.at('gun-tractor-far', this.x, this.z, { max: 200, volume: 0.9 });\n    this.view?.anim.shot('FireRecoil');\n    if (t.dead && g.rng.ai.chance(0.3)) g.say(this.id, g.dialogue.pick(`${this.id}.fight`) ?? '', 2.4);\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    if (!this.active || !this.view) return;\n    const o = this.view.object;\n    if (this.cc) { const f = this.cc.interpolatedFeet(ctx.physics.alpha); o.position.set(f.x, f.y, f.z); }\n    o.rotation.y = this.yaw;\n    if (!this.isDown && !this.dead) this.view.anim.set(this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'Run' : 'Idle', this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'AimWalk' : 'AimIdle');\n    if (this.moveWanted > 0) this.view.anim.speed(this.moveWanted / 6.5);\n    this.view.anim.update(dt);\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/civilian.js <<'EOF'\n// Walk between points in Mile Forty and Three Wells; flee on gunfire or fire. Hits are ignored; the Ledger counts displacement, not bodies.\nimport { THREE } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { SITES } from '../content/sites.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { clamp, wrapAngle } from '../core/rng.js';\nconst { BoxGeometry } = THREE;\nconst PALETTES = [{ cloth: 'sand', dark: 'red', skin: 'plum', hat: 'white' }, { cloth: 'white', dark: 'slate', skin: 'red', hat: 'orange' }, { cloth: 'orange', dark: 'plum', skin: 'sand', hat: 'red' }, { cloth: 'teal', dark: 'night', skin: 'orange', hat: 'sand' }];\nclass Civilian {\n  kind = 'civilian'; fleeT = 0; goal = null; moveT = 0; hidden = false;\n  constructor(sys, home, at, i) { this.sys = sys; this.home = home; this.x = at[0]; this.z = at[1]; this.i = i; this.y = sys.game.world.heightAt(at[0], at[1]); this.yaw = 0; }\n  flee(fromX, fromZ) { this.fleeT = 8; const dx = this.x - fromX, dz = this.z - fromZ, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1; this.goal = { x: this.x + (dx / l) * 40, z: this.z + (dz / l) * 40 }; }\n  step(dt) {\n    const g = this.sys.game;\n    if (this.hidden) return;\n    this.fleeT -= dt;\n    if (!this.goal && (this.moveT -= dt) <= 0) {\n      const r = g.rng.ai, a = r.range(0, 6.28), rr = r.range(4, this.home.r * 0.45);\n      this.goal = { x: this.home.at[0] + Math.cos(a) * rr, z: this.home.at[1] + Math.sin(a) * rr };\n      this.moveT = r.range(4, 12);\n    }\n    if (this.goal) {\n      const dx = this.goal.x - this.x, dz = this.goal.z - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n      if (l < 0.8) { this.goal = null; this.speed = 0; return; }\n      const sp = this.fleeT > 0 ? 5.2 : 1.3;\n      this.x += (dx / l) * sp * dt; this.z += (dz / l) * sp * dt;\n      this.y = g.world.heightAt(this.x, this.z);\n      this.yaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz); this.speed = sp;\n      if (!g.world.nav.walkable(this.x, this.z)) { this.goal = null; }\n    } else this.speed = 0;\n  }\n}\nexport class Civilians {\n  list = []; column = null; columnList = []; emptyWells = false;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  build(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const towns = [[SITES['three-wells'], SITES['three-wells'].civilians], [SITES['mile-forty'], 10]];\n    let i = 0;\n    for (const [site, n] of towns) {\n      for (let k = 0; k < n; k++, i++) {\n        const a = (k / n) * 6.28, r = site.r * 0.35;\n        this.list.push(new Civilian(this, site, [site.at[0] + Math.cos(a) * r, site.at[1] + Math.sin(a) * r], i));\n      }\n    }\n    if (g.views) {\n      for (const c of this.list) {\n        const p = makePerson('civilian', PALETTES[c.i % 4]);\n        c.view = p; ctx.scene.add(p.object); p.anim.set('Idle', 'Idle');\n      }\n    }\n    for (const c of this.list) {\n      const body = ctx.physics.addStaticBox({ position: [c.x, c.y + 0.9, c.z], halfExtents: [0.3, 0.9, 0.3] });\n      c.body = body; g.hitMap.set(body.handle, { kind: 'civilian', ref: c });\n    }\n  }\n  reset() { for (const c of this.list) { c.hidden = false; c.fleeT = 0; c.goal = null; if (c.view) c.view.object.visible = true; } this.emptyWells = false; this.columnList = []; this.column = null; }\n  heard(x, z, r) { for (const c of this.list) if (!c.hidden && Math.hypot(c.x - x, c.z - z) < r) c.flee(x, z); }\n  /** The village empties: a line of people walks the road to the clinic, huts go dark. */\n  emptyVillage() {\n    this.emptyWells = true;\n    for (const c of this.list) if (c.home === SITES['three-wells']) { c.hidden = true; if (c.view) c.view.object.visible = false; }\n    this.game.ledger.add('moved', 240);\n  }\n  showVillage() { this.emptyWells = false; for (const c of this.list) if (c.home === SITES['three-wells']) { c.hidden = false; if (c.view) c.view.object.visible = true; } }\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.round) return;\n    const f = g.anchor();\n    for (const c of this.list) {\n      if (c.hidden || Math.hypot(c.x - f.x, c.z - f.z) > 280) continue;\n      c.step(dt);\n      if (g.tick % 20 === c.i % 20) {\n        if (g.fire.isBurning(c.x, c.z) || g.fireView.nearestDist < 30 && g.fire.isBurning(c.x + 8, c.z)) c.flee(c.x + g.rng.ai.range(-3, 3), c.z + g.rng.ai.range(-3, 3));\n      }\n      c.body?.setTranslation?.({ x: c.x, y: c.y + 0.9, z: c.z });\n    }\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    const cam = this.game.camPos;\n    for (const c of this.list) {\n      if (!c.view || c.hidden) continue;\n      if (Math.hypot(c.x - cam.x, c.z - cam.z) > 170) { c.view.object.visible = false; continue; }\n      c.view.object.visible = true;\n      c.view.object.position.set(c.x, c.y, c.z); c.view.object.rotation.y = c.yaw;\n      c.view.anim.set(c.speed > 3 ? 'Run' : c.speed > 0 ? 'Walk' : 'Idle');\n      c.view.anim.speed(c.speed > 3 ? c.speed / 6.5 : 1);\n      c.view.anim.update(dt);\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/fauna.js <<'EOF'\n// Gazelle herds in open grass and vultures over burnt ground. Atmosphere; they can't hurt you.\nimport { THREE, buildModel, compileClips, setLookLayer, Boids } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { FAUNA_CLIPS, FAUNA_RIG } from '../art/clips.js';\nimport { K } from '../world/ground.js';\nconst { AnimationMixer } = THREE;\nexport class Fauna {\n  herds = []; birds = [];\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  build(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (!g.views) return;\n    const sample = buildModel('gazelle', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n    this.clips = Object.fromEntries(compileClips(FAUNA_CLIPS, FAUNA_RIG, sample).map((c) => [c.name, c]));\n    const spots = [[-320, 170], [250, 280], [-120, -80], [420, 120], [-470, 260], [120, -60]];\n    const r = ctx.random.fork('herd');\n    for (const [hx, hz] of spots) {\n      const herd = { hx, hz, animals: [], fleeT: 0, dir: 0 };\n      for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n        const o = buildModel('gazelle', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n        setLookLayer(o, 'actors');\n        o.traverse((m) => { if (m.isMesh) m.castShadow = true; });\n        const x = hx + r.range(-14, 14), z = hz + r.range(-14, 14);\n        const mixer = new AnimationMixer(o);\n        const graze = mixer.clipAction(this.clips.GazGraze), run = mixer.clipAction(this.clips.GazRun);\n        graze.play(); graze.time = r.range(0, 3);\n        ctx.scene.add(o);\n        herd.animals.push({ o, x, z, y: g.world.heightAt(x, z), yaw: r.range(0, 6.28), mixer, graze, run, running: false, off: r.range(0, 1) });\n      }\n      this.herds.push(herd);\n    }\n    // Vultures: a tiny flock circling the highest scar.\n    this.flock = new Boids(10, { bounds: { min: [-70, 70, -70], max: [70, 110, 70] }, seed: 11 });\n    this.birdCenter = [0, 40, 0];\n    for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n      const o = buildModel('vulture', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n      setLookLayer(o, 'actors');\n      ctx.scene.add(o);\n      this.birds.push({ o, wr: o.getObjectByName('WingR'), wl: o.getObjectByName('WingL'), ph: i * 0.8 });\n    }\n  }\n  reset() {\n    for (const h of this.herds) { h.fleeT = 0; for (const a of h.animals) a.running = false; }\n  }\n  scare(x, z, r) {\n    for (const h of this.herds) {\n      if (Math.hypot(h.hx - x, h.hz - z) < r * 1.1 && h.fleeT <= 0) { h.fleeT = 7; h.dir = Math.atan2(h.hx - x, h.hz - z); }\n    }\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (!g.views) return;\n    const cam = g.camPos;\n    for (const h of this.herds) {\n      if (g.fireView.nearestDist < 90 && Math.hypot(h.hx - cam.x, h.hz - cam.z) < 200 && h.fleeT <= 0) { h.fleeT = 6; h.dir = g.wind.dir; }\n      h.fleeT -= dt;\n      const near = Math.hypot(h.hx - cam.x, h.hz - cam.z) < 200;\n      for (const a of h.animals) {\n        a.o.visible = near;\n        if (!near) continue;\n        const flee = h.fleeT > 0;\n        if (flee !== a.running) { a.running = flee; if (flee) { a.run.reset().play(); a.graze.crossFadeTo(a.run, 0.15, false); } else { a.graze.reset().play(); a.run.crossFadeTo(a.graze, 0.3, false); } }\n        if (flee) {\n          a.yaw = h.dir + Math.sin(g.time + a.off * 6) * 0.2;\n          const nx = a.x + Math.sin(a.yaw) * 11 * dt, nz = a.z + Math.cos(a.yaw) * 11 * dt;\n          if (g.ground.kindAt(nx, nz) !== K.WATER && Math.abs(nx) < 620 && Math.abs(nz) < 620) { a.x = nx; a.z = nz; }\n          a.y = g.world.heightAt(a.x, a.z);\n        }\n        a.o.position.set(a.x, a.y, a.z); a.o.rotation.y = a.yaw;\n        a.mixer.update(dt);\n      }\n    }\n    if (this.flock) {\n      const fire = g.fire;\n      // Circle the most recent large burn, or the Cut.\n      const c = fire.burntList.length > 20 ? [fire.wx(fire.burntList[fire.burntList.length - 1]), fire.wz(fire.burntList[fire.burntList.length - 1])] : [cam.x + 120, cam.z - 150];\n      this.birdCenter[0] += (c[0] - this.birdCenter[0]) * dt * 0.1; this.birdCenter[2] += (c[1] - this.birdCenter[2]) * dt * 0.1;\n      this.flock.step(Math.min(dt, 1 / 20));\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.birds.length; i++) {\n        const b = this.birds[i], p = this.flock.pos, v = this.flock.vel, k = i * 3;\n        b.o.position.set(this.birdCenter[0] + p[k], p[k + 1] + 20, this.birdCenter[2] + p[k + 2]);\n        b.o.rotation.y = Math.atan2(v[k], v[k + 2]);\n        const f = Math.sin(g.time * 2.4 + b.ph) * 0.25;\n        if (b.wr) b.wr.rotation.z = f; if (b.wl) b.wl.rotation.z = -f;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Write soldiers, squads, buddies, civilians and fauna"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3934,"cache_read_input_tokens":373670,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3934},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"c458e36b-5c55-4c3c-b799-33f70e287aad","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:53:16.419Z","request_id":"req_011CgkgDqNDrejmtZSo9pHPJ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017yx7wjgTXLRWx5khU5QzBw":{"command":"set -e\ncat > src/actors/rig.js <<'EOF'\n// People on the hero rig: one set of compiled clips, split into legs and upper body, shared by everyone.\nimport { THREE, buildModel, compileClips, setLookLayer, HERO_CLIPS, HERO_RIG } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { PEOPLE_CLIPS } from '../art/clips.js';\nconst { AnimationMixer, AnimationClip, LoopOnce, LoopRepeat } = THREE;\nlet CACHE = null;\nfunction clips() {\n  if (CACHE) return CACHE;\n  const sample = buildModel('soldier-a', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n  const all = compileClips([...HERO_CLIPS, ...PEOPLE_CLIPS], { ...HERO_RIG, spine: undefined }, sample);\n  const whole = {}, lower = {}, upper = {};\n  const isLeg = (t) => /^(Pelvis|Leg|Shin|Foot)/.test(t.name);\n  for (const c of all) {\n    whole[c.name] = c;\n    lower[c.name] = new AnimationClip(`${c.name}.lo`, c.duration, c.tracks.filter(isLeg));\n    upper[c.name] = new AnimationClip(`${c.name}.up`, c.duration, c.tracks.filter((t) => !isLeg(t)));\n  }\n  CACHE = { whole, lower, upper };\n  return CACHE;\n}\nexport function makePerson(modelId, palette) {\n  const build = buildModel(modelId, { catalog: MODELS, palette });\n  const object = build.object;\n  setLookLayer(object, 'actors');\n  object.traverse((o) => { if (o.isMesh) { o.castShadow = true; o.receiveShadow = false; } });\n  return { object, anim: new PersonAnim(object), build };\n}\nexport class PersonAnim {\n  lowerName = ''; upperName = ''; one = null;\n  constructor(object) {\n    this.object = object; this.mixer = new AnimationMixer(object); this.c = clips(); this.actions = new Map();\n  }\n  act(kind, name) {\n    const key = `${kind}:${name}`;\n    let a = this.actions.get(key);\n    if (!a) { const clip = this.c[kind][name]; if (!clip) return null; a = this.mixer.clipAction(clip); this.actions.set(key, a); }\n    return a;\n  }\n  /** Lower and upper body on loops; a name for both plays one whole clip. */\n  set(lower, upper = lower, fade = 0.2) {\n    if (lower !== this.lowerName) {\n      const n = this.act('lower', lower), o = this.lowerName && this.act('lower', this.lowerName);\n      if (n) { n.reset().setLoop(LoopRepeat).play(); if (o) o.crossFadeTo(n, fade, false); this.lowerName = lower; }\n    }\n    if (upper !== this.upperName && !this.one) {\n      const n = this.act('upper', upper), o = this.upperName && this.act('upper', this.upperName);\n      if (n) { n.reset().setLoop(LoopRepeat).play(); if (o) o.crossFadeTo(n, fade, false); this.upperName = upper; }\n    } else if (this.one) this.pendingUpper = upper;\n  }\n  /** A one-shot on the upper body, then back to the loop. */\n  shot(name, speed = 1) {\n    const n = this.act('upper', name); if (!n) return;\n    const cur = this.one ?? (this.upperName && this.act('upper', this.upperName));\n    n.reset().setLoop(LoopOnce, 1); n.clampWhenFinished = true; n.timeScale = speed; n.play();\n    if (cur && cur !== n) cur.crossFadeTo(n, 0.05, false);\n    this.one = n; this.oneDur = n.getClip().duration / speed; this.oneT = 0;\n  }\n  speed(lowerRate) { const a = this.lowerName && this.act('lower', this.lowerName); if (a) a.timeScale = lowerRate; }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this.one) {\n      this.oneT += dt;\n      if (this.oneT >= this.oneDur) {\n        const back = this.act('upper', this.pendingUpper ?? this.upperName);\n        if (back) { back.reset().setLoop(LoopRepeat).play(); this.one.crossFadeTo(back, 0.12, false); this.upperName = this.pendingUpper ?? this.upperName; }\n        this.one = null; this.pendingUpper = null;\n      }\n    }\n    this.mixer.update(dt);\n  }\n  stop() { this.mixer.stopAllAction(); this.lowerName = ''; this.upperName = ''; this.one = null; }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/soldier.js <<'EOF'\n// A soldier is data plus an optional view. In a Cash Run client he is a puppet with no brain and no collider.\nimport { THREE, CharacterController, Ragdoll, HERO_RAGDOLL, BehaviorTree, bt, buildModel, setLookLayer } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { TUNING } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { clamp, lerp, wrapAngle, hash2 } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { F } from '../world/fire.js';\nconst { Vector3 } = THREE;\nconst _a = new Vector3(), _b = new Vector3(), _d = new Vector3();\nconst SKINS = ['plum', 'red', 'orange', 'sand'];\nconst FACTIONS = {\n  concord: [{ cloth: 'slate', dark: 'night', hat: 'navy', strap: 'white' }, { cloth: 'slate', dark: 'navy', hat: 'navy', strap: 'white' }, { cloth: 'night', dark: 'slate', hat: 'navy', strap: 'mist' }],\n  harvest: [{ cloth: 'sand', dark: 'red', hat: 'red', strap: 'orange' }, { cloth: 'orange', dark: 'plum', hat: 'red', strap: 'sand' }, { cloth: 'red', dark: 'sand', hat: 'red', strap: 'plum' }],\n  deserter: [{ cloth: 'mist', dark: 'plum', hat: 'night', strap: 'red' }, { cloth: 'slate', dark: 'red', hat: 'orange', strap: 'plum' }],\n};\nconst MODELS_BY_HAT = ['soldier-a', 'soldier-b', 'soldier-c', 'soldier-d'];\nconst HP = { rifle: 70, mg: 110, sniper: 60, rocket: 70, driver: 60 };\nconst SPEED = { rifle: 4.2, mg: 3.4, sniper: 3.8, rocket: 3.6, driver: 4.2 };\n\nfunction makeTree(s) {\n  const b = bt;\n  return new BehaviorTree(b.selector('brain',\n    b.sequence('burn', b.condition('on fire?', (o) => o.burning > 0), b.action('panic', (o, dt) => o.brainBurn(dt))),\n    b.sequence('flee fire', b.condition('fire near?', (o) => o.fireNear()), b.action('crosswind', (o, dt) => o.brainFleeFire(dt))),\n    b.sequence('dodge', b.condition('grenade?', (o) => o.dodgeT > 0), b.action('dodge', (o, dt) => o.brainDodge(dt))),\n    b.sequence('combat', b.condition('alert?', (o) => o.state === 'alert'), b.action('fight', (o, dt) => o.brainCombat(dt))),\n    b.sequence('search', b.condition('searching?', (o) => o.state === 'searching' || o.state === 'suspicious'), b.action('look', (o, dt) => o.brainSearch(dt))),\n    b.action('duty', (o, dt) => o.brainDuty(dt))), s);\n}\nlet NEXT_ID = 1;\nexport class Soldier {\n  kind = 'soldier'; active = false; dead = false; x = 0; y = 0; z = 0; yaw = 0; hp = 70; maxHp = 70; state = 'idle'; suspicion = 0; burning = 0; dodgeT = 0; target = null; lastKnown = null; searchT = 0; fireCool = 0; burstLeft = 0; burstPause = 0; reactT = 0; repositionT = 0; goal = null; path = null; pathI = 0; pathWait = false; moveWanted = 0; aimYaw = 0; jamT = 0; barkCool = 0; sees = false; panicDir = 0; dutyT = 0; sleeping = false; hasRagdoll = false; goalSeat = null;\n  puppet = false;\n  constructor(game, id) { this.game = game; this.id = id ?? NEXT_ID++; }\n  /** Body and view, once, then reused from the pool. */\n  makeBody(ctx) {\n    if (!this.cc) {\n      this.cc = new CharacterController(ctx.physics, { position: [this.x, this.y + 0.1, this.z], radius: 0.32, halfHeight: 0.56, speed: 4, jumpSpeed: 0, gravity: -24 });\n      ctx.physics.tag(this.cc.collider, 'npc');\n      this.game.hitMap.set(this.cc.collider.handle, { kind: 'soldier', ref: this });\n    }\n  }\n  makeView(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.view || !g.views) return;\n    const r = g.rng.look;\n    const pal = r.pick(FACTIONS[this.faction]);\n    const p = makePerson(r.pick(MODELS_BY_HAT), { ...pal, skin: r.pick(SKINS) });\n    const gun = buildModel('npc-rifle', { catalog: MODELS });\n    setLookLayer(gun.object, 'actors');\n    gun.object.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\n    gun.object.position.set(0, -0.08, 0.04);\n    p.object.getObjectByName('HandR').add(gun.object);\n    this.view = p; this.gunObj = gun.object;\n    ctx.scene.add(p.object);\n    this.doll = null;\n  }\n  spawn(ctx, { faction, role = 'rifle', x, z, yaw = 0, squad, duty = 'guard', fixed = false, y }) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.faction = faction; this.role = role; this.squad = squad ?? null; this.duty = duty; this.fixed = fixed;\n    this.x = x; this.z = z; this.y = y ?? g.world.heightAt(x, z); this.yaw = yaw; this.home = { x, z, y: this.y };\n    this.hp = this.maxHp = HP[role] * TUNING.enemyHealth;\n    this.dead = false; this.state = 'idle'; this.suspicion = 0; this.burning = 0; this.dodgeT = 0; this.target = null; this.lastKnown = null; this.goal = null; this.path = null; this.active = true; this.sees = false; this.fireCool = 0; this.jamT = 0; this.dutyT = g.rng.ai.range(0, 3); this.sleeping = false; this.reactT = 0;\n    if (!this.puppet) {\n      this.makeBody(ctx);\n      this.cc.teleport([x, this.y + 0.08, z]);\n      this.cc.speed = SPEED[role];\n      this.cc.collider.setEnabled(true);\n      this.tree = this.tree ?? makeTree(this);\n      this.tree.halt();\n    }\n    this.makeView(ctx);\n    if (this.view) {\n      if (this.doll) { this.doll.disable(); this.doll = null; }\n      this.view.object.visible = true;\n      this.view.object.position.set(x, this.y, z); this.view.object.rotation.set(0, yaw, 0);\n      this.view.anim.stop();\n      this.view.anim.set('Idle', 'Idle');\n      if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = true;\n    }\n    return this;\n  }\n  despawn() {\n    this.active = false;\n    if (this.cc) { this.cc.teleport([this.home?.x ?? 0, -40, this.home?.z ?? 0]); this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false); }\n    if (this.doll) { this.doll.disable(); this.doll = null; }\n    if (this.view) this.view.object.visible = false;\n  }\n  fromBehind(px, pz) {\n    if (this.state === 'alert' && this.sees) return false;\n    const dx = px - this.x, dz = pz - this.z;\n    const d = wrapAngle(Math.atan2(dx, dz) - this.yaw);\n    return Math.abs(d) > 1.8;\n  }\n  hurt(a, who, dir, zone, opts = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.dead) return;\n    const fromPlayer = who === 'player';\n    if (g.dev.oneHit && fromPlayer) a = 9999;\n    this.hp -= a;\n    if (fromPlayer || who?.kind === 'buddy') { this.alertTo(g.player.feet.x, g.player.feet.z, who === 'player' ? 'player' : who); if (this.squad) this.squad.angry = true; }\n    else if (who?.kind === 'soldier' && who.faction !== this.faction) { this.target = who; this.state = 'alert'; }\n    if (g.round) { g.round.onSoldierHurt(this, a, who, opts); }\n    if (this.hp <= 0) { this.die(who, dir, zone, opts); return; }\n    if (this.view && this.reactCool <= 0) { /* flinch at most so often */ }\n    this.view?.anim.shot('HitReact', 1.2);\n    g.voice.bark(this, 'hit');\n    if (this.state !== 'alert') this.state = 'alert';\n  }\n  die(who, dir, zone, opts = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.dead = true;\n    this.burningAtDeath = this.burning > 0;\n    this.burning = 0;\n    if (this.cc) { this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false); }\n    if (this.squad) this.squad.onDeath(this);\n    g.events.emit('kill', this, who, zone);\n    if (who === 'player' || opts.seat != null) { g.ledger.add('paid', 1); }\n    g.voice.bark(this, 'ally-down-near');\n    // Keep a gun on the ground, worn.\n    if (!g.round && this.gunObj && !opts.noDrop) g.actors.dropGun(this);\n    if (this.view) {\n      if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = false;\n      this.view.anim.stop();\n      const vel = dir ? [dir.x * (zone === 'blast' ? 9 : 3.2), (zone === 'blast' ? 5 : 1.2), dir.z * (zone === 'blast' ? 9 : 3.2)] : [0, 1, 0];\n      try {\n        this.doll = new Ragdoll(g.ctx.physics, this.view.object, HERO_RAGDOLL);\n        this.doll.enable({ velocity: vel });\n        this.corpseT = 25;\n      } catch { this.doll = null; this.view.object.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2; }\n    }\n  }\n  ignite() {\n    if (this.dead || this.burning > 0 || this.game.round?.isClient) return;\n    this.burning = 5; this.state = 'burn';\n    this.panicDir = this.game.rng.ai.range(0, 6.28);\n    this.game.events.emit('soldier-burning', this);\n    this.game.voice.bark(this, 'burning');\n    this.view?.anim.set('BurnPanic', 'BurnPanic', 0.1);\n  }\n  alertTo(x, z, tgt) {\n    if (this.dead) return;\n    const was = this.state;\n    this.lastKnown = { x, z };\n    this.state = 'alert';\n    this.suspicion = 1;\n    if (tgt) this.target = tgt;\n    if (was !== 'alert') {\n      this.reactT = TUNING.enemyReaction;\n      this.game.voice.bark(this, 'spotted');\n      if (this.squad) this.squad.share(x, z, this);\n      this.sleeping = false;\n    }\n  }\n  // ---- senses, at 10 Hz ----\n  perceive(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const tgt = g.actors.pickTarget(this);\n    this.sees = false;\n    if (!tgt) { if (this.state === 'alert' && !this.lastKnown) this.state = 'searching'; this.target = null; return; }\n    const tx = tgt.x, tz = tgt.z, ty = tgt.eyeY;\n    const dx = tx - this.x, dz = tz - this.z, dist = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n    const vis = g.actors.visionFor(this, tgt, dist);\n    let seen = false;\n    if (dist < vis && !this.sleeping) {\n      const ang = Math.abs(wrapAngle(Math.atan2(dx, dz) - this.yaw));\n      if (ang < (60 * Math.PI) / 180 || dist < 3 || this.state === 'alert') seen = this.hasLOS(tgt, tx, ty, tz, dist);\n    }\n    this.sees = seen;\n    if (seen) {\n      this.target = tgt.ref ?? tgt;\n      this.targetInfo = tgt;\n      this.lastKnown = { x: tx, z: tz };\n      const rate = lerp(1.6, 0.45, clamp(dist / vis, 0, 1));\n      this.suspicion = clamp(this.suspicion + dt * rate, 0, 1);\n      if (this.suspicion >= 0.34 && this.state === 'idle') { this.state = 'suspicious'; this.searchT = 6; g.voice.bark(this, 'suspicious'); }\n      if (this.suspicion >= 1 && this.state !== 'alert') this.alertTo(tx, tz, tgt.ref ?? tgt);\n      if (this.state === 'alert') this.lastSeenT = 0;\n    } else {\n      if (this.state !== 'alert') this.suspicion = clamp(this.suspicion - dt * 0.12, 0, 1);\n      this.lastSeenT = (this.lastSeenT ?? 0) + dt;\n      if (this.state === 'alert' && this.lastSeenT > 6) { this.state = 'searching'; this.searchT = 20; g.voice.bark(this, 'lost'); }\n    }\n  }\n  hasLOS(tgt, tx, ty, tz, dist) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    _a.set(this.x, this.y + (this.crouchAim ? 1.1 : 1.5), this.z);\n    _d.set(tx - _a.x, ty - _a.y, tz - _a.z); const l = _d.length() || 1; _d.multiplyScalar(1 / l);\n    const hit = g.ctx.physics.castRay(_a, _d, l + 0.3, [], this.cc?.body);\n    if (!hit) return true;\n    const ent = g.hitMap.get(hit.collider.handle);\n    if (ent && (ent.kind === tgt.kind || ent.ref === tgt.ref || ent.kind === 'vehicle' && tgt.inVehicle)) return true;\n    return hit.distance >= l - 0.5;\n  }\n  fireNear() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.fixed) return false;\n    if (this.fireCheckT > 0) return this.fireIsNear;\n    this.fireCheckT = 0.5;\n    this.fireIsNear = false;\n    const wx = g.wind.x, wz = g.wind.z;\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 2; i++) {\n      if (g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x - wx * 5 * i, this.z - wz * 5 * i) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x + 5 * i, this.z) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x - 5 * i, this.z) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z + 5 * i) || g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z - 5 * i)) { this.fireIsNear = true; break; }\n    }\n    if (g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z)) this.ignite();\n    return this.fireIsNear;\n  }\n  // ---- brain actions, at 10 Hz ----\n  brainBurn(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.burning -= dt;\n    this.panicDir += g.rng.ai.range(-1.1, 1.1) * dt * 4;\n    this.goal = null; this.steerDir = this.panicDir; this.moveWanted = 6.5;\n    this.yaw = this.panicDir;\n    if (this.burnLight == null) this.burnLight = 1;\n    // Spread fire to the cells crossed.\n    const id = g.fire.idOf(this.x, this.z);\n    if (id >= 0 && g.fire.state[id] === 0 && g.fire.fuel[id] > 0) g.fire.lightCell(id, 'spread');\n    if (this.burnBark === undefined || (this.burnBark -= dt) <= 0) { this.burnBark = 1.2; g.voice.bark(this, 'burning'); }\n    this.hp -= (this.maxHp / 5) * dt;\n    if (this.burning <= 0 || this.hp <= 0) { this.hp = 0; this.die(this.lastFireBy ?? 'fire', null, 'fire'); }\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainFleeFire(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.state = this.state === 'idle' ? 'suspicious' : this.state;\n    // Crosswind, away from the flames.\n    const a = g.wind.dir + Math.PI / 2 * (this.id % 2 ? 1 : -1);\n    this.steerDir = Math.atan2(Math.cos(a), Math.sin(a));\n    this.goal = null; this.moveWanted = 6.2;\n    this.yaw = this.steerDir;\n    if (g.rng.ai.chance(dt * 0.5)) g.voice.bark(this, 'fire');\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainDodge(dt) {\n    this.dodgeT -= dt; this.goal = null; this.moveWanted = 6; this.steerDir = this.dodgeDir ?? 0; return 'running';\n  }\n  brainCombat(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const tgt = this.targetInfo;\n    const lk = this.lastKnown ?? (tgt ? { x: tgt.x, z: tgt.z } : null);\n    if (!lk) { this.state = 'searching'; this.searchT = 12; return 'running'; }\n    const dx = lk.x - this.x, dz = lk.z - this.z, dist = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n    this.aimYaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n    this.reactT -= dt;\n    this.repositionT -= dt;\n    if (this.jamT > 0) { this.jamT -= dt; this.moveWanted = 0; this.goal = null; return 'running'; }\n    // Move: cover first, re-position every 4 to 8 s; one flanks.\n    if (!this.fixed && this.repositionT <= 0) {\n      this.repositionT = g.rng.ai.range(4, 8);\n      const flank = this.squad && this.squad.flanker === this;\n      if (flank) {\n        const side = this.id % 2 ? 1 : -1, nx = dz / (dist || 1), nz = -dx / (dist || 1);\n        this.setGoal(lk.x + nx * side * 18 - (dx / (dist || 1)) * 14, lk.z + nz * side * 18 - (dz / (dist || 1)) * 14);\n      } else {\n        const c = g.actors.nearestCover(this, lk);\n        if (c) this.setGoal(c.x, c.z);\n        else if (dist > 28) this.setGoal(this.x + (dx / dist) * 12 + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6), this.z + (dz / dist) * 12 + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6));\n        else this.setGoal(this.x + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6), this.z + g.rng.ai.range(-6, 6));\n      }\n    }\n    this.moveWanted = this.goal ? (this.role === 'mg' ? 3 : 4.6) : 0;\n    // Shoot: bursts of 3 to 5.\n    this.yaw = this.aimYaw;\n    if (this.sees && this.reactT <= 0 && !g.noShooting) {\n      if (this.burstLeft > 0) { /* fixedUpdate fires */ }\n      else if ((this.burstPause -= dt) <= 0) {\n        this.burstLeft = this.role === 'mg' ? g.rng.ai.int(6, 10) : this.role === 'sniper' ? 1 : g.rng.ai.int(3, 5);\n        this.burstPause = this.role === 'sniper' ? g.rng.ai.range(2.4, 4) : g.rng.ai.range(0.9, 2);\n        if (this.role === 'rocket' && g.rng.ai.chance(0.5)) { this.fireRocket(); this.burstLeft = 0; this.burstPause = 6; }\n      }\n    }\n    if (dist < 25 && !this.sees && this.goal == null) this.setGoal(lk.x, lk.z);\n    this.view?.anim.set(this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'Run' : 'Idle', this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'AimWalk' : 'AimIdle');\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainSearch(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.searchT -= dt;\n    if (this.lastKnown && !this.goal && !this.fixed) {\n      const d = Math.hypot(this.lastKnown.x - this.x, this.lastKnown.z - this.z);\n      if (d > 3) this.setGoal(this.lastKnown.x, this.lastKnown.z);\n      else this.lastKnown = null;\n    }\n    this.moveWanted = this.goal ? 2.6 : 0;\n    if (!this.goal) this.yaw += Math.sin(g.time * 0.6 + this.id) * dt * 1.2;\n    if (this.searchT <= 0) { this.state = 'idle'; this.suspicion = 0; this.lastKnown = null; this.goal = null; g.voice.bark(this, 'giveup'); }\n    this.view?.anim.set(this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'Walk' : 'Idle', 'AimIdle');\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  brainDuty(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.dutyT -= dt;\n    const night = g.clock.isNight();\n    if (this.duty === 'march') {\n      if (this.marchTo && !this.goal) { if (Math.hypot(this.marchTo.x - this.x, this.marchTo.z - this.z) > 5) this.setGoal(this.marchTo.x, this.marchTo.z); else { this.marchTo = null; this.duty = 'guard'; } }\n      this.moveWanted = 4.2;\n      this.view?.anim.set('Run', 'AimWalk');\n      return 'running';\n    }\n    if (this.dutyT <= 0) {\n      this.dutyT = g.rng.ai.range(4, 10);\n      this.sleeping = false;\n      if (this.duty === 'patrol' && !this.fixed) {\n        const a = g.rng.ai.range(0, 6.28), r = g.rng.ai.range(6, 26);\n        this.setGoal(this.home.x + Math.cos(a) * r, this.home.z + Math.sin(a) * r);\n      } else if (!this.fixed && night && g.rng.ai.chance(0.25)) { this.sleeping = true; this.dutyT = 30; }\n      else this.yawGoal = g.rng.ai.range(-3.14, 3.14);\n    }\n    if (this.yawGoal != null) this.yaw += wrapAngle(this.yawGoal - this.yaw) * Math.min(1, dt * 1.5);\n    this.moveWanted = this.goal ? 1.6 : 0;\n    if (this.view) {\n      if (this.sleeping) this.view.anim.set('Sleep', 'Sleep');\n      else if (this.moveWanted > 0) this.view.anim.set('Walk', 'Walk');\n      else this.view.anim.set('Idle', 'Idle');\n    }\n    return 'running';\n  }\n  setGoal(x, z) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.goal = { x, z };\n    this.path = null; this.pathI = 0;\n    if (Math.hypot(x - this.x, z - this.z) > 14 && !g.world.nav.lineOfSight(this.x, this.z, x, z)) g.actors.requestPath(this);\n  }\n  // ---- per fixed step: legs and trigger ----\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.dead || !this.active || this.puppet) return;\n    this.fireCheckT = (this.fireCheckT ?? 0) - dt;\n    // Steering.\n    const mv = _d.set(0, 0, 0);\n    if (this.moveWanted > 0) {\n      let dirx = 0, dirz = 0;\n      if (this.goal) {\n        let tx = this.goal.x, tz = this.goal.z;\n        if (this.path && this.pathI < this.path.length) { const p = this.path[this.pathI]; tx = p[0]; tz = p[2]; if (Math.hypot(tx - this.x, tz - this.z) < 1.6) this.pathI++; }\n        const dx = tx - this.x, dz = tz - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n        if (Math.hypot(this.goal.x - this.x, this.goal.z - this.z) < 1.5) { this.goal = null; this.path = null; }\n        else if (l > 0.01) { dirx = dx / l; dirz = dz / l; }\n        if (this.state !== 'alert') this.yaw = Math.atan2(dirx, dirz);\n      } else if (this.steerDir != null) { dirx = Math.sin(this.steerDir); dirz = Math.cos(this.steerDir); }\n      mv.set(dirx, 0, dirz);\n      this.cc.speed = this.moveWanted;\n    }\n    // Stuck in water? He goes round.\n    if (g.ground.isWater(this.x + mv.x * 2, this.z + mv.z * 2) && !g.ground.isFord(this.x, this.z) && !g.world.nav.walkable(this.x + mv.x * 2, this.z + mv.z * 2)) mv.set(0, 0, 0);\n    this.cc.setInput(mv, false, false);\n    this.cc.fixedUpdate(dt);\n    const f = this.cc.feet;\n    this.x = f.x; this.y = f.y; this.z = f.z;\n    // Trigger.\n    this.fireCool -= dt;\n    if (this.burstLeft > 0 && this.fireCool <= 0) this.shootOnce();\n    // Burning in burning grass.\n    if (this.burning > 0 && g.tick % 12 === 0) ctx.particles.burst('vehicle-flame', [this.x, this.y + 1, this.z], { count: 3 });\n  }\n  shootOnce() {\n    const g = this.game, tgt = this.targetInfo;\n    if (!tgt || this.jamT > 0) { this.burstLeft = 0; return; }\n    this.burstLeft--;\n    this.fireCool = this.role === 'mg' ? 0.09 : this.role === 'sniper' ? 0.6 : 0.13;\n    const ox = this.x, oy = this.y + 1.42, oz = this.z;\n    const dx = tgt.x - ox, dy = tgt.y + 1 - oy, dz = tgt.z - oz, dist = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n    const moving = tgt.fast ? 1.4 : 1;\n    const errDeg = (lerp(1.2, 5, clamp(dist / 80, 0, 1.4)) / TUNING.enemyAccuracy) * moving * (this.role === 'sniper' ? 0.45 : 1);\n    const e = (errDeg * Math.PI) / 180, r = g.rng.ai;\n    const yaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz) + r.range(-e, e), pitch = Math.atan2(dy, dist) + r.range(-e, e);\n    const cx = Math.sin(yaw) * Math.cos(pitch), cy = Math.sin(pitch), cz = Math.cos(yaw) * Math.cos(pitch);\n    const hit = g.damage.bullet(ox + cx * 0.5, oy, oz + cz * 0.5, cx, cy, cz, this.role === 'sniper' ? 300 : 180, this.role === 'mg' ? 11 : this.role === 'sniper' ? 26 : 9, this);\n    g.fx.tracer(ox + cx * 0.6, oy, oz + cz * 0.6, ox + cx * (hit?.distance ?? 100), oy + cy * (hit?.distance ?? 100), oz + cz * (hit?.distance ?? 100));\n    if (dist < 240) g.sfx.at(this.role === 'mg' ? 'gun-mg-far' : 'gun-tractor-far', ox, oz, { max: 280, volume: 0.9 });\n    this.view?.anim.shot('FireRecoil', 1);\n    // Whip past the ear.\n    if (hit && g.hasPlayer) { const pd = Math.hypot(hit.x - g.player.feet.x, hit.z - g.player.feet.z); if (pd < 5 && r.chance(0.5)) g.sfx.play('bullet-whip', { volume: 0.5, pitch: r.range(-3, 3) }); }\n    // His gun jams too: an opening for you.\n    if (r.chance(0.012)) { this.burstLeft = 0; this.jamT = r.range(2.2, 3.6); this.view?.anim.shot('UnjamSwear'); g.voice.bark(this, 'jammed'); g.sfx.at('gun-jam', ox, oz, { max: 40 }); g.events.emit('soldier-jam', this); }\n    if (r.chance(0.02) && this.goal == null) g.voice.bark(this, 'fighting');\n  }\n  fireRocket() {\n    const g = this.game, tgt = this.targetInfo;\n    if (!tgt) return;\n    const ox = this.x, oy = this.y + 1.5, oz = this.z;\n    g.projectiles.spawn('soldier_rocket', ox, oy, oz, tgt.x - ox, tgt.y + 1 - oy, tgt.z - oz, this);\n    g.sfx.at('gun-tube', ox, oz, { max: 300 });\n    this.view?.anim.shot('FireRecoil', 0.6);\n  }\n  /** Per frame: pose. Puppets take theirs from snapshots. */\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    if (!this.active) return;\n    const view = this.view;\n    if (!view) return;\n    if (this.dead) {\n      if (this.doll) {\n        this.doll.sync();\n        this.corpseT -= dt;\n        if (this.corpseT <= 0 && this.doll.active) this.doll.disable();\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n    const alpha = ctx.physics.alpha;\n    if (this.cc && !this.puppet) { const f = this.cc.interpolatedFeet(alpha); view.object.position.set(f.x, f.y, f.z); }\n    else view.object.position.set(this.x, this.y, this.z);\n    view.object.rotation.y = this.yaw;\n    const moving = this.moveWanted;\n    if (moving > 0) view.anim.speed(moving > 4 ? moving / 6.5 : moving / 2.2); else view.anim.speed(1);\n    if (Math.hypot(this.x - this.game.camPos.x, this.z - this.game.camPos.z) < 160) view.anim.update(dt);\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/actors.js <<'EOF'\n// Everyone who walks: squads by site with a simulation bubble, buddies, civilians, fauna, ground guns, the nav queue.\nimport { THREE, Boids, buildModel, compileClips, setLookLayer, InstancedBodies } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { TUNING } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { SITES, POSTS } from '../content/sites.js';\nimport { Soldier } from './soldier.js';\nimport { Buddy, BUDDIES } from './buddy.js';\nimport { Civilians } from './civilian.js';\nimport { Fauna } from './fauna.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { clamp, lerp, hash2, wrapAngle } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { WEAPONS } from '../content/weapons.js';\nconst { Vector3 } = THREE;\nconst BUBBLE = 260, BUBBLE_OUT = 300;\nexport class Squad {\n  members = []; angry = false; alive = 0; flanker = null; clearedAt = null; live = false; alertUntil = 0;\n  constructor(game, key, def) { this.game = game; this.key = key; this.def = def; this.alive = def.n; }\n  share(x, z, from) {\n    for (const m of this.members) {\n      if (m === from || m.dead || !m.active) continue;\n      if (m.state !== 'alert') { m.lastKnown = { x, z }; m.state = 'searching'; m.searchT = 20; m.sleeping = false; if (Math.hypot(m.x - x, m.z - z) < 70) { m.state = 'alert'; m.reactT = TUNING.enemyReaction + 0.4; m.targetInfo = from.targetInfo; } }\n      else m.lastKnown = { x, z };\n    }\n    this.flanker = this.flanker && !this.flanker.dead ? this.flanker : (this.members.find((m) => !m.dead && m !== from && m.role === 'rifle') ?? null);\n  }\n  onDeath(s) {\n    this.alive = Math.max(0, this.alive - 1);\n    if (this.alive === 0) { this.clearedAt = this.game.clock.abs; this.game.events.emit('squad-cleared', this.key, this); }\n  }\n}\nexport class Actors {\n  soldiers = []; pool = []; squads = new Map(); buddies = []; pathQueue = []; dropped = []; heardT = 0; extra = [];\n  scriptedFeverHold = false; bubbleT = 0; nearbyCoverT = 0;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; this.civilians = new Civilians(game); this.fauna = new Fauna(game); }\n  build(ctx) {\n    for (const [key, s] of Object.entries(SITES)) if (s.squad) this.addSquadDef(key, { ...s.squad, at: s.at, tower: s.squad.tower, site: s });\n    for (const [key, p] of Object.entries(POSTS)) this.addSquadDef(key, { faction: p.faction, n: p.n, at: p.at, post: p, yaw: p.yaw });\n    for (const b of Object.keys(BUDDIES)) this.buddies.push(new Buddy(this.game, b));\n    this.civilians.build(ctx);\n    this.fauna.build(ctx);\n  }\n  addSquadDef(key, def) { const sq = new Squad(this.game, key, def); this.squads.set(key, sq); return sq; }\n  reset() {\n    for (const s of this.soldiers) s.despawn();\n    this.pool.push(...this.soldiers); this.soldiers.length = 0;\n    for (const sq of this.squads.values()) { sq.members = []; sq.alive = sq.def.n; sq.clearedAt = null; sq.live = false; sq.angry = false; sq.disabled = false; sq.forceLive = false; }\n    this.pathQueue.length = 0;\n    for (const d of this.dropped) { this.game.ctx.scene.remove(d.object); this.game.interact.remove(d.usable); }\n    this.dropped.length = 0;\n    for (const b of this.buddies) b.resetAll();\n    this.civilians.reset();\n    this.fauna.reset();\n  }\n  /** Hand back a soldier from the pool. */\n  makeSoldier(ctx, o) {\n    const s = this.pool.pop() ?? new Soldier(this.game);\n    this.soldiers.push(s);\n    s.spawn(ctx, o);\n    return s;\n  }\n  release(s) {\n    s.despawn();\n    const i = this.soldiers.indexOf(s);\n    if (i >= 0) this.soldiers.splice(i, 1);\n    this.pool.push(s);\n  }\n  // ---- the bubble ----\n  squadOrigin(sq) { return sq.def.at; }\n  liveSquad(ctx, sq) {\n    sq.live = true;\n    const def = sq.def, g = this.game;\n    const [cx, cz] = def.at;\n    const r = g.rng.ai;\n    const count = sq.alive;\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      const a = (i / Math.max(1, count)) * Math.PI * 2 + r.range(-0.4, 0.4), rad = def.post ? r.range(3, 8) : r.range(6, Math.max(10, (def.site?.r ?? 20) * 0.5));\n      let x = cx + Math.cos(a) * rad, z = cz + Math.sin(a) * rad;\n      if (!g.world.nav.walkable(x, z)) { x = cx + r.range(-2, 2); z = cz + r.range(-2, 2); }\n      let role = 'rifle';\n      const opts = {};\n      if (def.tower && i === 0) { role = 'sniper'; opts.fixed = true; x = cx + def.tower[0]; z = cz + def.tower[1]; opts.y = g.world.heightAt(x, z) + 4.6; }\n      else if (i === count - 1 && count >= 5) role = 'mg';\n      else if (i === 2 && count >= 8) role = 'rocket';\n      const s = this.makeSoldier(ctx, { faction: def.faction, role, x, z, yaw: r.range(-3, 3), squad: sq, duty: def.duty ?? (i % 3 === 2 ? 'patrol' : 'guard'), ...opts });\n      sq.members.push(s);\n    }\n    sq.flanker = sq.members.find((m) => m.role === 'rifle') ?? null;\n    g.events.emit('squad-live', sq.key);\n  }\n  sleepSquad(sq) {\n    for (const m of sq.members) if (m.active) this.release(m);\n    sq.members = [];\n    sq.live = false;\n  }\n  updateBubble(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.round?.isClient) return;\n    const f = g.anchor();\n    for (const sq of this.squads.values()) {\n      if (sq.disabled) { if (sq.live) this.sleepSquad(sq); continue; }\n      if (sq.def.when && !sq.def.when()) { if (sq.live) this.sleepSquad(sq); continue; }\n      const [cx, cz] = sq.def.at, d = Math.hypot(cx - f.x, cz - f.z);\n      if (!sq.live && (d < BUBBLE || sq.forceLive) && sq.alive > 0) this.liveSquad(ctx, sq);\n      else if (sq.live && d > BUBBLE_OUT && !sq.forceLive) this.sleepSquad(sq);\n      // A cleared post re-mans after postRemanHours; the source's instant respawn is an annoyance we do not copy.\n      if (sq.alive === 0 && sq.clearedAt != null && !sq.def.noReman && g.clock.abs - sq.clearedAt >= TUNING.postRemanHours && d > 120) {\n        if (sq.def.post || sq.def.remans) { sq.alive = sq.def.n; sq.clearedAt = null; if (sq.live) this.sleepSquad(sq); g.events.emit('squad-remanned', sq.key); }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // ---- targets and senses ----\n  playerInfo() {\n    const g = this.game, f = g.player.feet;\n    return { kind: 'player', ref: 'player', x: f.x, y: f.y, z: f.z, eyeY: f.y + (g.player.stance === 'crouch' ? 0.9 : 1.45), fast: g.player.speedNow > 5, inVehicle: !!g.player.seat };\n  }\n  /** Who this soldier is angry at right now: the player, a buddy, the other army when the truce is over. */\n  pickTarget(s) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (s.pickT > 0 && s.cachedTarget) { s.pickT -= 0.1; if (s.cachedTarget.refresh) s.cachedTarget.refresh(); return s.cachedTarget; }\n    s.pickT = 0.5;\n    let best = null, bd = 1e9;\n    if (g.round) {\n      for (const m of g.round.liveMercs()) {\n        const d = Math.hypot(m.x - s.x, m.z - s.z);\n        if (d < bd) { bd = d; best = m.targetInfo(); }\n      }\n      s.cachedTarget = best;\n      return best;\n    }\n    if (g.hasPlayer && this.hostileToPlayer(s) && !g.dev.invisible) {\n      const p = this.playerInfo();\n      bd = Math.hypot(p.x - s.x, p.z - s.z); best = p;\n      best.refresh = () => { const q = this.playerInfo(); Object.assign(best, q); };\n    }\n    for (const b of this.buddies) {\n      if (!b.active || b.dead || b.isDown) continue;\n      const d = Math.hypot(b.x - s.x, b.z - s.z);\n      if (d < bd && d < 60) { bd = d; best = b.targetInfo(); }\n    }\n    if (g.story.war) {\n      for (const o of this.soldiers) {\n        if (!o.active || o.dead || o.faction === s.faction) continue;\n        const d = Math.hypot(o.x - s.x, o.z - s.z);\n        if (d < bd && d < 80) { bd = d; const w = o; best = { kind: 'soldier', ref: w, x: w.x, y: w.y, z: w.z, eyeY: w.y + 1.4, fast: false, refresh() { this.x = w.x; this.y = w.y; this.z = w.z; this.eyeY = w.y + 1.4; } }; }\n      }\n    }\n    s.cachedTarget = best;\n    return best;\n  }\n  hostileToPlayer(s) {\n    const g = this.game, f = g.player.feet;\n    // Inside Mile Forty, while the truce holds, nobody shoots.\n    if (g.story.truce && Math.hypot(f.x - SITES['mile-forty'].at[0], f.z - SITES['mile-forty'].at[1]) < SITES['mile-forty'].noFire) return false;\n    if (g.story.pass === s.faction && !s.squad?.angry) {\n      const inner = this.innerYard(s.faction);\n      if (inner && Math.hypot(f.x - inner.x, f.z - inner.z) < inner.r) return true;\n      return false;\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n  innerYard(faction) {\n    const site = faction === 'concord' ? SITES['fort-clement'] : faction === 'harvest' ? SITES.granary : null;\n    return site ? { x: site.at[0], z: site.at[1], r: site.inner } : null;\n  }\n  visionFor(s, tgt, dist) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    let v = TUNING.enemyVision * (s.role === 'sniper' ? 1.8 : 1);\n    if (tgt.kind === 'player') {\n      const p = g.player;\n      if (p.stance === 'crouch') v *= 0.55;\n      if (p.inGrass && g.ground.kindAt(p.feet.x, p.feet.z) !== 1) v *= p.stance === 'crouch' || !p.moving ? 0.6 : 0.85;\n      if (g.clock.isNight()) { v *= 0.45; if (g.time < p.litUntil || g.body.burning > 0 || g.fireView.nearestDist < 30) v *= 2; }\n    } else if (g.clock.isNight()) v *= 0.6;\n    return v;\n  }\n  /** A shot rings out: everyone inside the radius wakes. */\n  heardGunshot(x, z, radius, who) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    for (const s of this.soldiers) {\n      if (!s.active || s.dead) continue;\n      const d = Math.hypot(s.x - x, s.z - z);\n      if (d > radius) continue;\n      s.sleeping = false;\n      if (who === 'player' && s.squad && g.story.pass === s.faction && d < 60) s.squad.angry = true;\n      if (s.state === 'idle' || s.state === 'suspicious') { s.state = 'searching'; s.searchT = 20; s.lastKnown = { x: x + g.rng.ai.range(-12, 12), z: z + g.rng.ai.range(-12, 12) }; if (s.barkCool <= 0) { g.voice.bark(s, 'heard'); s.barkCool = 5; } }\n      else if (s.state === 'searching') s.lastKnown = { x: x + g.rng.ai.range(-8, 8), z: z + g.rng.ai.range(-8, 8) };\n    }\n    this.civilians.heard(x, z, radius);\n    this.fauna.scare(x, z, radius);\n  }\n  nearestCover(s, from) {\n    const list = s.squad?.def.site?.cover;\n    const g = this.game;\n    let best = null, bd = 1e9;\n    if (list) {\n      const [cx, cz] = s.squad.def.at;\n      for (const [dx, dz] of list) {\n        const x = cx + dx, z = cz + dz, d = Math.hypot(x - s.x, z - s.z);\n        if (d < bd) { bd = d; best = { x, z }; }\n      }\n    }\n    if (best && bd < 28) {\n      // Stand on the far side from the threat.\n      const ax = best.x - from.x, az = best.z - from.z, l = Math.hypot(ax, az) || 1;\n      return { x: best.x + (ax / l) * 1.4, z: best.z + (az / l) * 1.4 };\n    }\n    for (const t of g.treeColliders) {\n      const d = Math.hypot(t.x - s.x, t.z - s.z);\n      if (d < 12 && d < bd) { bd = d; const ax = t.x - from.x, az = t.z - from.z, l = Math.hypot(ax, az) || 1; best = { x: t.x + (ax / l) * 1.2, z: t.z + (az / l) * 1.2 }; }\n    }\n    return best;\n  }\n  requestPath(s) { if (!this.pathQueue.includes(s)) this.pathQueue.push(s); }\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    // Paths: at most 2 per step.\n    for (let i = 0; i < 2 && this.pathQueue.length; i++) {\n      const s = this.pathQueue.shift();\n      if (s.dead || !s.active || !s.goal) continue;\n      s.path = g.world.nav.path([s.x, s.y, s.z], [s.goal.x, s.y, s.goal.z]);\n      s.pathI = 1;\n      if (!s.path) { s.goal = null; }\n    }\n    // Brains at 10 Hz, spread across steps.\n    const tick = g.tick;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.soldiers.length; i++) {\n      const s = this.soldiers[i];\n      if (!s.active || s.dead || s.puppet) continue;\n      if ((tick + s.id) % 6 === 0) {\n        s.barkCool -= 0.1;\n        if (!s.burning) s.perceive(0.1);\n        s.tree.tick(0.1);\n      }\n      s.fixedUpdate(ctx, dt);\n    }\n    for (const b of this.buddies) b.fixedUpdate(ctx, dt);\n    this.civilians.fixedUpdate(ctx, dt);\n    if (tick % 30 === 0) this.updateBubble(ctx);\n    if (tick % 60 === 7) this.tidyCorpses();\n  }\n  tidyCorpses() {\n    const f = this.game.anchor();\n    // Corpses far outside the bubble go back to the pool.\n    for (let i = this.soldiers.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      const s = this.soldiers[i];\n      if (s.dead && !s.squad?.live && Math.hypot(s.x - f.x, s.z - f.z) > 200) this.release(s);\n    }\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    for (const s of this.soldiers) s.update(ctx, dt);\n    for (const b of this.buddies) b.update(ctx, dt);\n    this.civilians.update(ctx, dt);\n    this.fauna.update(ctx, dt);\n    for (const d of this.dropped) if (d.object) d.object.rotation.y += 0;\n  }\n  /** A gun off the ground starts at condition 20 to 55. */\n  dropGun(s) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.dropped.length > 14) { const old = this.dropped.shift(); g.ctx.scene.remove(old.object); g.interact.remove(old.usable); }\n    const id = g.rng.ai.chance(0.82) ? 'tractor' : g.rng.ai.chance(0.5) ? 'mule' : 'm38';\n    const cond = g.rng.ai.int(20, 55);\n    const x = s.x + g.rng.ai.range(-0.5, 0.5), z = s.z + g.rng.ai.range(-0.5, 0.5), y = g.world.heightAt(x, z);\n    const build = buildModel('ground-gun', { catalog: MODELS });\n    build.object.position.set(x, y + 0.02, z); build.object.rotation.y = g.rng.ai.range(0, 6.28);\n    setLookLayer(build.object, 'actors');\n    g.ctx.scene.add(build.object);\n    const d = { object: build.object, id, cond };\n    d.usable = g.interact.add({ x, y: y + 0.2, z, r: 2, verb: () => `TAKE THE ${WEAPONS[id].name}`, when: () => !g.player.seat, onUse: () => { g.weapons.give(id, cond, true); g.ctx.scene.remove(build.object); g.interact.remove(d.usable); this.dropped.splice(this.dropped.indexOf(d), 1); g.sfx.play('gun-equip'); g.events.emit('pickup-gun', id); } });\n    this.dropped.push(d);\n  }\n  // ---- buddies ----\n  buddy(id) { return this.buddies.find((b) => b.id === id); }\n  rescuer() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    return this.buddies.find((b) => b.met && !b.dead && g.clock.abs >= b.spentUntil && g.clock.abs >= b.woundedUntil) ?? null;\n  }\n  startRescue(b) { b.rescue(); }\n  liveBuddies() { return this.buddies.filter((b) => b.met && !b.dead); }\n  anyStateCounts() { let live = 0; for (const s of this.soldiers) if (s.active && !s.dead) live++; return live; }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/buddy.js <<'EOF'\n// Hired friends: a named person with trust, a rescue, an alternate plan, and an end. The same brain walks the Cash Run's hired guns.\nimport { THREE, CharacterController, buildModel, setLookLayer } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { TUNING } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { clamp, wrapAngle } from '../core/rng.js';\nconst { Vector3 } = THREE;\nexport const BUDDIES = {\n  ines: { id: 'ines', name: 'INES', model: 'ines', perk: 'range', voice: 'ines', rescueR: 500 },\n  dov: { id: 'dov', name: 'DOV', model: 'dov', perk: 'charges', voice: 'dov', rescueR: 300 },\n  mags: { id: 'mags', name: 'MAGS', model: 'mags', perk: 'medic', voice: 'mags', rescueR: 300 },\n  pell: { id: 'pell', name: 'PELL', model: 'pell', perk: 'none', voice: 'pell', rescueR: 0, guide: true },\n};\nexport class Buddy {\n  kind = 'buddy'; met = false; dead = false; trust = 0; spentUntil = 0; woundedUntil = 0; active = false; hp = 200; isDown = false; downT = 0; burningDown = false; x = 0; y = 0; z = 0; yaw = 0; goal = null; fireCool = 0; following = true; burstLeft = 0; burstPause = 0; moveWanted = 0;\n  constructor(game, id) { this.game = game; this.id = id; this.def = BUDDIES[id]; }\n  get name() { return this.def.name; }\n  resetAll() { this.met = false; this.dead = false; this.trust = 0; this.spentUntil = 0; this.woundedUntil = 0; this.despawn(); }\n  targetInfo() { const b = this; return { kind: 'buddy', ref: this, x: b.x, y: b.y, z: b.z, eyeY: b.y + 1.45, fast: false, refresh() { this.x = b.x; this.y = b.y; this.z = b.z; this.eyeY = b.y + 1.45; } }; }\n  makeBody(ctx) {\n    if (this.cc) return;\n    this.cc = new CharacterController(ctx.physics, { position: [this.x, this.y + 0.1, this.z], radius: 0.32, halfHeight: 0.56, speed: 5, jumpSpeed: 0, gravity: -24 });\n    ctx.physics.tag(this.cc.collider, 'npc');\n    this.game.hitMap.set(this.cc.collider.handle, { kind: 'buddy', ref: this });\n  }\n  makeView(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.view || !g.views) return;\n    const p = makePerson(this.def.model);\n    const gun = buildModel('npc-rifle', { catalog: MODELS });\n    setLookLayer(gun.object, 'actors');\n    gun.object.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2; gun.object.position.set(0, -0.08, 0.04);\n    p.object.getObjectByName('HandR').add(gun.object);\n    this.view = p; this.gunObj = gun.object;\n    ctx.scene.add(p.object);\n  }\n  /** Put them in the world, fighting beside you. */\n  spawn(ctx, x, z, { hp = 200, goal = null, following = true } = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.x = x; this.z = z; this.y = g.world.heightAt(x, z); this.hp = hp; this.maxHp = hp; this.isDown = false; this.active = true; this.goal = goal; this.following = following; this.burningDown = false; this.downT = 0;\n    this.makeBody(ctx);\n    this.cc.collider.setEnabled(true);\n    this.cc.teleport([x, this.y + 0.1, z]);\n    this.makeView(ctx);\n    if (this.view) { this.view.object.visible = true; this.view.anim.stop(); this.view.anim.set('Idle', 'AimIdle'); if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = true; }\n    g.events.emit('buddy-spawned', this.id);\n  }\n  despawn() {\n    this.active = false; this.isDown = false;\n    if (this.cc) { this.cc.teleport([this.x, -40, this.z]); this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false); }\n    if (this.view) this.view.object.visible = false;\n    if (this.usable) { this.game.interact.remove(this.usable); this.usable = null; }\n  }\n  hurt(a, who) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (this.isDown || this.dead || !this.active || g.dev.god) return;\n    this.hp -= a;\n    if (this.hp <= 0) this.goDown(false);\n  }\n  /** At 0 they fall, wounded, for 40 s. At their side, Syrette or Finish It. If they are burning they ask you to finish it. */\n  goDown(burning) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.isDown = true; this.downT = 40; this.burningDown = burning; this.hp = 0;\n    this.view?.anim.set('WoundedSit', 'WoundedSit', 0.15);\n    if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = false;\n    g.say(this.id, burning ? \"DON'T LET IT BE THE FIRE. PLEASE. NOT THE FIRE.\" : `${this.name} IS DOWN.`, 4);\n    g.events.emit('buddy-down', this, burning);\n    this.usable = g.interact.add({ x: this.x, y: this.y + 0.8, z: this.z, r: 2.6, wide: true, marker: true, buddy: this,\n      verb: () => (g.body.syrettes > 0 ? 'SYRETTE' : 'NO SYRETTES'), altVerb: () => 'FINISH IT',\n      enabled: () => g.body.syrettes > 0,\n      onUse: () => this.saved(), onAlt: () => this.finish() });\n  }\n  saved() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.body.syrettes <= 0) return;\n    g.body.syrettes--;\n    this.isDown = false; this.hp = this.maxHp * 0.5; this.trust++;\n    if (this.usable) { g.interact.remove(this.usable); this.usable = null; }\n    this.view?.anim.set('Idle', 'AimIdle');\n    if (this.gunObj) this.gunObj.visible = true;\n    g.sfx.play('syrette');\n    g.say(this.id, g.dialogue.pick(`${this.id}.saved`), 4);\n    g.ledger.note('saved', this.id);\n    g.events.emit('buddy-saved', this);\n  }\n  finish() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.vm.showProp('p-finish');\n    g.vm.play('FinishIt', { onEnd: () => g.vm.showGun(g.weapons.gun?.id ?? 'cane', false) });\n    g.after(0.85, () => { g.sfx.play('gun-m38'); g.ctx.engine.shake.add(0.2); g.rumble(0.7, 0.15); this.killed('mercy'); });\n  }\n  killed(how) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.dead = true; this.isDown = false;\n    if (this.usable) { g.interact.remove(this.usable); this.usable = null; }\n    if (this.view) { this.view.anim.set('LieIdle', 'LieIdle', 0.3); }\n    if (this.cc) this.cc.collider.setEnabled(false);\n    g.ledger.add('friends', 1);\n    g.ledger.note('friend', this.id, how);\n    g.events.emit('buddy-dead', this, how);\n    g.world.nameOnWall?.(this);\n  }\n  /** Rescue scene: you are dragged backward, they swear, you are up at 40 (Mags 60) and they are spent for a day. */\n  rescue() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const f = g.player.feet;\n    const hp = this.id === 'mags' ? 60 : 40;\n    g.scene.playRescue(this, () => {\n      g.body.hp = hp; g.body.burning = 0; g.body.lastHit = g.time;\n      this.spentUntil = g.clock.abs + 24;\n      if (g.rng.story.chance(TUNING.buddyWoundChance)) { this.woundedUntil = g.clock.abs + 48; g.say(this.id, g.dialogue.pick(`${this.id}.wounded`) ?? 'THAT WAS THE LAST ONE I HAD IN ME.', 3.5); }\n      this.trust = Math.max(0, this.trust);\n      g.ledger.note('rescued', this.id);\n      g.events.emit('rescued', this);\n    });\n  }\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (!this.active || this.dead) return;\n    if (this.isDown) {\n      this.downT -= dt;\n      if (this.burningDown && g.tick % 10 === 0) ctx.particles.burst('vehicle-flame', [this.x, this.y + 0.6, this.z], { count: 2 });\n      if (this.downT <= 0) { g.say('', `${this.name} HAS STOPPED ASKING.`, 3); this.killed('wound'); }\n      return;\n    }\n    if (g.fire.isBurning(this.x, this.z) && !this.fireProof) this.hurt(6 * dt, 'fire');\n    // Brain: go to a goal or stay near you; shoot what shoots you.\n    if (g.tick % 6 === 0) this.think(ctx);\n    const mv = this.mv ?? (this.mv = new Vector3());\n    mv.set(0, 0, 0);\n    let tx = null, tz = null;\n    if (this.goal) { tx = this.goal.x; tz = this.goal.z; if (Math.hypot(tx - this.x, tz - this.z) < 2) { const done = this.goal.done; this.goal = null; done?.(); } }\n    else if (this.following && g.hasPlayer && !g.player.seat) {\n      const f = g.player.feet, d = Math.hypot(f.x - this.x, f.z - this.z);\n      if (d > 7) { tx = f.x; tz = f.z; }\n    }\n    if (tx != null) {\n      const dx = tx - this.x, dz = tz - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1;\n      mv.set(dx / l, 0, dz / l);\n      this.cc.speed = l > 25 ? 6.4 : 5;\n      if (!this.aimAt) this.yaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n      this.moveWanted = this.cc.speed;\n    } else this.moveWanted = 0;\n    this.cc.setInput(mv, false, false);\n    this.cc.fixedUpdate(dt);\n    const f = this.cc.feet;\n    this.x = f.x; this.y = f.y; this.z = f.z;\n    this.fireCool -= dt;\n    if (this.burstLeft > 0 && this.fireCool <= 0 && this.aimAt) this.shoot(ctx);\n  }\n  think(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.aimAt = null;\n    let bd = 70;\n    for (const s of g.actors.soldiers) {\n      if (!s.active || s.dead) continue;\n      if (g.story.pass === s.faction && !s.squad?.angry) continue;\n      const d = Math.hypot(s.x - this.x, s.z - this.z);\n      if (d < bd && (s.state === 'alert' || d < 30)) { bd = d; this.aimAt = s; }\n    }\n    if (this.aimAt) {\n      this.yaw = Math.atan2(this.aimAt.x - this.x, this.aimAt.z - this.z);\n      this.burstPause -= 0.1;\n      if (this.burstLeft <= 0 && this.burstPause <= 0) { this.burstLeft = g.rng.ai.int(2, 4); this.burstPause = g.rng.ai.range(0.8, 1.6); }\n    }\n  }\n  shoot(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game, t = this.aimAt, r = g.rng.ai;\n    this.burstLeft--; this.fireCool = 0.14;\n    const dx = t.x - this.x, dy = t.y + 1 - (this.y + 1.4), dz = t.z - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dy, dz) || 1;\n    const e = 0.05;\n    const hit = g.damage.bullet(this.x + (dx / l) * 0.6, this.y + 1.4, this.z + (dz / l) * 0.6, dx / l + r.range(-e, e), dy / l + r.range(-e, e), dz / l + r.range(-e, e), 120, 16, this);\n    if (hit) g.fx.tracer(this.x, this.y + 1.4, this.z, hit.x, hit.y, hit.z);\n    g.sfx.at('gun-tractor-far', this.x, this.z, { max: 200, volume: 0.9 });\n    this.view?.anim.shot('FireRecoil');\n    if (t.dead && g.rng.ai.chance(0.3)) g.say(this.id, g.dialogue.pick(`${this.id}.fight`) ?? '', 2.4);\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    if (!this.active || !this.view) return;\n    const o = this.view.object;\n    if (this.cc) { const f = this.cc.interpolatedFeet(ctx.physics.alpha); o.position.set(f.x, f.y, f.z); }\n    o.rotation.y = this.yaw;\n    if (!this.isDown && !this.dead) this.view.anim.set(this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'Run' : 'Idle', this.moveWanted > 0 ? 'AimWalk' : 'AimIdle');\n    if (this.moveWanted > 0) this.view.anim.speed(this.moveWanted / 6.5);\n    this.view.anim.update(dt);\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/civilian.js <<'EOF'\n// Walk between points in Mile Forty and Three Wells; flee on gunfire or fire. Hits are ignored; the Ledger counts displacement, not bodies.\nimport { THREE } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { SITES } from '../content/sites.js';\nimport { makePerson } from './rig.js';\nimport { clamp, wrapAngle } from '../core/rng.js';\nconst { BoxGeometry } = THREE;\nconst PALETTES = [{ cloth: 'sand', dark: 'red', skin: 'plum', hat: 'white' }, { cloth: 'white', dark: 'slate', skin: 'red', hat: 'orange' }, { cloth: 'orange', dark: 'plum', skin: 'sand', hat: 'red' }, { cloth: 'teal', dark: 'night', skin: 'orange', hat: 'sand' }];\nclass Civilian {\n  kind = 'civilian'; fleeT = 0; goal = null; moveT = 0; hidden = false;\n  constructor(sys, home, at, i) { this.sys = sys; this.home = home; this.x = at[0]; this.z = at[1]; this.i = i; this.y = sys.game.world.heightAt(at[0], at[1]); this.yaw = 0; }\n  flee(fromX, fromZ) { this.fleeT = 8; const dx = this.x - fromX, dz = this.z - fromZ, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1; this.goal = { x: this.x + (dx / l) * 40, z: this.z + (dz / l) * 40 }; }\n  step(dt) {\n    const g = this.sys.game;\n    if (this.hidden) return;\n    this.fleeT -= dt;\n    if (!this.goal && (this.moveT -= dt) <= 0) {\n      const r = g.rng.ai, a = r.range(0, 6.28), rr = r.range(4, this.home.r * 0.45);\n      this.goal = { x: this.home.at[0] + Math.cos(a) * rr, z: this.home.at[1] + Math.sin(a) * rr };\n      this.moveT = r.range(4, 12);\n    }\n    if (this.goal) {\n      const dx = this.goal.x - this.x, dz = this.goal.z - this.z, l = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\n      if (l < 0.8) { this.goal = null; this.speed = 0; return; }\n      const sp = this.fleeT > 0 ? 5.2 : 1.3;\n      this.x += (dx / l) * sp * dt; this.z += (dz / l) * sp * dt;\n      this.y = g.world.heightAt(this.x, this.z);\n      this.yaw = Math.atan2(dx, dz); this.speed = sp;\n      if (!g.world.nav.walkable(this.x, this.z)) { this.goal = null; }\n    } else this.speed = 0;\n  }\n}\nexport class Civilians {\n  list = []; column = null; columnList = []; emptyWells = false;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  build(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const towns = [[SITES['three-wells'], SITES['three-wells'].civilians], [SITES['mile-forty'], 10]];\n    let i = 0;\n    for (const [site, n] of towns) {\n      for (let k = 0; k < n; k++, i++) {\n        const a = (k / n) * 6.28, r = site.r * 0.35;\n        this.list.push(new Civilian(this, site, [site.at[0] + Math.cos(a) * r, site.at[1] + Math.sin(a) * r], i));\n      }\n    }\n    if (g.views) {\n      for (const c of this.list) {\n        const p = makePerson('civilian', PALETTES[c.i % 4]);\n        c.view = p; ctx.scene.add(p.object); p.anim.set('Idle', 'Idle');\n      }\n    }\n    for (const c of this.list) {\n      const body = ctx.physics.addStaticBox({ position: [c.x, c.y + 0.9, c.z], halfExtents: [0.3, 0.9, 0.3] });\n      c.body = body; g.hitMap.set(body.handle, { kind: 'civilian', ref: c });\n    }\n  }\n  reset() { for (const c of this.list) { c.hidden = false; c.fleeT = 0; c.goal = null; if (c.view) c.view.object.visible = true; } this.emptyWells = false; this.columnList = []; this.column = null; }\n  heard(x, z, r) { for (const c of this.list) if (!c.hidden && Math.hypot(c.x - x, c.z - z) < r) c.flee(x, z); }\n  /** The village empties: a line of people walks the road to the clinic, huts go dark. */\n  emptyVillage() {\n    this.emptyWells = true;\n    for (const c of this.list) if (c.home === SITES['three-wells']) { c.hidden = true; if (c.view) c.view.object.visible = false; }\n    this.game.ledger.add('moved', 240);\n  }\n  showVillage() { this.emptyWells = false; for (const c of this.list) if (c.home === SITES['three-wells']) { c.hidden = false; if (c.view) c.view.object.visible = true; } }\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.round) return;\n    const f = g.anchor();\n    for (const c of this.list) {\n      if (c.hidden || Math.hypot(c.x - f.x, c.z - f.z) > 280) continue;\n      c.step(dt);\n      if (g.tick % 20 === c.i % 20) {\n        if (g.fire.isBurning(c.x, c.z) || g.fireView.nearestDist < 30 && g.fire.isBurning(c.x + 8, c.z)) c.flee(c.x + g.rng.ai.range(-3, 3), c.z + g.rng.ai.range(-3, 3));\n      }\n      c.body?.setTranslation?.({ x: c.x, y: c.y + 0.9, z: c.z });\n    }\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    const cam = this.game.camPos;\n    for (const c of this.list) {\n      if (!c.view || c.hidden) continue;\n      if (Math.hypot(c.x - cam.x, c.z - cam.z) > 170) { c.view.object.visible = false; continue; }\n      c.view.object.visible = true;\n      c.view.object.position.set(c.x, c.y, c.z); c.view.object.rotation.y = c.yaw;\n      c.view.anim.set(c.speed > 3 ? 'Run' : c.speed > 0 ? 'Walk' : 'Idle');\n      c.view.anim.speed(c.speed > 3 ? c.speed / 6.5 : 1);\n      c.view.anim.update(dt);\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/actors/fauna.js <<'EOF'\n// Gazelle herds in open grass and vultures over burnt ground. Atmosphere; they can't hurt you.\nimport { THREE, buildModel, compileClips, setLookLayer, Boids } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { MODELS } from '../art/models.js';\nimport { FAUNA_CLIPS, FAUNA_RIG } from '../art/clips.js';\nimport { K } from '../world/ground.js';\nconst { AnimationMixer } = THREE;\nexport class Fauna {\n  herds = []; birds = [];\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  build(ctx) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (!g.views) return;\n    const sample = buildModel('gazelle', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n    this.clips = Object.fromEntries(compileClips(FAUNA_CLIPS, FAUNA_RIG, sample).map((c) => [c.name, c]));\n    const spots = [[-320, 170], [250, 280], [-120, -80], [420, 120], [-470, 260], [120, -60]];\n    const r = ctx.random.fork('herd');\n    for (const [hx, hz] of spots) {\n      const herd = { hx, hz, animals: [], fleeT: 0, dir: 0 };\n      for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n        const o = buildModel('gazelle', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n        setLookLayer(o, 'actors');\n        o.traverse((m) => { if (m.isMesh) m.castShadow = true; });\n        const x = hx + r.range(-14, 14), z = hz + r.range(-14, 14);\n        const mixer = new AnimationMixer(o);\n        const graze = mixer.clipAction(this.clips.GazGraze), run = mixer.clipAction(this.clips.GazRun);\n        graze.play(); graze.time = r.range(0, 3);\n        ctx.scene.add(o);\n        herd.animals.push({ o, x, z, y: g.world.heightAt(x, z), yaw: r.range(0, 6.28), mixer, graze, run, running: false, off: r.range(0, 1) });\n      }\n      this.herds.push(herd);\n    }\n    // Vultures: a tiny flock circling the highest scar.\n    this.flock = new Boids(10, { bounds: { min: [-70, 70, -70], max: [70, 110, 70] }, seed: 11 });\n    this.birdCenter = [0, 40, 0];\n    for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n      const o = buildModel('vulture', { catalog: MODELS }).object;\n      setLookLayer(o, 'actors');\n      ctx.scene.add(o);\n      this.birds.push({ o, wr: o.getObjectByName('WingR'), wl: o.getObjectByName('WingL'), ph: i * 0.8 });\n    }\n  }\n  reset() {\n    for (const h of this.herds) { h.fleeT = 0; for (const a of h.animals) a.running = false; }\n  }\n  scare(x, z, r) {\n    for (const h of this.herds) {\n      if (Math.hypot(h.hx - x, h.hz - z) < r * 1.1 && h.fleeT <= 0) { h.fleeT = 7; h.dir = Math.atan2(h.hx - x, h.hz - z); }\n    }\n  }\n  update(ctx, dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (!g.views) return;\n    const cam = g.camPos;\n    for (const h of this.herds) {\n      if (g.fireView.nearestDist < 90 && Math.hypot(h.hx - cam.x, h.hz - cam.z) < 200 && h.fleeT <= 0) { h.fleeT = 6; h.dir = g.wind.dir; }\n      h.fleeT -= dt;\n      const near = Math.hypot(h.hx - cam.x, h.hz - cam.z) < 200;\n      for (const a of h.animals) {\n        a.o.visible = near;\n        if (!near) continue;\n        const flee = h.fleeT > 0;\n        if (flee !== a.running) { a.running = flee; if (flee) { a.run.reset().play(); a.graze.crossFadeTo(a.run, 0.15, false); } else { a.graze.reset().play(); a.run.crossFadeTo(a.graze, 0.3, false); } }\n        if (flee) {\n          a.yaw = h.dir + Math.sin(g.time + a.off * 6) * 0.2;\n          const nx = a.x + Math.sin(a.yaw) * 11 * dt, nz = a.z + Math.cos(a.yaw) * 11 * dt;\n          if (g.ground.kindAt(nx, nz) !== K.WATER && Math.abs(nx) < 620 && Math.abs(nz) < 620) { a.x = nx; a.z = nz; }\n          a.y = g.world.heightAt(a.x, a.z);\n        }\n        a.o.position.set(a.x, a.y, a.z); a.o.rotation.y = a.yaw;\n        a.mixer.update(dt);\n      }\n    }\n    if (this.flock) {\n      const fire = g.fire;\n      // Circle the most recent large burn, or the Cut.\n      const c = fire.burntList.length > 20 ? [fire.wx(fire.burntList[fire.burntList.length - 1]), fire.wz(fire.burntList[fire.burntList.length - 1])] : [cam.x + 120, cam.z - 150];\n      this.birdCenter[0] += (c[0] - this.birdCenter[0]) * dt * 0.1; this.birdCenter[2] += (c[1] - this.birdCenter[2]) * dt * 0.1;\n      this.flock.step(Math.min(dt, 1 / 20));\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.birds.length; i++) {\n        const b = this.birds[i], p = this.flock.pos, v = this.flock.vel, k = i * 3;\n        b.o.position.set(this.birdCenter[0] + p[k], p[k + 1] + 20, this.birdCenter[2] + p[k + 2]);\n        b.o.rotation.y = Math.atan2(v[k], v[k + 2]);\n        const f = Math.sin(g.time * 2.4 + b.ph) * 0.25;\n        if (b.wr) b.wr.rotation.z = f; if (b.wl) b.wl.rotation.z = -f;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Write soldiers, squads, buddies, civilians and fauna"}}}
