{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkguusTM5L4cYSLouBfU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0174NsdpXnRcme55LPEM6AEY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 2251,2262p API.md | cut -c1-200; grep -n \"settings.set\\|\\`set(\" API.md | head -5 | cut -c1-200; sed -n \"$(grep -n '^### class Settings' API.md | cut -d: -f1),+16p\" API.md | cut -c1-220; sed -n \"$(grep -n '^### interface PlayerSettings' API.md | cut -d: -f1),+12p\" API.md | cut -c1-200; sed -n \"$(grep -n '^### PIXEL_SIZES' API.md | cut -d: -f1),+5p\" API.md | cut -c1-200","description":"Check pointer button events and engine settings API"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11285,"cache_read_input_tokens":441303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11285},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"b34b686e-1be0-473b-812d-f0084b57d7e0","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:59:33.168Z","request_id":"req_011CgkguubqLz5FNio1HHod7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0174NsdpXnRcme55LPEM6AEY":{"command":"sed -n 2251,2262p API.md | cut -c1-200; grep -n \"settings.set\\|\\`set(\" API.md | head -5 | cut -c1-200; sed -n \"$(grep -n '^### class Settings' API.md | cut -d: -f1),+16p\" API.md | cut -c1-220; sed -n \"$(grep -n '^### interface PlayerSettings' API.md | cut -d: -f1),+12p\" API.md | cut -c1-200; sed -n \"$(grep -n '^### PIXEL_SIZES' API.md | cut -d: -f1),+5p\" API.md | cut -c1-200","description":"Check pointer button events and engine settings API"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0174NsdpXnRcme55LPEM6AEY","type":"tool_result","content":"### interface ButtonEvent\n\nA pointer button pressed or let go (`Input.buttonEvents`): its key, and where the pointer was (normalised device coordinates).\n\n- `readonly code: string`\n- `readonly down: boolean`\n- `readonly x: number`\n- `readonly y: number`\n\n### DEFAULT_TOUCH_BUTTONS\n\n```ts\n320:- `set(progress: number, label?: string): void`: `progress` 0..1; `label` is shown in capitals.\n471:- `set(patch: PlayerSettings): void`: Change some settings: applied at once and saved. A field set to `undefined` goes back to the game's.\n1721:- `set(options: MoverOptions): void`: Change the options (a lift that starts moving: set a path). Its clock keeps running.\n2084:- `set(i: number, x: number, y: number, z: number): void`: Place particle `i` (and stop it).\n2432:A game drives it at runtime: `set(code, state)` (icon, cooldown, badge, disabled, hidden),\nsed: -e expression #1, char 4: unknown command: `\n'\n### interface PlayerSettings\n\nThe player's settings: the standard picture and engine options every game gets, as plain data\n(sound is the AudioManager's, which keeps its own volumes). A field left out is the game's own\nchoice; a field set is the player's and wins over it. `engine.settings` holds them, applies\nthem, saves them per game and shows them in the settings panel (the ⚙ button).\n\n- `look?: string`: A LOOK_PRESETS name. Left out: the look the game gives each level.\n- `pixelArt?: boolean`: Pixel art (the pixel pass), or false for smooth 3D (render mode `raw`).\n- `pixelSize?: 'fine' | 'chunky'`: The art resolution: `fine` (the game's, 480×270 by default) or `chunky` (two thirds of it: bigger pixels).\n- `quality?: QualityOption`: Shadow and light quality: a level, or `auto` (the device's).\n- `fps?: number`: Frame cap: 60, 30, or 0 for the display's own rate.\n- `debugInfo?: boolean`: The debug panel: frame rate, camera, GPU errors and the game's status.\n### PIXEL_SIZES\n\n```ts\nconst PIXEL_SIZES: readonly [\"fine\", \"chunky\"]\n```","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"c6e40211-160b-44e3-b1ff-228fb7b7e5fb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:59:33.211Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### interface ButtonEvent\n\nA pointer button pressed or let go (`Input.buttonEvents`): its key, and where the pointer was (normalised device coordinates).\n\n- `readonly code: string`\n- `readonly down: boolean`\n- `readonly x: number`\n- `readonly y: number`\n\n### DEFAULT_TOUCH_BUTTONS\n\n```ts\n320:- `set(progress: number, label?: string): void`: `progress` 0..1; `label` is shown in capitals.\n471:- `set(patch: PlayerSettings): void`: Change some settings: applied at once and saved. A field set to `undefined` goes back to the game's.\n1721:- `set(options: MoverOptions): void`: Change the options (a lift that starts moving: set a path). Its clock keeps running.\n2084:- `set(i: number, x: number, y: number, z: number): void`: Place particle `i` (and stop it).\n2432:A game drives it at runtime: `set(code, state)` (icon, cooldown, badge, disabled, hidden),\nsed: -e expression #1, char 4: unknown command: `\n'\n### interface PlayerSettings\n\nThe player's settings: the standard picture and engine options every game gets, as plain data\n(sound is the AudioManager's, which keeps its own volumes). A field left out is the game's own\nchoice; a field set is the player's and wins over it. `engine.settings` holds them, applies\nthem, saves them per game and shows them in the settings panel (the ⚙ button).\n\n- `look?: string`: A LOOK_PRESETS name. Left out: the look the game gives each level.\n- `pixelArt?: boolean`: Pixel art (the pixel pass), or false for smooth 3D (render mode `raw`).\n- `pixelSize?: 'fine' | 'chunky'`: The art resolution: `fine` (the game's, 480×270 by default) or `chunky` (two thirds of it: bigger pixels).\n- `quality?: QualityOption`: Shadow and light quality: a level, or `auto` (the device's).\n- `fps?: number`: Frame cap: 60, 30, or 0 for the display's own rate.\n- `debugInfo?: boolean`: The debug panel: frame rate, camera, GPU errors and the game's status.\n### PIXEL_SIZES\n\n```ts\nconst PIXEL_SIZES: readonly [\"fine\", \"chunky\"]\n```","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0174NsdpXnRcme55LPEM6AEY","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkgy8HR8K5F3BBhfh16q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the UI framework (menus, HUD, prompts) and the story content (all the dialogue, missions, Harrow's notes, epigraphs and credits data)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5079,"cache_read_input_tokens":452588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5079},"output_tokens":73,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"591407bf-69a8-4d7c-87af-f5ee883714e5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:59:34.444Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkgy7w5Jf5iz43RSxMF4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkgy8HR8K5F3BBhfh16q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JzZ8CCiTJUiqa3rAtJE5DV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\ncat > src/ui/menu.js <<'EOF'\n// One menu system for every screen: pad, keys and mouse on the same items. Drawn with the HUD; no DOM.\nimport { clamp } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { wrap } from './pixfont.js';\nimport { drawGlyph, glyphWidth } from './glyphs.js';\nimport { ACT } from '../core/actions.js';\nconst REPEAT0 = 0.32, REPEAT = 0.1;\nexport const SAFE_X = 24, SAFE_Y = 14;\nexport class Menu {\n  stack = []; regions = []; frame = 0; repeatT = 0; repeatDir = null; stickDir = null; lastPtr = [9, 9]; dragging = null; ptr = { x: 0, y: 0 }; holdAccel = 0;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  get top() { return this.stack[this.stack.length - 1] ?? null; }\n  get open() { return this.stack.length > 0; }\n  push(screen, focus = 0) {\n    screen.focus = screen.focus ?? focus;\n    screen.page = screen.page ?? 0;\n    screen.tab = screen.tab ?? 0;\n    this.stack.push(screen);\n    screen.onOpen?.(screen);\n    this.game.onMenuChange();\n    return screen;\n  }\n  pop() { const s = this.stack.pop(); s?.onClose?.(s); this.game.onMenuChange(); return s; }\n  clear() { while (this.stack.length) this.pop(); }\n  replace(screen) { this.stack.pop(); return this.push(screen); }\n  itemsOf(s) { const list = typeof s.items === 'function' ? s.items(s) : s.items; return list ?? []; }\n  move(s, d) {\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    if (!items.length) return;\n    let f = s.focus;\n    for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) { f = (f + d + items.length) % items.length; if (items[f].enabled !== false || items[f].focusable) break; }\n    if (f !== s.focus) { s.focus = f; this.game.sfx.play('ui-move'); }\n  }\n  activate(s, it) {\n    if (!it || it.enabled === false) { this.game.sfx.play('ui-back', { volume: 0.3 }); return; }\n    if (it.onSelect) { this.game.sfx.play('ui-confirm'); it.onSelect(it, s); }\n    else if (it.slider) this.nudge(it, 1, 1);\n    else if (it.choices) this.cycle(it, 1);\n  }\n  nudge(it, d, k = 1) {\n    const sl = it.slider; if (!sl) return;\n    const v = clamp(sl.get() + d * sl.step * k, sl.min, sl.max);\n    sl.set(Math.round(v / sl.step) * sl.step);\n    this.game.sfx.play('ui-move', { volume: 0.5 });\n  }\n  cycle(it, d) {\n    const c = it.choices, i = c.options.indexOf(c.get());\n    c.set(c.options[(i + d + c.options.length) % c.options.length]);\n    this.game.sfx.play('ui-move');\n  }\n  /** Runs every frame; timeScale may be 0, so this counts frames, not dt. */\n  update(ctx, realDt) {\n    const g = this.game, s = this.top, a = g.actions;\n    this.frame++;\n    this.ptr.x = ((ctx.input.pointer.x + 1) / 2) * ctx.hud.width;\n    this.ptr.y = ((1 - ctx.input.pointer.y) / 2) * ctx.hud.height;\n    if (!s) return;\n    if (s.update) s.update(ctx, realDt, s);\n    // Moves: D-pad or left stick with key repeat, arrows or WASD.\n    const axis = ctx.input.moveAxis();\n    const stick = Math.abs(axis.y) > 0.5 ? (axis.y > 0 ? 'up' : 'down') : Math.abs(axis.x) > 0.5 ? (axis.x > 0 ? 'right' : 'left') : null;\n    let dir = null;\n    if (a.tapped('menuUp')) dir = 'up'; else if (a.tapped('menuDown')) dir = 'down'; else if (a.tapped('menuLeft')) dir = 'left'; else if (a.tapped('menuRight')) dir = 'right';\n    const held = a.down('menuUp') || a.down('menuDown') || a.down('menuLeft') || a.down('menuRight') || stick;\n    if (dir) { this.repeatDir = dir; this.repeatT = REPEAT0; this.holdAccel = 0; }\n    else if (stick && stick !== this.stickDir) { dir = stick; this.repeatDir = stick; this.repeatT = REPEAT0; this.holdAccel = 0; }\n    else if (held && this.repeatDir) { this.repeatT -= realDt; this.holdAccel += realDt; if (this.repeatT <= 0) { this.repeatT = REPEAT; dir = this.repeatDir; } }\n    else if (!held) { this.repeatDir = null; }\n    this.stickDir = stick;\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    if (s.focus >= items.length) s.focus = Math.max(0, items.length - 1);\n    if (dir) {\n      const it = items[s.focus];\n      if (dir === 'up') this.move(s, -1);\n      else if (dir === 'down') this.move(s, 1);\n      else if (s.pages && !items.length) this.turnPage(s, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1);\n      else if (it?.slider) this.nudge(it, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1, this.holdAccel > 1 ? 4 : 1);\n      else if (it?.choices) this.cycle(it, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1);\n      else if (it?.onLeft && dir === 'left') it.onLeft(it, s);\n      else if (it?.onRight && dir === 'right') it.onRight(it, s);\n      else if (s.onSide) s.onSide(dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1, s);\n      else if (s.pages) this.turnPage(s, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1);\n    }\n    // Tabs and pages: L1/R1, Q/E; the wheel scrolls pages.\n    const tabL = a.tapped('tabLeft'), tabR = a.tapped('tabRight');\n    if (s.tabs && (tabL || tabR)) { s.tab = (s.tab + (tabR ? 1 : -1) + s.tabs.length) % s.tabs.length; s.focus = 0; g.sfx.play('ui-move'); }\n    else if (s.pages && (tabL || tabR)) this.turnPage(s, tabR ? 1 : -1);\n    if (ctx.input.wheel !== 0 && s.pages) this.turnPage(s, ctx.input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : -1);\n    if (s.tabs && ctx.input.wheel !== 0) { s.focus = clamp(s.focus + (ctx.input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : -1), 0, Math.max(0, items.length - 1)); }\n    if (s.resetOne && a.tapped('resetOne')) s.resetOne(items[s.focus], s);\n    // Mouse: hover moves focus, click activates.\n    const px = this.ptr.x, py = this.ptr.y;\n    const moved = ctx.input.pointer.x !== this.lastPtr[0] || ctx.input.pointer.y !== this.lastPtr[1];\n    this.lastPtr[0] = ctx.input.pointer.x; this.lastPtr[1] = ctx.input.pointer.y;\n    if (moved && !ctx.input.pointerLocked) { const r = this.regionAt(px, py); if (r && r.index != null && r.index !== s.focus && items[r.index]) { s.focus = r.index; g.sfx.play('ui-move', { volume: 0.5 }); } }\n    let clicked = false;\n    for (const ev of ctx.input.buttonEvents) {\n      const hud = ctx.hud, x = ((ev.x + 1) / 2) * hud.width, y = ((1 - ev.y) / 2) * hud.height;\n      if (ev.down) {\n        const r = this.regionAt(x, y);\n        if (r) {\n          if (r.sliderOf) { this.dragging = r; this.dragTo(x, r); }\n          else if (r.tab != null) { s.tab = r.tab; s.focus = 0; g.sfx.play('ui-move'); }\n          else if (r.action) { g.sfx.play('ui-confirm'); r.action(); clicked = true; }\n          else if (r.index != null) { s.focus = r.index; this.activate(s, items[r.index]); clicked = true; }\n        } else if (s.tapAnywhere) { s.tapAnywhere(); clicked = true; }\n      } else this.dragging = null;\n    }\n    if (this.dragging && ctx.input.mouseButtons) this.dragTo(px, this.dragging);\n    if (clicked && this.top !== s) return;\n    if (a.tapped('confirm')) {\n      if (items.length) this.activate(s, items[s.focus]);\n      else if (s.onConfirm) s.onConfirm(s);\n      else if (s.pages) { if (s.page < s.pages.length - 1) this.turnPage(s, 1); else this.back(s); }\n    }\n    if (this.top === s && a.tapped('back')) this.back(s);\n  }\n  regionAt(x, y) {\n    for (let i = this.regions.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) { const r = this.regions[i]; if (x >= r.x && y >= r.y && x < r.x + r.w && y < r.y + r.h) return r; }\n    return null;\n  }\n  dragTo(x, r) {\n    const sl = r.sliderOf.slider;\n    const f = clamp((x - r.x) / r.w, 0, 1);\n    sl.set(Math.round((sl.min + (sl.max - sl.min) * f) / sl.step) * sl.step);\n  }\n  back(s) {\n    if (s.noBack) return;\n    this.game.sfx.play('ui-back');\n    if (s.onBack) s.onBack(s); else this.pop();\n  }\n  turnPage(s, d) {\n    const p = clamp(s.page + d, 0, s.pages.length - 1);\n    if (p !== s.page) { s.page = p; this.game.sfx.play('map-paper', { volume: 0.5 }); }\n  }\n  // ---- drawing ----\n  draw(hud) {\n    this.regions.length = 0;\n    const s = this.top;\n    if (!s) return;\n    if (s.cover) { hud.rect(0, 0, hud.width, hud.height, typeof s.cover === 'string' ? s.cover : 'ink'); }\n    if (s.dim) this.dimmer(hud, s.dim);\n    if (s.draw) s.draw(hud, this, s);\n    else this.drawStandard(hud, s);\n  }\n  dimmer(hud, alpha) {\n    // A pixel screen: a checker of ink gives a dim without blending.\n    const step = alpha > 0.6 ? 1 : 2;\n    for (let y = 0; y < hud.height; y += step) hud.rect((y >> step === 0 ? 0 : 0), y, hud.width, 1, 'ink');\n  }\n  title(hud, s, y = SAFE_Y) {\n    if (s.title) hud.text(SAFE_X, y, s.title, { scale: 2, color: 'sand', shadow: 'plum' });\n    if (s.subtitle) hud.text(SAFE_X, y + 18, s.subtitle, { color: 'mist' });\n  }\n  drawTabs(hud, s, y) {\n    let x = SAFE_X;\n    s.tabs.forEach((t, i) => {\n      const w = t.length * 6 + 8;\n      hud.rect(x, y, w, 11, i === s.tab ? 'orange' : 'night');\n      hud.text(x + 4, y + 2, t, { color: i === s.tab ? 'ink' : 'mist', shadow: false });\n      this.regions.push({ x, y, w, h: 11, tab: i });\n      x += w + 3;\n    });\n    const g = this.game;\n    const gl = g.actions.glyph('tabRight', g.settings.glyphs === 'xb');\n    const gr = g.actions.glyph('tabLeft', g.settings.glyphs === 'xb');\n    const pw = glyphWidth(gl) + glyphWidth(gr) + 3;\n    drawGlyph(hud, hud.width - SAFE_X - pw, y, gr);\n    drawGlyph(hud, hud.width - SAFE_X - glyphWidth(gl), y, gl);\n  }\n  itemRow(hud, it, i, y, focused, x0 = SAFE_X, w0 = hud.width - SAFE_X * 2) {\n    const h = it.small ? 12 : 20;\n    const scale = it.small ? 1 : 2;\n    if (focused) { hud.rect(0, y - 2, hud.width, h + 2, 'orange'); hud.rect(x0 - 8, y + (h - 12) / 2, 4, 8, 'ink'); }\n    const color = focused ? 'ink' : it.enabled === false ? 'slate' : 'white';\n    const label = it.label;\n    hud.text(x0, y + (it.small ? 1 : 2), label, { scale, color, shadow: focused ? false : 'ink' });\n    this.regions.push({ x: 0, y: y - 2, w: hud.width, h: h + 2, index: i });\n    const right = x0 + w0;\n    if (it.slider) {\n      const sl = it.slider, bw = Math.min(150, w0 * 0.42), bx = right - bw, by = y + (h - 8) / 2 - 1;\n      const f = clamp((sl.get() - sl.min) / (sl.max - sl.min), 0, 1);\n      hud.rect(bx, by, bw, 8, focused ? 'plum' : 'night');\n      hud.rect(bx, by, Math.round(bw * f), 8, focused ? 'white' : 'sand');\n      const txt = sl.format ? sl.format(sl.get()) : String(Math.round(sl.get() * 100) / 100);\n      hud.text(bx - txt.length * 6 - 5, y + (it.small ? 1 : 5), txt, { color, shadow: false });\n      this.regions.push({ x: bx, y: y - 2, w: bw, h: h + 2, sliderOf: it, index: i });\n    } else if (it.choices) {\n      const v = it.choices.format ? it.choices.format(it.choices.get()) : String(it.choices.get());\n      const scaleV = it.small ? 1 : 2, w = v.length * 6 * scaleV;\n      hud.text(right - w, y + (it.small ? 1 : 2), v, { scale: scaleV, color, shadow: focused ? false : 'ink' });\n    } else if (it.value != null) {\n      const v = String(typeof it.value === 'function' ? it.value() : it.value), w = v.length * 6;\n      hud.text(right - w, y + (it.small ? 1 : 5), v, { color, shadow: false });\n    }\n    return h + 3;\n  }\n  drawStandard(hud, s) {\n    this.title(hud, s);\n    let y = SAFE_Y + (s.subtitle ? 32 : 24);\n    if (s.tabs) { this.drawTabs(hud, s, y); y += 16; }\n    if (s.blurb) { for (const line of wrap(s.blurb, hud.width - SAFE_X * 2)) { hud.text(SAFE_X, y, line, { color: 'mist' }); y += 9; } y += 4; }\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    if (s.itemsY) y = s.itemsY;\n    items.forEach((it, i) => { y += this.itemRow(hud, it, i, y, i === s.focus); });\n    if (s.pages) this.drawPaged(hud, s, y);\n    this.footer(hud, s);\n  }\n  drawPaged(hud, s, y0) {\n    const lines = s.pages[s.page] ?? [];\n    let y = y0;\n    for (const l of lines) {\n      const { text, color = 'white', scale = 1 } = typeof l === 'string' ? { text: l } : l;\n      for (const line of wrap(text, hud.width - SAFE_X * 2, scale)) { if (y > hud.height - 28) break; hud.text(SAFE_X, y, line, { color, scale }); y += 9 * scale; }\n    }\n    hud.text(SAFE_X, hud.height - SAFE_Y - 22, `PAGE ${s.page + 1} OF ${s.pages.length}`, { color: 'slate' });\n    const w = 60;\n    this.regions.push({ x: 0, y: 40, w: hud.width / 2, h: hud.height - 80, action: () => this.turnPage(s, -1) });\n    this.regions.push({ x: hud.width / 2, y: 40, w: hud.width / 2, h: hud.height - 80, action: () => { if (s.page < s.pages.length - 1) this.turnPage(s, 1); else this.back(s); } });\n  }\n  footer(hud, s) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const list = s.hints ?? (s.noBack ? [['confirm', 'SELECT']] : [['confirm', 'SELECT'], ['back', 'BACK']]);\n    let x = SAFE_X; const y = hud.height - SAFE_Y - 11;\n    for (const [act, txt] of list) {\n      const name = g.actions.glyph(act, g.settings.glyphs === 'xb');\n      const w = drawGlyph(hud, x, y, name);\n      hud.text(x + w + 3, y + 2, txt, { color: 'white' });\n      this.regions.push({ x, y, w: w + 4 + txt.length * 6, h: 11, action: act === 'back' ? () => this.back(s) : () => { const it = this.itemsOf(s)[s.focus]; if (act === 'confirm' && it) this.activate(s, it); } });\n      x += w + 8 + txt.length * 6;\n    }\n  }\n  state() {\n    const s = this.top;\n    if (!s) return { screen: null, focus: 0 };\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    return { screen: s.id, focus: s.focus, tab: s.tab, page: s.page, item: items[s.focus]?.id ?? items[s.focus]?.label ?? null, items: items.map((i) => i.id ?? i.label) };\n  }\n  /** For tests and scripts: activate an item by id or label. */\n  pick(idOrLabel) {\n    const s = this.top; if (!s) return false;\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    const i = items.findIndex((it) => it.id === idOrLabel || it.label === idOrLabel);\n    if (i < 0) return false;\n    s.focus = i;\n    this.activate(s, items[i]);\n    return true;\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/content/notes.js <<'EOF'\n// Harrow's margin notes and field-note epigraphs. All in the HUD font's characters.\nexport const MARGIN_NOTES = [\n  'A MAP IS A PROMISE MADE BY SOMEONE WHO HAS ALREADY LEFT.',\n  'I DREW THE RIVER WHERE THE COMPANY WANTED IT. THE RIVER WAS SLOW TO COMPLY, BUT IT CAME ROUND.',\n  'BOTH ARMIES BUY FROM ME. THE CONCORD PAYS ON TIME. THE HARVEST PAYS IN GRAIN AND TEARS. I HAVE EATEN BETTER ON THE TEARS.',\n  'YOU WILL HAVE NOTICED THAT YOU FOLLOW ROADS. I DREW THOSE TOO.',\n  'GRASS IS THE ONLY HONEST BORDER. IT GOES WHERE THE WIND TELLS IT, AND IT KEEPS A RECORD.',\n  'BY NOW YOU HAVE BURNED WHAT I MARKED. LOOK AT IT FROM THE RIDGE. TELL ME THAT IS NOT A LINE.',\n];\nexport const CONTRACT_NOTE = 'MIND THE FEVER. YOU ARE LATE ALREADY. E.H.';\nexport const ALL_TRIGS_NOTE = 'SIX PILLARS. YOU READ WELL. THERE IS A CLEAN RIFLE IN YOUR LOCKER. IT IS NOT A GIFT. E.H.';\nexport const EPIGRAPHS = [\n  'A BEARING IS A QUESTION ASKED OF A HILL. THE HILL DOES NOT ANSWER.',\n  'THE COMPANY WANTED STRAIGHT LINES. THE LAND SIGNED NOTHING.',\n  'I MEASURE THREE TIMES. THE MEN WHO USE MY SHEETS DO NOT MEASURE AT ALL.',\n  'EVERY VILLAGE ON THIS SHEET WAS HERE WHEN I DREW IT. THAT IS ALL THE SHEET CAN SAY.',\n  'FIRE IS A SURVEYOR. IT IS NOT PAID, AND IT FINISHES.',\n  'THE RED GRASS MEANS THE END OF THE DRY SEASON. THE COMPANY NAMED A COUNTRY AFTER IT AND LEFT.',\n  'A RIVER KEEPS ITS OWN ACCOUNTS. I ONLY COPY THEM OUT.',\n  'NOTE: THE MINEFIELD AT THE PASS IS AS DRAWN. THE OTHER SHEETS ARE NOT THIS SHEET.',\n  'THERE ARE TWO ARMIES IN THE KETTLE. THERE IS ONE ROAD. I HAVE SOLD THEM BOTH THE ROAD.',\n  'QUININE, ELEVEN TABLETS. FEVER, DUE THURSDAY. THE FEVER KEEPS BETTER TIME THAN THE TRAIN.',\n  'A MAN ASKED ME WHERE THE BORDER WAS. I ASKED HIM WHO WAS PAYING.',\n  'THE ONLY HONEST MAPS ARE OF PLACES NOBODY WANTS.',\n];\nEOF\ncat > src/content/dialogue.js <<'EOF'\n// Every spoken line. [speaker, text]; speaker '' is narration. Lines stay under 60 characters and split in sequence.\nexport const NAMES = { bakr: 'OLD BAKR', odile: 'SISTER ODILE', tibor: 'TIBOR', vance: 'COL. VANCE', ansa: 'MOTHER ANSA', ines: 'INES', dov: 'DOV', mags: 'MAGS', harrow: 'HARROW', pell: 'PELL', concord: 'SOLDIER', harvest: 'SOLDIER', deserter: 'DESERTER', column: 'THE COLUMN', '': '' };\nexport const SPEAKER_COLOR = { bakr: 'sand', odile: 'white', tibor: 'orange', vance: 'mist', ansa: 'red', ines: 'lime', dov: 'cyan', mags: 'green', harrow: 'sky', pell: 'orange', concord: 'mist', harvest: 'orange', deserter: 'slate', column: 'white', '': 'white' };\nexport const LINES = {\n  // ---- M0 ----\n  'm0.ride': [['bakr', 'FORTY MILES OF TRACK AND NOT ONE STATION'], ['bakr', 'THAT REMEMBERS ITS NAME.'], ['bakr', 'THEY PAINT THE SIGNS OVER. WHOEVER WON LAST.'], ['bakr', 'THIS WAS QUEEN ADELAIDE HALT. THEN FREEDOM HALT.'], ['bakr', 'NOW IT IS A BOARD WITH A HOLE IN IT.'], ['bakr', 'YOU HAVE THE LOOK OF A MAN WHO READ ABOUT THIS PLACE.'], ['bakr', 'READING IS A GOOD WAY TO VISIT.']],\n  'm0.map': [['bakr', 'YOU HAVE A MAP? LET ME SEE YOU LOOK AT IT.'], ['', 'YOUR CONTRACT CAME WITH THE SHEET. THERE IS WRITING IN THE MARGIN.']],\n  'm0.note': [['bakr', 'THAT IS HIS HAND. EVERYONE KNOWS HIS HAND.'], ['bakr', 'UP THERE THEY WILL ASK YOU WHICH SIDE. SAY YES.']],\n  'm0.platform': [['bakr', 'MILE FORTY. IT WAS ALWAYS MILE FORTY. NOBODY WANTED IT.'], ['', 'THE PLATFORM IS MOVING. PLATFORMS DO NOT MOVE.']],\n  // ---- M1 ----\n  'm1.wake': [['odile', 'YOU FELL DOWN ON MY PLATFORM. THAT IS ONE.'], ['odile', 'BLACKWATER. YOU BROUGHT IT OR IT WAITED FOR YOU.'], ['odile', 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. I NEED YOU TO BE ON TIME.'], ['odile', 'TAKE THE TABLET. IT IS BITTER. THAT IS HOW YOU KNOW.']],\n  'm1.brief': [['odile', 'THREE TABLETS. THE FOURTH YOU PAY FOR.'], ['odile', 'I DO NOT MEAN IN STONES.'], ['odile', 'THREE WELLS HAS TWELVE DOSES AND FORTY CHILDREN.'], ['odile', 'THE TRUCK IS OUTSIDE. THE RIFLE WAS RETURNED TO US.'], ['odile', 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS. YOU ARE THE MATH.']],\n  'm1.done': [['odile', 'YOU CAME BACK. THAT IS TWO.'], ['odile', 'THE PUMP SHED ON THE WEST ROAD IS EMPTY. THE LAST MAN'], ['odile', 'STOPPED NEEDING IT. YOU MAY SLEEP THERE.'], ['mags', 'HOLD STILL. NO, YOU CAN\\'T FEEL THAT. NO, THAT\\'S NORMAL.'], ['mags', 'MAGS. I WAS A DOCTOR UNTIL THE ARMY READ MY FILE.'], ['mags', 'NOT TODAY. TODAY YOU OWE ME MONEY.']],\n  // ---- M2 ----\n  'm2.brief': [['tibor', 'EVERYTHING ON THIS RACK HAS BEEN RETURNED AT LEAST ONCE.'], ['tibor', 'INES CARVALHO OWES ME FOR A PROPELLER. SHE IS IN A CAGE'], ['tibor', 'AT THE RANGER POST. THE CAGE IS NOT MINE. THE DEBT IS.'], ['tibor', 'EIGHT MEN AND A TOWER. GO BY NIGHT. THEY SLEEP BADLY.'], ['tibor', 'IT FIRES. IF YOU WANT IT TO FIRE TWICE, THAT IS A DIFFERENT PRICE.']],\n  'm2.cage': [['ines', 'I FLEW FOR BOTH OF THEM. NEITHER PAID. GET IN.'], ['ines', 'NO. WAIT. GET ME OUT. THEN GET IN.'], ['ines', 'WHOSE TRUCK IS THAT? NOW IT IS MINE. YOU OWE ME A TRUCK.']],\n  'm2.done': [['ines', 'FALL DOWN OUT THERE AND I WILL COME AND GET YOU.'], ['ines', 'IT GOES ON THE BILL.'], ['tibor', 'SHE LIVES. THEN I AM PAID, EVENTUALLY.'], ['tibor', 'THE POST IS YOURS NOW. THERE IS A COT AND A LOCKER.'], ['dov', 'TWO FINGERS I LEFT IN THIS COUNTRY.'], ['dov', 'I CAME BACK TO SEE WHAT THEY ARE DOING.']],\n  // ---- M3 ----\n  'm3.brief': [['vance', 'THE MATTER OF THE EAST SIDING HAS BECOME REGRETTABLE.'], ['vance', 'THE HARVEST KEEPS THREE TANKS THERE, ON A FARM CERTIFICATE.'], ['vance', 'WE DO NOT BURN VILLAGES. WE CONCLUDE THEM.'], ['vance', 'THIS IS A FLARE PISTOL. IT IS NOT A WEAPON. IT IS AN INVOICE.'], ['vance', 'THE WIND WILL SIT BEHIND YOU UNTIL SUNSET. MY PASS WILL HOLD'], ['vance', 'ON OUR GROUND. YOUR INVOICE WILL BE HONOURED, REGRETTABLY.']],\n  'm3.alt': [['ines', 'IT\\'S INES. THE COLONEL\\'S PLAN IS A LONG WALK AND A FLARE.'], ['ines', 'THERE IS A HARVEST TANKER AT P3. TAKE IT, DRIVE IT IN.'], ['ines', 'THEY WILL WAVE YOU THROUGH. THEY ALWAYS WAVE AT FUEL.'], ['ines', 'I\\'LL MEET YOU THERE. YOU WILL OWE ME ANOTHER TRUCK.']],\n  'm3.done': [['vance', 'THE SMOKE WAS VISIBLE FROM THIS OFFICE. IT IS A GOOD OFFICE.'], ['vance', 'THE ACCOUNT IS CONCLUDED. I REGRET THE GRASS.']],\n  // ---- M4 ----\n  'm4.brief': [['ansa', 'SIT. YOU MAY SIT. WHAT DO YOU WANT, A MEDAL?'], ['ansa', 'THE CONCORD PAY THEIR GARRISONS IN STONES.'], ['ansa', 'A CONVOY CROSSES THE SALT PAN ON A LOOP, LIKE A BAD SENTENCE.'], ['ansa', 'YOU SAID LESS PEOPLE. FEWER. FEWER PEOPLE.'], ['ansa', 'IT WILL MATTER BY THE END OF THE MONTH. TAKE THE CASE.']],\n  'm4.alt': [['dov', 'THIS IS DOV. I HAVE TWO CHARGES AND A STORY.'], ['dov', 'A MAN ASKED ME TO MINE HIS OWN ROAD, SO HE WOULD KNOW'], ['dov', 'WHERE IT WAS SAFE. HE WAS RIGHT FOR A WEEK.'], ['dov', 'PLANT THEM ON THE BRIDGE. BLOW IT WHEN THE TRUCK IS ON IT.']],\n  'm4.tracker': [['ansa', 'THE CASE WENT INTO THE SALT. HERE. IT BEEPS.'], ['ansa', 'THE SURVEYOR SOLD THE COMPANY THESE. PRESS IT TO YOUR PALM.']],\n  'm4.done': [['ansa', 'YOU HAVE A CASE. A CASE OF WHAT? COMPLETE THE SENTENCE.'], ['ansa', 'A CASE OF STONES. GOOD. YOU MAY KEEP SOME.']],\n  // ---- M5 ----\n  'm5.brief': [['vance', 'THE WATER QUESTION HAS BEEN A GREAT SORROW TO THIS OFFICE.'], ['vance', 'THREE WELLS FEEDS THE HARVEST. THE PUMP FEEDS THREE WELLS.'], ['vance', 'YOU MAY SEE THE LOGIC. PLEASE DO NOT DESCRIBE IT TO ME.'], ['vance', 'THERE ARE CHARGES IN THE CRATE. THE MATTER WILL CONCLUDE.']],\n  'm5.alt': [['mags', 'MAGS. DON\\'T BLOW IT YET. THERE IS A BYPASS VALVE INSIDE.'], ['mags', 'OPEN IT, HOLD THE HOUSE FOR A MINUTE, THE CISTERN FILLS.'], ['mags', 'THEN BLOW WHAT YOU LIKE. LESS PAY. I\\'LL BE THERE.'], ['mags', 'I AM TELLING YOU WHAT I AM DOING. I AM ALREADY WALKING.']],\n  'm5.done.dry': [['vance', 'THE VILLAGE HAS, I AM TOLD, RELOCATED. YOUR INVOICE.'], ['odile', 'TWO HUNDRED FORTY.'], ['odile', 'NO TABLETS. YOU WILL RUN A CRATE FOR NOTHING. THEN WE WILL SEE.']],\n  'm5.done.wet': [['vance', 'THE CISTERN IS FULL. HOW UNFORTUNATE. I WILL PAY FOR THE PUMP.'], ['mags', 'THERE. THAT DIDN\\'T HURT. THAT\\'S A LIE, IT HURTS LATER.']],\n  // ---- M6 ----\n  'm6.brief': [['ansa', 'BURN THE FIELD. A HUNGRY MAN LEARNS TO READ THE WIND.'], ['ansa', 'CONCORD GRAIN, CONCORD SHELLS IN THE BUNKER. AT NIGHT.'], ['ansa', 'IT IS NOT CRUELTY. IT IS PUNCTUATION.'], ['ansa', 'TAKE SOMEONE. YOU WILL WANT SOMEONE TO BLAME.']],\n  'm6.turn': [['', 'THE WIND TURNS. NOBODY ORDERED IT TO.']],\n  'm6.choice': [['', 'THEY ARE ON THE GROUND. THEY ARE ASKING YOU SOMETHING.']],\n  'm6.done': [['ansa', 'I COULD SEE IT FROM THE SCHOOLROOM. THE CHILDREN COULD TOO.'], ['ansa', 'THEY WILL WRITE ABOUT IT. I WILL CORRECT THE SPELLING.']],\n  // ---- M7 ----\n  'm7.note': [['harrow', 'YOU HAVE DRAWN WELL. COME AND SEE.']],\n  'm7.alt': [['', 'THE RADIO GIVES A SHORT CRACK AND A FAMILIAR VOICE.']],\n  'm7.ledger': [['', 'A SURVEYOR\\'S ACCOUNT BOOK. YOUR NAME IS NOT IN IT. THE SUM IS.'], ['harrow', 'ONE CONTRACTOR, PAID IN ADVANCE, TO WALK THE KETTLE.'], ['', 'IT IS SIGNED. YOU KNOW THE HAND.']],\n  'm7.done': [['tibor', 'THE TRUCE IS RETURNED. EVERYTHING GETS RETURNED.'], ['tibor', 'I AM PUTTING MY RACK IN YOUR LOCKERS. YOU MAY PAY ME LATER.'], ['tibor', 'THERE IS NO LATER. PAY ME NOW.']],\n  // ---- M8 ----\n  'm8.brief': [['odile', 'THEY ARE SHELLING THE MARKET. THAT IS THREE.'], ['odile', 'BAKR HAS ONE TRAIN AND SIX HUNDRED PEOPLE.'], ['odile', 'HOLD THE PLATFORM. I WILL COUNT THEM ON.'], ['odile', 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. YOU KNOW THE REST.']],\n  'm8.board': [['odile', 'ONE HUNDRED.'], ['odile', 'TWO HUNDRED SIXTEEN.'], ['odile', 'FOUR HUNDRED. KEEP THEM OFF THE TRACK.'], ['odile', 'FIVE HUNDRED NINETY. LEAVE THE REST. THAT IS NOT A FIGURE OF SPEECH.']],\n  'm8.ride': [['bakr', 'THIS WAS THE LONGEST STRAIGHT ON THE COMPANY LINE!'], ['bakr', 'NOW IT IS A GOOD PLACE TO BE SHOT! GET ON THAT GUN!']],\n  'm8.done': [['bakr', 'HE WROTE TO ME. THE SURVEYOR. HE SAYS THE GRASS WON\\'T BURN TWICE.'], ['bakr', 'THEY ARE GETTING DOWN. THEY ARE WALKING ON YOUR ASH.'], ['bakr', 'I DO NOT KNOW WHAT THIS PLACE IS CALLED NOW.']],\n  // ---- M9 ----\n  'm9.climb': [['', 'THE RAIN COMES. NOTHING WILL BURN TONIGHT.']],\n  'm9.scene': [['harrow', 'YOU ARE LATE. I SAID YOU WOULD BE.'], ['harrow', 'SIT DOWN, IT WON\\'T TAKE LONG, NEITHER OF US HAS LONG.'], ['harrow', 'I DREW THE LINES THAT STARTED THIS.'], ['harrow', 'I WOULD LIKE TO DRAW ONE MORE.']],\n  'm9.lay': [['harrow', 'YOUR CONTRACT MAP. LAY IT DOWN. EAST SIDING. THE CUT.'], ['harrow', 'THE LONG FIELD. YOU HAVE BEEN DRAWING FOR ME. LOOK AT IT.'], ['harrow', 'BURNED GRASS CANNOT BURN TWICE.'], ['harrow', 'IT IS THE ONLY SAFE ROAD IN THE COUNTRY, AND YOU BUILT IT FOR WAGES.']],\n  'm9.offer': [['harrow', 'THE COLUMN IS WALKING IT NOW. THE PASS IS MINED.'], ['harrow', 'THIS IS THE ONLY HONEST SHEET OF THAT MINEFIELD. THESE ARE MY TABLETS.'], ['harrow', 'I PAID FOR YOUR CONTRACT. I WOULD LIKE YOU TO FINISH IT. OR NOT.']],\n  'm9.shot': [['', 'THE LAMP KEEPS BURNING. NOBODY IS WRITING.']],\n  'm9.spared': [['harrow', 'NO. WELL. A MAP IS A PROMISE. GO ON.'], ['harrow', 'I WILL STAY AND FINISH THE MARGIN.']],\n  'm9.sheet': [['', 'THE SHEET IS IN YOUR HAND. THE COLUMN IS ON THE SCAR. THE STONES ARE IN YOUR COAT.']],\n  // ---- End ----\n  'end.column': [['column', 'WHICH WAY? WHICH WAY IS IT?'], ['', 'YOU SHOW THEM THE SHEET. THEY TAKE IT WITHOUT THANKS. GOOD.']],\n  'end.alone': [['', 'THE PASS IS CLEAR ON THE SHEET. YOU FOLD IT SMALL.']],\n  'end.ines': [['ines', 'I FLEW FOR BOTH OF THEM. I AM HERE FOR THE STONES.'], ['ines', 'YOU OWE ME SEVERAL TRUCKS. WE SPLIT IT. LAST OFFER.']],\n  'end.dov': [['dov', 'A MAN HAD A CASE OF STONES AND A FRIEND.'], ['dov', 'THE FRIEND ASKED NICELY, TWICE. THE STORY ENDS BADLY.']],\n  'end.mags': [['mags', 'I AM COMING OVER. I AM TAKING THE CASE. HOLD STILL.'], ['mags', 'NO. YOU CAN\\'T FEEL THAT. NOT TODAY.']],\n  'end.pell': [['pell', 'THE MOTHER SAYS THE STONES ARE THE PEOPLE\\'S. I AM THE PEOPLE.']],\n  'end.refuse': [['', 'THEY DRAW ANYWAY.']],\n  'end.light': [['', 'THERE IS THE LAST OF THE GRASS, AND YOU HAVE A FLARE.']],\n  // ---- Side ----\n  'odile.run': [['odile', 'A CRATE. THE TIMER IS NOT A SUGGESTION. FOUR TABLETS IF YOU ARE ON TIME.']],\n  'odile.paid': [['odile', 'FOUR. COUNT THEM. I DID.']],\n  'odile.late': [],\n  'odile.idle': [['odile', 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS.'], ['odile', 'YOU ARE STANDING IN THE LIGHT.'], ['odile', 'I HAVE NINE MINUTES. YOU HAVE USED ONE.']],\n  'tibor.idle': [['tibor', 'IF IT SHOOTS, IT IS STILL UNDER WARRANTY.'], ['tibor', 'RETURNS ARE WELCOME. REFUNDS ARE A DIFFERENT DEPARTMENT.'], ['tibor', 'THAT ONE CAME BACK WITH THE OWNER STILL HOLDING IT.']],\n  'bakr.idle': [['bakr', 'THIS WAS CROWN JUNCTION. THEN UNITY JUNCTION. NOW IT IS A DOG.'], ['bakr', 'THEY ARE PAINTING THE HALT AGAIN. BLUE. BLUE WILL NOT LAST.'], ['bakr', 'MY FATHER DROVE THIS LINE. MY FATHER IS AT KILOMETRE NINE.']],\n  'bakr.travel': [['bakr', 'I USED TO CALL THIS THE EMPRESS RUN. THE EMPRESS DID NOT WRITE BACK.'], ['bakr', 'WE ARE PASSING WHAT WAS PROGRESS HALT. IT HAS MADE NONE.'], ['bakr', 'ONE STONE, ONE HOUR. THE RATE HAS NOT CHANGED SINCE THE WAR.'], ['bakr', 'WHICH WAR? THAT IS THE RIGHT QUESTION. YOU WILL GO FAR. ONE STONE.'], ['bakr', 'THIS STRETCH WAS NAMED FOR A GOVERNOR. THE GOVERNOR WAS NAMED FOR A HORSE.']],\n  'vance.idle': [['vance', 'THE OFFICE HAS NO WORK FOR YOU AT THIS TIME. REGRETTABLY.'], ['vance', 'DO WIPE YOUR BOOTS. THE CARPET HAS SURVIVED TWO GOVERNMENTS.']],\n  'ansa.idle': [['ansa', 'SPEAK UP. NOT LOUDER. BETTER.'], ['ansa', 'THE LESSON TODAY IS THE PAST TENSE. EVERYTHING IS IN IT.']],\n  'ines.idle': [['ines', 'YOU OWE ME A TRUCK. YOU OWE ME SEVERAL TRUCKS.'], ['ines', 'I LOST THE PLANE IN A CARD GAME AND THE WINNER LOST IT TO A TREE.']],\n  'ines.fight': [['ines', 'THAT ONE IS ON THE BILL.'], ['ines', 'KEEP YOUR HEAD DOWN. HEADS ARE EXTRA.']],\n  'ines.saved': [['ines', 'THAT\\'S ONE I OWE YOU. DON\\'T WRITE IT DOWN.']],\n  'ines.wounded': [['ines', 'THEY GOT ME DRAGGING YOU. THAT IS DOUBLE.']],\n  'ines.rescue': [['ines', 'GET UP. GET UP, YOU OWE ME TOO MUCH TO DIE.'], ['ines', 'COME ON. IT\\'S ONLY BLOOD, IT\\'S NOT EVEN ALL YOURS.']],\n  'dov.idle': [['dov', 'A MAN BURIED HIS SAVINGS IN A MINEFIELD. VERY SAFE, HE SAID. HE WAS RIGHT, THE SAVINGS ARE FINE.'], ['dov', 'THREE BROTHERS WENT TO THE PASS. THE FOURTH CAME BACK AND ASKED WHAT HAPPENED TO THE OTHER TWO.']],\n  'dov.fight': [['dov', 'A MAN STOOD WHERE YOU ARE STANDING. MOVE.'], ['dov', 'THERE WAS A SOLDIER. THERE IS NOT NOW. SHORT STORY.']],\n  'dov.saved': [['dov', 'A MAN HELPED A STRANGER. THE STRANGER OWED HIM. IT HAS NOT ENDED YET.']],\n  'dov.wounded': [['dov', 'NOW IT IS EIGHT FINGERS AND A LIMP. THE STORY IMPROVES.']],\n  'dov.rescue': [['dov', 'A MAN LAY IN THE ROAD. ANOTHER CAME FOR HIM. BOTH ARE STILL STUPID.'], ['dov', 'BREATHE. I WILL TELL YOU HOW IT ENDS LATER.']],\n  'mags.idle': [['mags', 'THAT WOUND IS HEALING WRONG. I COULD MAKE IT WORSE, THEN BETTER.'], ['mags', 'I AM LOOKING AT YOUR EYES. YOUR EYES ARE YELLOW. EAT SOMETHING.']],\n  'mags.fight': [['mags', 'I AM SHOOTING HIM NOW. I WILL BE SORRY LATER. NOT YET.'], ['mags', 'THAT ONE WILL NEED A TOURNIQUET. NOT FROM ME.']],\n  'mags.saved': [['mags', 'THAT\\'S MY SYRETTE, THAT\\'S MY VEIN. WE ARE EVEN. WE ARE NOT EVEN.']],\n  'mags.wounded': [['mags', 'I AM APPLYING PRESSURE TO MYSELF. THAT IS WHAT IS HAPPENING.']],\n  'mags.rescue': [['mags', 'HOLD STILL. NO, YOU CAN\\'T FEEL THAT. NO, THAT\\'S NORMAL. HOLD STILL.'], ['mags', 'NOT TODAY. TODAY YOU OWE ME MONEY.']],\n  'pell.rescue': [['pell', 'THE MOTHER SAYS BRING YOU BACK. SHE DID NOT SAY WHOLE.']],\n  'pell.saved': [['pell', 'I WILL TELL THE MOTHER YOU SAID PLEASE.']],\n  'pell.fight': [['pell', 'FOR THE PEOPLE! WHICHEVER ONES ARE LEFT!']],\n  'pell.wounded': [],\n  'fever.collapse': [['', 'YOU WAKE SOMEWHERE ELSE, HOURS LATER. YOUR POCKETS ARE LIGHTER.']],\n  'fever.buddy.ines': [['ines', 'THAT IS ME CARRYING YOU. YOU ARE HEAVIER THAN A PROPELLER.']],\n  'fever.buddy.dov': [['dov', 'A MAN CARRIED ANOTHER MAN OFF A ROAD. THE OTHER MAN WAS SICK ON HIM.']],\n  'fever.buddy.mags': [['mags', 'I AM CARRYING YOU. THAT\\'S MY SHOULDER. THAT\\'S YOUR SICK.']],\n  'cage.idle': [['ines', 'THE LOCK. THE LOCK. THAT\\'S THE LOCK RIGHT THERE.']],\n  'wall.empty': [['', 'A PLANK FOR NAMES. SOME ARE ONLY SCRATCHES.']],\n  'wall.names': [['', 'YOU SCRATCH IT WITH THE KNIFE. IT TAKES LESS TIME THAN YOU THOUGHT.']],\n};\nexport const LOAD_LINE = 'FROM HARROW\\'S FIELD NOTES';\nEOF\ncat > src/ui/dialogue.js <<'EOF'\n// Subtitles and spoken lines. A queue, a voice, a camera hold on the speaker, and skip.\nimport { LINES, NAMES } from '../content/dialogue.js';\nimport { hashStr } from '../core/rng.js';\nexport class Dialogue {\n  queue = []; current = null; t = 0; onEnd = null; picks = new Map(); hold = null; lineCount = 0;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  /** Lines by key, or an array of [speaker, text]. Returns the total length in seconds. */\n  play(linesOrKey, { onEnd, holdOn, skippable = true } = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const lines = typeof linesOrKey === 'string' ? (LINES[linesOrKey] ?? []) : linesOrKey;\n    this.queue = lines.map(([who, text]) => ({ who, text }));\n    this.onEnd = onEnd ?? null;\n    this.current = null; this.t = 0; this.skippable = skippable;\n    if (holdOn) this.setHold(holdOn);\n    if (!this.queue.length) { this.finish(); return 0; }\n    this.next();\n    return lines.reduce((a, [w, tx]) => a + this.duration(w, tx), 0);\n  }\n  duration(who, text) { const v = this.game.voice.lineSeconds(who, text); return Math.max(1.6, v + 0.6, text.length / 18); }\n  next() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.current = this.queue.shift() ?? null;\n    if (!this.current) { this.finish(); return; }\n    this.lineCount++;\n    this.t = this.duration(this.current.who, this.current.text);\n    g.voice.say(this.current.who, this.current.text);\n    g.subtitle.set(this.current.who, this.current.text, this.t);\n    g.events.emit('line', this.current.who, this.current.text);\n  }\n  finish() {\n    this.clearHold();\n    const f = this.onEnd; this.onEnd = null; this.current = null;\n    f?.();\n  }\n  /** Advance on Cross/Enter so readers never wait. */\n  skip() { if (this.current) { this.t = 0; } }\n  get active() { return !!this.current; }\n  setHold(target) { this.hold = target; }\n  clearHold() { this.hold = null; }\n  fixedUpdate(dt) {\n    if (!this.current) return;\n    this.t -= dt;\n    if (this.t <= 0) this.next();\n  }\n  update() {\n    if (this.current && this.skippable && this.game.actions.tapped('skip')) this.skip();\n  }\n  stopAll() { this.queue = []; this.current = null; this.onEnd = null; this.clearHold(); this.game.subtitle.clear(); }\n  /** One line from a pool, cycling, deterministic. */\n  pick(key) {\n    const list = LINES[key];\n    if (!list || !list.length) return null;\n    const n = this.picks.get(key) ?? 0;\n    this.picks.set(key, n + 1);\n    return list[n % list.length][1];\n  }\n}\nexport class Subtitle {\n  who = ''; text = ''; t = 0;\n  get active() { return this.t > 0; }\n  set(who, text, t) { this.who = who; this.text = text; this.t = t; this.minor = false; }\n  clear() { this.t = 0; this.text = ''; }\n}\nexport const speakerName = (who) => NAMES[who] ?? '';\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Write menu framework, dialogue data and subtitle system"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5079,"cache_read_input_tokens":452588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5079},"output_tokens":73,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"3e1f4027-a87e-4e78-98ac-84e46b902ea4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:02:03.718Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkgy7w5Jf5iz43RSxMF4","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JzZ8CCiTJUiqa3rAtJE5DV":{"command":"set -e\ncat > src/ui/menu.js <<'EOF'\n// One menu system for every screen: pad, keys and mouse on the same items. Drawn with the HUD; no DOM.\nimport { clamp } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { wrap } from './pixfont.js';\nimport { drawGlyph, glyphWidth } from './glyphs.js';\nimport { ACT } from '../core/actions.js';\nconst REPEAT0 = 0.32, REPEAT = 0.1;\nexport const SAFE_X = 24, SAFE_Y = 14;\nexport class Menu {\n  stack = []; regions = []; frame = 0; repeatT = 0; repeatDir = null; stickDir = null; lastPtr = [9, 9]; dragging = null; ptr = { x: 0, y: 0 }; holdAccel = 0;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  get top() { return this.stack[this.stack.length - 1] ?? null; }\n  get open() { return this.stack.length > 0; }\n  push(screen, focus = 0) {\n    screen.focus = screen.focus ?? focus;\n    screen.page = screen.page ?? 0;\n    screen.tab = screen.tab ?? 0;\n    this.stack.push(screen);\n    screen.onOpen?.(screen);\n    this.game.onMenuChange();\n    return screen;\n  }\n  pop() { const s = this.stack.pop(); s?.onClose?.(s); this.game.onMenuChange(); return s; }\n  clear() { while (this.stack.length) this.pop(); }\n  replace(screen) { this.stack.pop(); return this.push(screen); }\n  itemsOf(s) { const list = typeof s.items === 'function' ? s.items(s) : s.items; return list ?? []; }\n  move(s, d) {\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    if (!items.length) return;\n    let f = s.focus;\n    for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) { f = (f + d + items.length) % items.length; if (items[f].enabled !== false || items[f].focusable) break; }\n    if (f !== s.focus) { s.focus = f; this.game.sfx.play('ui-move'); }\n  }\n  activate(s, it) {\n    if (!it || it.enabled === false) { this.game.sfx.play('ui-back', { volume: 0.3 }); return; }\n    if (it.onSelect) { this.game.sfx.play('ui-confirm'); it.onSelect(it, s); }\n    else if (it.slider) this.nudge(it, 1, 1);\n    else if (it.choices) this.cycle(it, 1);\n  }\n  nudge(it, d, k = 1) {\n    const sl = it.slider; if (!sl) return;\n    const v = clamp(sl.get() + d * sl.step * k, sl.min, sl.max);\n    sl.set(Math.round(v / sl.step) * sl.step);\n    this.game.sfx.play('ui-move', { volume: 0.5 });\n  }\n  cycle(it, d) {\n    const c = it.choices, i = c.options.indexOf(c.get());\n    c.set(c.options[(i + d + c.options.length) % c.options.length]);\n    this.game.sfx.play('ui-move');\n  }\n  /** Runs every frame; timeScale may be 0, so this counts frames, not dt. */\n  update(ctx, realDt) {\n    const g = this.game, s = this.top, a = g.actions;\n    this.frame++;\n    this.ptr.x = ((ctx.input.pointer.x + 1) / 2) * ctx.hud.width;\n    this.ptr.y = ((1 - ctx.input.pointer.y) / 2) * ctx.hud.height;\n    if (!s) return;\n    if (s.update) s.update(ctx, realDt, s);\n    // Moves: D-pad or left stick with key repeat, arrows or WASD.\n    const axis = ctx.input.moveAxis();\n    const stick = Math.abs(axis.y) > 0.5 ? (axis.y > 0 ? 'up' : 'down') : Math.abs(axis.x) > 0.5 ? (axis.x > 0 ? 'right' : 'left') : null;\n    let dir = null;\n    if (a.tapped('menuUp')) dir = 'up'; else if (a.tapped('menuDown')) dir = 'down'; else if (a.tapped('menuLeft')) dir = 'left'; else if (a.tapped('menuRight')) dir = 'right';\n    const held = a.down('menuUp') || a.down('menuDown') || a.down('menuLeft') || a.down('menuRight') || stick;\n    if (dir) { this.repeatDir = dir; this.repeatT = REPEAT0; this.holdAccel = 0; }\n    else if (stick && stick !== this.stickDir) { dir = stick; this.repeatDir = stick; this.repeatT = REPEAT0; this.holdAccel = 0; }\n    else if (held && this.repeatDir) { this.repeatT -= realDt; this.holdAccel += realDt; if (this.repeatT <= 0) { this.repeatT = REPEAT; dir = this.repeatDir; } }\n    else if (!held) { this.repeatDir = null; }\n    this.stickDir = stick;\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    if (s.focus >= items.length) s.focus = Math.max(0, items.length - 1);\n    if (dir) {\n      const it = items[s.focus];\n      if (dir === 'up') this.move(s, -1);\n      else if (dir === 'down') this.move(s, 1);\n      else if (s.pages && !items.length) this.turnPage(s, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1);\n      else if (it?.slider) this.nudge(it, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1, this.holdAccel > 1 ? 4 : 1);\n      else if (it?.choices) this.cycle(it, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1);\n      else if (it?.onLeft && dir === 'left') it.onLeft(it, s);\n      else if (it?.onRight && dir === 'right') it.onRight(it, s);\n      else if (s.onSide) s.onSide(dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1, s);\n      else if (s.pages) this.turnPage(s, dir === 'left' ? -1 : 1);\n    }\n    // Tabs and pages: L1/R1, Q/E; the wheel scrolls pages.\n    const tabL = a.tapped('tabLeft'), tabR = a.tapped('tabRight');\n    if (s.tabs && (tabL || tabR)) { s.tab = (s.tab + (tabR ? 1 : -1) + s.tabs.length) % s.tabs.length; s.focus = 0; g.sfx.play('ui-move'); }\n    else if (s.pages && (tabL || tabR)) this.turnPage(s, tabR ? 1 : -1);\n    if (ctx.input.wheel !== 0 && s.pages) this.turnPage(s, ctx.input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : -1);\n    if (s.tabs && ctx.input.wheel !== 0) { s.focus = clamp(s.focus + (ctx.input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : -1), 0, Math.max(0, items.length - 1)); }\n    if (s.resetOne && a.tapped('resetOne')) s.resetOne(items[s.focus], s);\n    // Mouse: hover moves focus, click activates.\n    const px = this.ptr.x, py = this.ptr.y;\n    const moved = ctx.input.pointer.x !== this.lastPtr[0] || ctx.input.pointer.y !== this.lastPtr[1];\n    this.lastPtr[0] = ctx.input.pointer.x; this.lastPtr[1] = ctx.input.pointer.y;\n    if (moved && !ctx.input.pointerLocked) { const r = this.regionAt(px, py); if (r && r.index != null && r.index !== s.focus && items[r.index]) { s.focus = r.index; g.sfx.play('ui-move', { volume: 0.5 }); } }\n    let clicked = false;\n    for (const ev of ctx.input.buttonEvents) {\n      const hud = ctx.hud, x = ((ev.x + 1) / 2) * hud.width, y = ((1 - ev.y) / 2) * hud.height;\n      if (ev.down) {\n        const r = this.regionAt(x, y);\n        if (r) {\n          if (r.sliderOf) { this.dragging = r; this.dragTo(x, r); }\n          else if (r.tab != null) { s.tab = r.tab; s.focus = 0; g.sfx.play('ui-move'); }\n          else if (r.action) { g.sfx.play('ui-confirm'); r.action(); clicked = true; }\n          else if (r.index != null) { s.focus = r.index; this.activate(s, items[r.index]); clicked = true; }\n        } else if (s.tapAnywhere) { s.tapAnywhere(); clicked = true; }\n      } else this.dragging = null;\n    }\n    if (this.dragging && ctx.input.mouseButtons) this.dragTo(px, this.dragging);\n    if (clicked && this.top !== s) return;\n    if (a.tapped('confirm')) {\n      if (items.length) this.activate(s, items[s.focus]);\n      else if (s.onConfirm) s.onConfirm(s);\n      else if (s.pages) { if (s.page < s.pages.length - 1) this.turnPage(s, 1); else this.back(s); }\n    }\n    if (this.top === s && a.tapped('back')) this.back(s);\n  }\n  regionAt(x, y) {\n    for (let i = this.regions.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) { const r = this.regions[i]; if (x >= r.x && y >= r.y && x < r.x + r.w && y < r.y + r.h) return r; }\n    return null;\n  }\n  dragTo(x, r) {\n    const sl = r.sliderOf.slider;\n    const f = clamp((x - r.x) / r.w, 0, 1);\n    sl.set(Math.round((sl.min + (sl.max - sl.min) * f) / sl.step) * sl.step);\n  }\n  back(s) {\n    if (s.noBack) return;\n    this.game.sfx.play('ui-back');\n    if (s.onBack) s.onBack(s); else this.pop();\n  }\n  turnPage(s, d) {\n    const p = clamp(s.page + d, 0, s.pages.length - 1);\n    if (p !== s.page) { s.page = p; this.game.sfx.play('map-paper', { volume: 0.5 }); }\n  }\n  // ---- drawing ----\n  draw(hud) {\n    this.regions.length = 0;\n    const s = this.top;\n    if (!s) return;\n    if (s.cover) { hud.rect(0, 0, hud.width, hud.height, typeof s.cover === 'string' ? s.cover : 'ink'); }\n    if (s.dim) this.dimmer(hud, s.dim);\n    if (s.draw) s.draw(hud, this, s);\n    else this.drawStandard(hud, s);\n  }\n  dimmer(hud, alpha) {\n    // A pixel screen: a checker of ink gives a dim without blending.\n    const step = alpha > 0.6 ? 1 : 2;\n    for (let y = 0; y < hud.height; y += step) hud.rect((y >> step === 0 ? 0 : 0), y, hud.width, 1, 'ink');\n  }\n  title(hud, s, y = SAFE_Y) {\n    if (s.title) hud.text(SAFE_X, y, s.title, { scale: 2, color: 'sand', shadow: 'plum' });\n    if (s.subtitle) hud.text(SAFE_X, y + 18, s.subtitle, { color: 'mist' });\n  }\n  drawTabs(hud, s, y) {\n    let x = SAFE_X;\n    s.tabs.forEach((t, i) => {\n      const w = t.length * 6 + 8;\n      hud.rect(x, y, w, 11, i === s.tab ? 'orange' : 'night');\n      hud.text(x + 4, y + 2, t, { color: i === s.tab ? 'ink' : 'mist', shadow: false });\n      this.regions.push({ x, y, w, h: 11, tab: i });\n      x += w + 3;\n    });\n    const g = this.game;\n    const gl = g.actions.glyph('tabRight', g.settings.glyphs === 'xb');\n    const gr = g.actions.glyph('tabLeft', g.settings.glyphs === 'xb');\n    const pw = glyphWidth(gl) + glyphWidth(gr) + 3;\n    drawGlyph(hud, hud.width - SAFE_X - pw, y, gr);\n    drawGlyph(hud, hud.width - SAFE_X - glyphWidth(gl), y, gl);\n  }\n  itemRow(hud, it, i, y, focused, x0 = SAFE_X, w0 = hud.width - SAFE_X * 2) {\n    const h = it.small ? 12 : 20;\n    const scale = it.small ? 1 : 2;\n    if (focused) { hud.rect(0, y - 2, hud.width, h + 2, 'orange'); hud.rect(x0 - 8, y + (h - 12) / 2, 4, 8, 'ink'); }\n    const color = focused ? 'ink' : it.enabled === false ? 'slate' : 'white';\n    const label = it.label;\n    hud.text(x0, y + (it.small ? 1 : 2), label, { scale, color, shadow: focused ? false : 'ink' });\n    this.regions.push({ x: 0, y: y - 2, w: hud.width, h: h + 2, index: i });\n    const right = x0 + w0;\n    if (it.slider) {\n      const sl = it.slider, bw = Math.min(150, w0 * 0.42), bx = right - bw, by = y + (h - 8) / 2 - 1;\n      const f = clamp((sl.get() - sl.min) / (sl.max - sl.min), 0, 1);\n      hud.rect(bx, by, bw, 8, focused ? 'plum' : 'night');\n      hud.rect(bx, by, Math.round(bw * f), 8, focused ? 'white' : 'sand');\n      const txt = sl.format ? sl.format(sl.get()) : String(Math.round(sl.get() * 100) / 100);\n      hud.text(bx - txt.length * 6 - 5, y + (it.small ? 1 : 5), txt, { color, shadow: false });\n      this.regions.push({ x: bx, y: y - 2, w: bw, h: h + 2, sliderOf: it, index: i });\n    } else if (it.choices) {\n      const v = it.choices.format ? it.choices.format(it.choices.get()) : String(it.choices.get());\n      const scaleV = it.small ? 1 : 2, w = v.length * 6 * scaleV;\n      hud.text(right - w, y + (it.small ? 1 : 2), v, { scale: scaleV, color, shadow: focused ? false : 'ink' });\n    } else if (it.value != null) {\n      const v = String(typeof it.value === 'function' ? it.value() : it.value), w = v.length * 6;\n      hud.text(right - w, y + (it.small ? 1 : 5), v, { color, shadow: false });\n    }\n    return h + 3;\n  }\n  drawStandard(hud, s) {\n    this.title(hud, s);\n    let y = SAFE_Y + (s.subtitle ? 32 : 24);\n    if (s.tabs) { this.drawTabs(hud, s, y); y += 16; }\n    if (s.blurb) { for (const line of wrap(s.blurb, hud.width - SAFE_X * 2)) { hud.text(SAFE_X, y, line, { color: 'mist' }); y += 9; } y += 4; }\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    if (s.itemsY) y = s.itemsY;\n    items.forEach((it, i) => { y += this.itemRow(hud, it, i, y, i === s.focus); });\n    if (s.pages) this.drawPaged(hud, s, y);\n    this.footer(hud, s);\n  }\n  drawPaged(hud, s, y0) {\n    const lines = s.pages[s.page] ?? [];\n    let y = y0;\n    for (const l of lines) {\n      const { text, color = 'white', scale = 1 } = typeof l === 'string' ? { text: l } : l;\n      for (const line of wrap(text, hud.width - SAFE_X * 2, scale)) { if (y > hud.height - 28) break; hud.text(SAFE_X, y, line, { color, scale }); y += 9 * scale; }\n    }\n    hud.text(SAFE_X, hud.height - SAFE_Y - 22, `PAGE ${s.page + 1} OF ${s.pages.length}`, { color: 'slate' });\n    const w = 60;\n    this.regions.push({ x: 0, y: 40, w: hud.width / 2, h: hud.height - 80, action: () => this.turnPage(s, -1) });\n    this.regions.push({ x: hud.width / 2, y: 40, w: hud.width / 2, h: hud.height - 80, action: () => { if (s.page < s.pages.length - 1) this.turnPage(s, 1); else this.back(s); } });\n  }\n  footer(hud, s) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const list = s.hints ?? (s.noBack ? [['confirm', 'SELECT']] : [['confirm', 'SELECT'], ['back', 'BACK']]);\n    let x = SAFE_X; const y = hud.height - SAFE_Y - 11;\n    for (const [act, txt] of list) {\n      const name = g.actions.glyph(act, g.settings.glyphs === 'xb');\n      const w = drawGlyph(hud, x, y, name);\n      hud.text(x + w + 3, y + 2, txt, { color: 'white' });\n      this.regions.push({ x, y, w: w + 4 + txt.length * 6, h: 11, action: act === 'back' ? () => this.back(s) : () => { const it = this.itemsOf(s)[s.focus]; if (act === 'confirm' && it) this.activate(s, it); } });\n      x += w + 8 + txt.length * 6;\n    }\n  }\n  state() {\n    const s = this.top;\n    if (!s) return { screen: null, focus: 0 };\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    return { screen: s.id, focus: s.focus, tab: s.tab, page: s.page, item: items[s.focus]?.id ?? items[s.focus]?.label ?? null, items: items.map((i) => i.id ?? i.label) };\n  }\n  /** For tests and scripts: activate an item by id or label. */\n  pick(idOrLabel) {\n    const s = this.top; if (!s) return false;\n    const items = this.itemsOf(s);\n    const i = items.findIndex((it) => it.id === idOrLabel || it.label === idOrLabel);\n    if (i < 0) return false;\n    s.focus = i;\n    this.activate(s, items[i]);\n    return true;\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/content/notes.js <<'EOF'\n// Harrow's margin notes and field-note epigraphs. All in the HUD font's characters.\nexport const MARGIN_NOTES = [\n  'A MAP IS A PROMISE MADE BY SOMEONE WHO HAS ALREADY LEFT.',\n  'I DREW THE RIVER WHERE THE COMPANY WANTED IT. THE RIVER WAS SLOW TO COMPLY, BUT IT CAME ROUND.',\n  'BOTH ARMIES BUY FROM ME. THE CONCORD PAYS ON TIME. THE HARVEST PAYS IN GRAIN AND TEARS. I HAVE EATEN BETTER ON THE TEARS.',\n  'YOU WILL HAVE NOTICED THAT YOU FOLLOW ROADS. I DREW THOSE TOO.',\n  'GRASS IS THE ONLY HONEST BORDER. IT GOES WHERE THE WIND TELLS IT, AND IT KEEPS A RECORD.',\n  'BY NOW YOU HAVE BURNED WHAT I MARKED. LOOK AT IT FROM THE RIDGE. TELL ME THAT IS NOT A LINE.',\n];\nexport const CONTRACT_NOTE = 'MIND THE FEVER. YOU ARE LATE ALREADY. E.H.';\nexport const ALL_TRIGS_NOTE = 'SIX PILLARS. YOU READ WELL. THERE IS A CLEAN RIFLE IN YOUR LOCKER. IT IS NOT A GIFT. E.H.';\nexport const EPIGRAPHS = [\n  'A BEARING IS A QUESTION ASKED OF A HILL. THE HILL DOES NOT ANSWER.',\n  'THE COMPANY WANTED STRAIGHT LINES. THE LAND SIGNED NOTHING.',\n  'I MEASURE THREE TIMES. THE MEN WHO USE MY SHEETS DO NOT MEASURE AT ALL.',\n  'EVERY VILLAGE ON THIS SHEET WAS HERE WHEN I DREW IT. THAT IS ALL THE SHEET CAN SAY.',\n  'FIRE IS A SURVEYOR. IT IS NOT PAID, AND IT FINISHES.',\n  'THE RED GRASS MEANS THE END OF THE DRY SEASON. THE COMPANY NAMED A COUNTRY AFTER IT AND LEFT.',\n  'A RIVER KEEPS ITS OWN ACCOUNTS. I ONLY COPY THEM OUT.',\n  'NOTE: THE MINEFIELD AT THE PASS IS AS DRAWN. THE OTHER SHEETS ARE NOT THIS SHEET.',\n  'THERE ARE TWO ARMIES IN THE KETTLE. THERE IS ONE ROAD. I HAVE SOLD THEM BOTH THE ROAD.',\n  'QUININE, ELEVEN TABLETS. FEVER, DUE THURSDAY. THE FEVER KEEPS BETTER TIME THAN THE TRAIN.',\n  'A MAN ASKED ME WHERE THE BORDER WAS. I ASKED HIM WHO WAS PAYING.',\n  'THE ONLY HONEST MAPS ARE OF PLACES NOBODY WANTS.',\n];\nEOF\ncat > src/content/dialogue.js <<'EOF'\n// Every spoken line. [speaker, text]; speaker '' is narration. Lines stay under 60 characters and split in sequence.\nexport const NAMES = { bakr: 'OLD BAKR', odile: 'SISTER ODILE', tibor: 'TIBOR', vance: 'COL. VANCE', ansa: 'MOTHER ANSA', ines: 'INES', dov: 'DOV', mags: 'MAGS', harrow: 'HARROW', pell: 'PELL', concord: 'SOLDIER', harvest: 'SOLDIER', deserter: 'DESERTER', column: 'THE COLUMN', '': '' };\nexport const SPEAKER_COLOR = { bakr: 'sand', odile: 'white', tibor: 'orange', vance: 'mist', ansa: 'red', ines: 'lime', dov: 'cyan', mags: 'green', harrow: 'sky', pell: 'orange', concord: 'mist', harvest: 'orange', deserter: 'slate', column: 'white', '': 'white' };\nexport const LINES = {\n  // ---- M0 ----\n  'm0.ride': [['bakr', 'FORTY MILES OF TRACK AND NOT ONE STATION'], ['bakr', 'THAT REMEMBERS ITS NAME.'], ['bakr', 'THEY PAINT THE SIGNS OVER. WHOEVER WON LAST.'], ['bakr', 'THIS WAS QUEEN ADELAIDE HALT. THEN FREEDOM HALT.'], ['bakr', 'NOW IT IS A BOARD WITH A HOLE IN IT.'], ['bakr', 'YOU HAVE THE LOOK OF A MAN WHO READ ABOUT THIS PLACE.'], ['bakr', 'READING IS A GOOD WAY TO VISIT.']],\n  'm0.map': [['bakr', 'YOU HAVE A MAP? LET ME SEE YOU LOOK AT IT.'], ['', 'YOUR CONTRACT CAME WITH THE SHEET. THERE IS WRITING IN THE MARGIN.']],\n  'm0.note': [['bakr', 'THAT IS HIS HAND. EVERYONE KNOWS HIS HAND.'], ['bakr', 'UP THERE THEY WILL ASK YOU WHICH SIDE. SAY YES.']],\n  'm0.platform': [['bakr', 'MILE FORTY. IT WAS ALWAYS MILE FORTY. NOBODY WANTED IT.'], ['', 'THE PLATFORM IS MOVING. PLATFORMS DO NOT MOVE.']],\n  // ---- M1 ----\n  'm1.wake': [['odile', 'YOU FELL DOWN ON MY PLATFORM. THAT IS ONE.'], ['odile', 'BLACKWATER. YOU BROUGHT IT OR IT WAITED FOR YOU.'], ['odile', 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. I NEED YOU TO BE ON TIME.'], ['odile', 'TAKE THE TABLET. IT IS BITTER. THAT IS HOW YOU KNOW.']],\n  'm1.brief': [['odile', 'THREE TABLETS. THE FOURTH YOU PAY FOR.'], ['odile', 'I DO NOT MEAN IN STONES.'], ['odile', 'THREE WELLS HAS TWELVE DOSES AND FORTY CHILDREN.'], ['odile', 'THE TRUCK IS OUTSIDE. THE RIFLE WAS RETURNED TO US.'], ['odile', 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS. YOU ARE THE MATH.']],\n  'm1.done': [['odile', 'YOU CAME BACK. THAT IS TWO.'], ['odile', 'THE PUMP SHED ON THE WEST ROAD IS EMPTY. THE LAST MAN'], ['odile', 'STOPPED NEEDING IT. YOU MAY SLEEP THERE.'], ['mags', 'HOLD STILL. NO, YOU CAN\\'T FEEL THAT. NO, THAT\\'S NORMAL.'], ['mags', 'MAGS. I WAS A DOCTOR UNTIL THE ARMY READ MY FILE.'], ['mags', 'NOT TODAY. TODAY YOU OWE ME MONEY.']],\n  // ---- M2 ----\n  'm2.brief': [['tibor', 'EVERYTHING ON THIS RACK HAS BEEN RETURNED AT LEAST ONCE.'], ['tibor', 'INES CARVALHO OWES ME FOR A PROPELLER. SHE IS IN A CAGE'], ['tibor', 'AT THE RANGER POST. THE CAGE IS NOT MINE. THE DEBT IS.'], ['tibor', 'EIGHT MEN AND A TOWER. GO BY NIGHT. THEY SLEEP BADLY.'], ['tibor', 'IT FIRES. IF YOU WANT IT TO FIRE TWICE, THAT IS A DIFFERENT PRICE.']],\n  'm2.cage': [['ines', 'I FLEW FOR BOTH OF THEM. NEITHER PAID. GET IN.'], ['ines', 'NO. WAIT. GET ME OUT. THEN GET IN.'], ['ines', 'WHOSE TRUCK IS THAT? NOW IT IS MINE. YOU OWE ME A TRUCK.']],\n  'm2.done': [['ines', 'FALL DOWN OUT THERE AND I WILL COME AND GET YOU.'], ['ines', 'IT GOES ON THE BILL.'], ['tibor', 'SHE LIVES. THEN I AM PAID, EVENTUALLY.'], ['tibor', 'THE POST IS YOURS NOW. THERE IS A COT AND A LOCKER.'], ['dov', 'TWO FINGERS I LEFT IN THIS COUNTRY.'], ['dov', 'I CAME BACK TO SEE WHAT THEY ARE DOING.']],\n  // ---- M3 ----\n  'm3.brief': [['vance', 'THE MATTER OF THE EAST SIDING HAS BECOME REGRETTABLE.'], ['vance', 'THE HARVEST KEEPS THREE TANKS THERE, ON A FARM CERTIFICATE.'], ['vance', 'WE DO NOT BURN VILLAGES. WE CONCLUDE THEM.'], ['vance', 'THIS IS A FLARE PISTOL. IT IS NOT A WEAPON. IT IS AN INVOICE.'], ['vance', 'THE WIND WILL SIT BEHIND YOU UNTIL SUNSET. MY PASS WILL HOLD'], ['vance', 'ON OUR GROUND. YOUR INVOICE WILL BE HONOURED, REGRETTABLY.']],\n  'm3.alt': [['ines', 'IT\\'S INES. THE COLONEL\\'S PLAN IS A LONG WALK AND A FLARE.'], ['ines', 'THERE IS A HARVEST TANKER AT P3. TAKE IT, DRIVE IT IN.'], ['ines', 'THEY WILL WAVE YOU THROUGH. THEY ALWAYS WAVE AT FUEL.'], ['ines', 'I\\'LL MEET YOU THERE. YOU WILL OWE ME ANOTHER TRUCK.']],\n  'm3.done': [['vance', 'THE SMOKE WAS VISIBLE FROM THIS OFFICE. IT IS A GOOD OFFICE.'], ['vance', 'THE ACCOUNT IS CONCLUDED. I REGRET THE GRASS.']],\n  // ---- M4 ----\n  'm4.brief': [['ansa', 'SIT. YOU MAY SIT. WHAT DO YOU WANT, A MEDAL?'], ['ansa', 'THE CONCORD PAY THEIR GARRISONS IN STONES.'], ['ansa', 'A CONVOY CROSSES THE SALT PAN ON A LOOP, LIKE A BAD SENTENCE.'], ['ansa', 'YOU SAID LESS PEOPLE. FEWER. FEWER PEOPLE.'], ['ansa', 'IT WILL MATTER BY THE END OF THE MONTH. TAKE THE CASE.']],\n  'm4.alt': [['dov', 'THIS IS DOV. I HAVE TWO CHARGES AND A STORY.'], ['dov', 'A MAN ASKED ME TO MINE HIS OWN ROAD, SO HE WOULD KNOW'], ['dov', 'WHERE IT WAS SAFE. HE WAS RIGHT FOR A WEEK.'], ['dov', 'PLANT THEM ON THE BRIDGE. BLOW IT WHEN THE TRUCK IS ON IT.']],\n  'm4.tracker': [['ansa', 'THE CASE WENT INTO THE SALT. HERE. IT BEEPS.'], ['ansa', 'THE SURVEYOR SOLD THE COMPANY THESE. PRESS IT TO YOUR PALM.']],\n  'm4.done': [['ansa', 'YOU HAVE A CASE. A CASE OF WHAT? COMPLETE THE SENTENCE.'], ['ansa', 'A CASE OF STONES. GOOD. YOU MAY KEEP SOME.']],\n  // ---- M5 ----\n  'm5.brief': [['vance', 'THE WATER QUESTION HAS BEEN A GREAT SORROW TO THIS OFFICE.'], ['vance', 'THREE WELLS FEEDS THE HARVEST. THE PUMP FEEDS THREE WELLS.'], ['vance', 'YOU MAY SEE THE LOGIC. PLEASE DO NOT DESCRIBE IT TO ME.'], ['vance', 'THERE ARE CHARGES IN THE CRATE. THE MATTER WILL CONCLUDE.']],\n  'm5.alt': [['mags', 'MAGS. DON\\'T BLOW IT YET. THERE IS A BYPASS VALVE INSIDE.'], ['mags', 'OPEN IT, HOLD THE HOUSE FOR A MINUTE, THE CISTERN FILLS.'], ['mags', 'THEN BLOW WHAT YOU LIKE. LESS PAY. I\\'LL BE THERE.'], ['mags', 'I AM TELLING YOU WHAT I AM DOING. I AM ALREADY WALKING.']],\n  'm5.done.dry': [['vance', 'THE VILLAGE HAS, I AM TOLD, RELOCATED. YOUR INVOICE.'], ['odile', 'TWO HUNDRED FORTY.'], ['odile', 'NO TABLETS. YOU WILL RUN A CRATE FOR NOTHING. THEN WE WILL SEE.']],\n  'm5.done.wet': [['vance', 'THE CISTERN IS FULL. HOW UNFORTUNATE. I WILL PAY FOR THE PUMP.'], ['mags', 'THERE. THAT DIDN\\'T HURT. THAT\\'S A LIE, IT HURTS LATER.']],\n  // ---- M6 ----\n  'm6.brief': [['ansa', 'BURN THE FIELD. A HUNGRY MAN LEARNS TO READ THE WIND.'], ['ansa', 'CONCORD GRAIN, CONCORD SHELLS IN THE BUNKER. AT NIGHT.'], ['ansa', 'IT IS NOT CRUELTY. IT IS PUNCTUATION.'], ['ansa', 'TAKE SOMEONE. YOU WILL WANT SOMEONE TO BLAME.']],\n  'm6.turn': [['', 'THE WIND TURNS. NOBODY ORDERED IT TO.']],\n  'm6.choice': [['', 'THEY ARE ON THE GROUND. THEY ARE ASKING YOU SOMETHING.']],\n  'm6.done': [['ansa', 'I COULD SEE IT FROM THE SCHOOLROOM. THE CHILDREN COULD TOO.'], ['ansa', 'THEY WILL WRITE ABOUT IT. I WILL CORRECT THE SPELLING.']],\n  // ---- M7 ----\n  'm7.note': [['harrow', 'YOU HAVE DRAWN WELL. COME AND SEE.']],\n  'm7.alt': [['', 'THE RADIO GIVES A SHORT CRACK AND A FAMILIAR VOICE.']],\n  'm7.ledger': [['', 'A SURVEYOR\\'S ACCOUNT BOOK. YOUR NAME IS NOT IN IT. THE SUM IS.'], ['harrow', 'ONE CONTRACTOR, PAID IN ADVANCE, TO WALK THE KETTLE.'], ['', 'IT IS SIGNED. YOU KNOW THE HAND.']],\n  'm7.done': [['tibor', 'THE TRUCE IS RETURNED. EVERYTHING GETS RETURNED.'], ['tibor', 'I AM PUTTING MY RACK IN YOUR LOCKERS. YOU MAY PAY ME LATER.'], ['tibor', 'THERE IS NO LATER. PAY ME NOW.']],\n  // ---- M8 ----\n  'm8.brief': [['odile', 'THEY ARE SHELLING THE MARKET. THAT IS THREE.'], ['odile', 'BAKR HAS ONE TRAIN AND SIX HUNDRED PEOPLE.'], ['odile', 'HOLD THE PLATFORM. I WILL COUNT THEM ON.'], ['odile', 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. YOU KNOW THE REST.']],\n  'm8.board': [['odile', 'ONE HUNDRED.'], ['odile', 'TWO HUNDRED SIXTEEN.'], ['odile', 'FOUR HUNDRED. KEEP THEM OFF THE TRACK.'], ['odile', 'FIVE HUNDRED NINETY. LEAVE THE REST. THAT IS NOT A FIGURE OF SPEECH.']],\n  'm8.ride': [['bakr', 'THIS WAS THE LONGEST STRAIGHT ON THE COMPANY LINE!'], ['bakr', 'NOW IT IS A GOOD PLACE TO BE SHOT! GET ON THAT GUN!']],\n  'm8.done': [['bakr', 'HE WROTE TO ME. THE SURVEYOR. HE SAYS THE GRASS WON\\'T BURN TWICE.'], ['bakr', 'THEY ARE GETTING DOWN. THEY ARE WALKING ON YOUR ASH.'], ['bakr', 'I DO NOT KNOW WHAT THIS PLACE IS CALLED NOW.']],\n  // ---- M9 ----\n  'm9.climb': [['', 'THE RAIN COMES. NOTHING WILL BURN TONIGHT.']],\n  'm9.scene': [['harrow', 'YOU ARE LATE. I SAID YOU WOULD BE.'], ['harrow', 'SIT DOWN, IT WON\\'T TAKE LONG, NEITHER OF US HAS LONG.'], ['harrow', 'I DREW THE LINES THAT STARTED THIS.'], ['harrow', 'I WOULD LIKE TO DRAW ONE MORE.']],\n  'm9.lay': [['harrow', 'YOUR CONTRACT MAP. LAY IT DOWN. EAST SIDING. THE CUT.'], ['harrow', 'THE LONG FIELD. YOU HAVE BEEN DRAWING FOR ME. LOOK AT IT.'], ['harrow', 'BURNED GRASS CANNOT BURN TWICE.'], ['harrow', 'IT IS THE ONLY SAFE ROAD IN THE COUNTRY, AND YOU BUILT IT FOR WAGES.']],\n  'm9.offer': [['harrow', 'THE COLUMN IS WALKING IT NOW. THE PASS IS MINED.'], ['harrow', 'THIS IS THE ONLY HONEST SHEET OF THAT MINEFIELD. THESE ARE MY TABLETS.'], ['harrow', 'I PAID FOR YOUR CONTRACT. I WOULD LIKE YOU TO FINISH IT. OR NOT.']],\n  'm9.shot': [['', 'THE LAMP KEEPS BURNING. NOBODY IS WRITING.']],\n  'm9.spared': [['harrow', 'NO. WELL. A MAP IS A PROMISE. GO ON.'], ['harrow', 'I WILL STAY AND FINISH THE MARGIN.']],\n  'm9.sheet': [['', 'THE SHEET IS IN YOUR HAND. THE COLUMN IS ON THE SCAR. THE STONES ARE IN YOUR COAT.']],\n  // ---- End ----\n  'end.column': [['column', 'WHICH WAY? WHICH WAY IS IT?'], ['', 'YOU SHOW THEM THE SHEET. THEY TAKE IT WITHOUT THANKS. GOOD.']],\n  'end.alone': [['', 'THE PASS IS CLEAR ON THE SHEET. YOU FOLD IT SMALL.']],\n  'end.ines': [['ines', 'I FLEW FOR BOTH OF THEM. I AM HERE FOR THE STONES.'], ['ines', 'YOU OWE ME SEVERAL TRUCKS. WE SPLIT IT. LAST OFFER.']],\n  'end.dov': [['dov', 'A MAN HAD A CASE OF STONES AND A FRIEND.'], ['dov', 'THE FRIEND ASKED NICELY, TWICE. THE STORY ENDS BADLY.']],\n  'end.mags': [['mags', 'I AM COMING OVER. I AM TAKING THE CASE. HOLD STILL.'], ['mags', 'NO. YOU CAN\\'T FEEL THAT. NOT TODAY.']],\n  'end.pell': [['pell', 'THE MOTHER SAYS THE STONES ARE THE PEOPLE\\'S. I AM THE PEOPLE.']],\n  'end.refuse': [['', 'THEY DRAW ANYWAY.']],\n  'end.light': [['', 'THERE IS THE LAST OF THE GRASS, AND YOU HAVE A FLARE.']],\n  // ---- Side ----\n  'odile.run': [['odile', 'A CRATE. THE TIMER IS NOT A SUGGESTION. FOUR TABLETS IF YOU ARE ON TIME.']],\n  'odile.paid': [['odile', 'FOUR. COUNT THEM. I DID.']],\n  'odile.late': [],\n  'odile.idle': [['odile', 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS.'], ['odile', 'YOU ARE STANDING IN THE LIGHT.'], ['odile', 'I HAVE NINE MINUTES. YOU HAVE USED ONE.']],\n  'tibor.idle': [['tibor', 'IF IT SHOOTS, IT IS STILL UNDER WARRANTY.'], ['tibor', 'RETURNS ARE WELCOME. REFUNDS ARE A DIFFERENT DEPARTMENT.'], ['tibor', 'THAT ONE CAME BACK WITH THE OWNER STILL HOLDING IT.']],\n  'bakr.idle': [['bakr', 'THIS WAS CROWN JUNCTION. THEN UNITY JUNCTION. NOW IT IS A DOG.'], ['bakr', 'THEY ARE PAINTING THE HALT AGAIN. BLUE. BLUE WILL NOT LAST.'], ['bakr', 'MY FATHER DROVE THIS LINE. MY FATHER IS AT KILOMETRE NINE.']],\n  'bakr.travel': [['bakr', 'I USED TO CALL THIS THE EMPRESS RUN. THE EMPRESS DID NOT WRITE BACK.'], ['bakr', 'WE ARE PASSING WHAT WAS PROGRESS HALT. IT HAS MADE NONE.'], ['bakr', 'ONE STONE, ONE HOUR. THE RATE HAS NOT CHANGED SINCE THE WAR.'], ['bakr', 'WHICH WAR? THAT IS THE RIGHT QUESTION. YOU WILL GO FAR. ONE STONE.'], ['bakr', 'THIS STRETCH WAS NAMED FOR A GOVERNOR. THE GOVERNOR WAS NAMED FOR A HORSE.']],\n  'vance.idle': [['vance', 'THE OFFICE HAS NO WORK FOR YOU AT THIS TIME. REGRETTABLY.'], ['vance', 'DO WIPE YOUR BOOTS. THE CARPET HAS SURVIVED TWO GOVERNMENTS.']],\n  'ansa.idle': [['ansa', 'SPEAK UP. NOT LOUDER. BETTER.'], ['ansa', 'THE LESSON TODAY IS THE PAST TENSE. EVERYTHING IS IN IT.']],\n  'ines.idle': [['ines', 'YOU OWE ME A TRUCK. YOU OWE ME SEVERAL TRUCKS.'], ['ines', 'I LOST THE PLANE IN A CARD GAME AND THE WINNER LOST IT TO A TREE.']],\n  'ines.fight': [['ines', 'THAT ONE IS ON THE BILL.'], ['ines', 'KEEP YOUR HEAD DOWN. HEADS ARE EXTRA.']],\n  'ines.saved': [['ines', 'THAT\\'S ONE I OWE YOU. DON\\'T WRITE IT DOWN.']],\n  'ines.wounded': [['ines', 'THEY GOT ME DRAGGING YOU. THAT IS DOUBLE.']],\n  'ines.rescue': [['ines', 'GET UP. GET UP, YOU OWE ME TOO MUCH TO DIE.'], ['ines', 'COME ON. IT\\'S ONLY BLOOD, IT\\'S NOT EVEN ALL YOURS.']],\n  'dov.idle': [['dov', 'A MAN BURIED HIS SAVINGS IN A MINEFIELD. VERY SAFE, HE SAID. HE WAS RIGHT, THE SAVINGS ARE FINE.'], ['dov', 'THREE BROTHERS WENT TO THE PASS. THE FOURTH CAME BACK AND ASKED WHAT HAPPENED TO THE OTHER TWO.']],\n  'dov.fight': [['dov', 'A MAN STOOD WHERE YOU ARE STANDING. MOVE.'], ['dov', 'THERE WAS A SOLDIER. THERE IS NOT NOW. SHORT STORY.']],\n  'dov.saved': [['dov', 'A MAN HELPED A STRANGER. THE STRANGER OWED HIM. IT HAS NOT ENDED YET.']],\n  'dov.wounded': [['dov', 'NOW IT IS EIGHT FINGERS AND A LIMP. THE STORY IMPROVES.']],\n  'dov.rescue': [['dov', 'A MAN LAY IN THE ROAD. ANOTHER CAME FOR HIM. BOTH ARE STILL STUPID.'], ['dov', 'BREATHE. I WILL TELL YOU HOW IT ENDS LATER.']],\n  'mags.idle': [['mags', 'THAT WOUND IS HEALING WRONG. I COULD MAKE IT WORSE, THEN BETTER.'], ['mags', 'I AM LOOKING AT YOUR EYES. YOUR EYES ARE YELLOW. EAT SOMETHING.']],\n  'mags.fight': [['mags', 'I AM SHOOTING HIM NOW. I WILL BE SORRY LATER. NOT YET.'], ['mags', 'THAT ONE WILL NEED A TOURNIQUET. NOT FROM ME.']],\n  'mags.saved': [['mags', 'THAT\\'S MY SYRETTE, THAT\\'S MY VEIN. WE ARE EVEN. WE ARE NOT EVEN.']],\n  'mags.wounded': [['mags', 'I AM APPLYING PRESSURE TO MYSELF. THAT IS WHAT IS HAPPENING.']],\n  'mags.rescue': [['mags', 'HOLD STILL. NO, YOU CAN\\'T FEEL THAT. NO, THAT\\'S NORMAL. HOLD STILL.'], ['mags', 'NOT TODAY. TODAY YOU OWE ME MONEY.']],\n  'pell.rescue': [['pell', 'THE MOTHER SAYS BRING YOU BACK. SHE DID NOT SAY WHOLE.']],\n  'pell.saved': [['pell', 'I WILL TELL THE MOTHER YOU SAID PLEASE.']],\n  'pell.fight': [['pell', 'FOR THE PEOPLE! WHICHEVER ONES ARE LEFT!']],\n  'pell.wounded': [],\n  'fever.collapse': [['', 'YOU WAKE SOMEWHERE ELSE, HOURS LATER. YOUR POCKETS ARE LIGHTER.']],\n  'fever.buddy.ines': [['ines', 'THAT IS ME CARRYING YOU. YOU ARE HEAVIER THAN A PROPELLER.']],\n  'fever.buddy.dov': [['dov', 'A MAN CARRIED ANOTHER MAN OFF A ROAD. THE OTHER MAN WAS SICK ON HIM.']],\n  'fever.buddy.mags': [['mags', 'I AM CARRYING YOU. THAT\\'S MY SHOULDER. THAT\\'S YOUR SICK.']],\n  'cage.idle': [['ines', 'THE LOCK. THE LOCK. THAT\\'S THE LOCK RIGHT THERE.']],\n  'wall.empty': [['', 'A PLANK FOR NAMES. SOME ARE ONLY SCRATCHES.']],\n  'wall.names': [['', 'YOU SCRATCH IT WITH THE KNIFE. IT TAKES LESS TIME THAN YOU THOUGHT.']],\n};\nexport const LOAD_LINE = 'FROM HARROW\\'S FIELD NOTES';\nEOF\ncat > src/ui/dialogue.js <<'EOF'\n// Subtitles and spoken lines. A queue, a voice, a camera hold on the speaker, and skip.\nimport { LINES, NAMES } from '../content/dialogue.js';\nimport { hashStr } from '../core/rng.js';\nexport class Dialogue {\n  queue = []; current = null; t = 0; onEnd = null; picks = new Map(); hold = null; lineCount = 0;\n  constructor(game) { this.game = game; }\n  /** Lines by key, or an array of [speaker, text]. Returns the total length in seconds. */\n  play(linesOrKey, { onEnd, holdOn, skippable = true } = {}) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const lines = typeof linesOrKey === 'string' ? (LINES[linesOrKey] ?? []) : linesOrKey;\n    this.queue = lines.map(([who, text]) => ({ who, text }));\n    this.onEnd = onEnd ?? null;\n    this.current = null; this.t = 0; this.skippable = skippable;\n    if (holdOn) this.setHold(holdOn);\n    if (!this.queue.length) { this.finish(); return 0; }\n    this.next();\n    return lines.reduce((a, [w, tx]) => a + this.duration(w, tx), 0);\n  }\n  duration(who, text) { const v = this.game.voice.lineSeconds(who, text); return Math.max(1.6, v + 0.6, text.length / 18); }\n  next() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.current = this.queue.shift() ?? null;\n    if (!this.current) { this.finish(); return; }\n    this.lineCount++;\n    this.t = this.duration(this.current.who, this.current.text);\n    g.voice.say(this.current.who, this.current.text);\n    g.subtitle.set(this.current.who, this.current.text, this.t);\n    g.events.emit('line', this.current.who, this.current.text);\n  }\n  finish() {\n    this.clearHold();\n    const f = this.onEnd; this.onEnd = null; this.current = null;\n    f?.();\n  }\n  /** Advance on Cross/Enter so readers never wait. */\n  skip() { if (this.current) { this.t = 0; } }\n  get active() { return !!this.current; }\n  setHold(target) { this.hold = target; }\n  clearHold() { this.hold = null; }\n  fixedUpdate(dt) {\n    if (!this.current) return;\n    this.t -= dt;\n    if (this.t <= 0) this.next();\n  }\n  update() {\n    if (this.current && this.skippable && this.game.actions.tapped('skip')) this.skip();\n  }\n  stopAll() { this.queue = []; this.current = null; this.onEnd = null; this.clearHold(); this.game.subtitle.clear(); }\n  /** One line from a pool, cycling, deterministic. */\n  pick(key) {\n    const list = LINES[key];\n    if (!list || !list.length) return null;\n    const n = this.picks.get(key) ?? 0;\n    this.picks.set(key, n + 1);\n    return list[n % list.length][1];\n  }\n}\nexport class Subtitle {\n  who = ''; text = ''; t = 0;\n  get active() { return this.t > 0; }\n  set(who, text, t) { this.who = who; this.text = text; this.t = t; this.minor = false; }\n  clear() { this.t = 0; this.text = ''; }\n}\nexport const speakerName = (who) => NAMES[who] ?? '';\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Write menu framework, dialogue data and subtitle system"}}}
