apet to sit on a wall top (y = 0 there): a dressed string course, a coursed breast wall and coping, `merlons` slit merlons one to each metre with half a crenel at each end so pieces line up; footprint `merlons` x 0.42 m |\n154:- `readonly qualityOption: QualityOption`: Requested quality (`auto` adapts); `quality` is the level in use.\n163:- `get lights: LightPool`: The dynamic light pool (render/lights.ts), engine-owned: its lights stay in the scene across levels, so loading another level never changes the light count (no recompiles). Created on first use; sized by quality.\n169:- `get quality: QualityLevel`: The quality level in use (see `EngineOptions.quality`).\n302:- `readonly lights: LightPool`: Dynamic point lights: `lights.request({ position, color, intensity, radius, flicker })` (src/engine/render/lights.ts). A fixed pool sized by quality, created on first use.\n425:use for a key does at runtime (`engine.debugKeys = rebindDebugKeys(engine.debugKeys, {\n1492:- `interpolatedFeet(alpha: number): Vector3`: Feet position blended between the previous and current physics step (render use).\n1785:- `static create(gravity = -24): Promise<Physics>`: Loads Rapier's wasm on first use (a separate, streamed .wasm file), then builds a world.\n2201:- `get feet: Vector3`: Feet position (bottom of the capsule). Allocates: hot paths use `feetInto`.\n2204:- `get forward: Vector3`: Facing direction (horizontal, unit). Allocates: hot paths use `forwardInto`.\n2694:- `readonly colorSets: (readonly PaletteColor[])[]`: Color lists in use: [0] is the preset's, bursts with custom colors add more.\n2732:Available as `ctx.particles`; emitters are created on first use and freed by `clear()`\n2939:A model as plain data: no functions, no `use`, every primitive with its slot.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LG8HbGFFF3RHhS3pTqHDXB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]