{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwgHudLNqToSvUqaxd9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Js9YKHvTJLAqvEX2o8PkFA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\ntail -4 tests/ISSUES.md | cut -c1-200\ngrep -n \"ISSUES\\|\\[C\\]\" tools/exit.mjs | head -5 | cut -c1-200\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('tests/suites/systems.mjs').read()\na=\"  t.ok('then it is back on the wheel', cab.cabGripR.visible && !cab.cabHandR.visible);\\n\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,a+\"\"\"  g.driving.eject(); e.step(10);\n  // The town limit: the gun goes over the shoulder, and comes back.\n  g.weapons.slung = false; e.step(30); g.vm.action = null; g.vm.actionName = '';\n  g.weapons.slung = true; e.step(1);\n  t.eq('slinging plays the holster clip', g.vm.actionName, 'Holster');\n  g.weapons.slung = false; g.vm.action = null; e.step(1);\n  t.eq('unslinging brings it back', g.vm.actionName, 'Equip');\n  // Sound through stone: the fort's wall stands between these two places, and nothing between those two.\n  const fort = SITES['fort-clement'].at;\n  g.player.teleport(fort[0] + 12, fort[1] - 44); e.step(5);\n  const y = g.world.heightAt(g.player.feet.x, g.player.feet.z) + 1.7;\n  g.camPos.set(fort[0] + 12, y, fort[1] - 44);\n  t.ok('a wall muffles what is behind it', g.sfx.blocked(fort[0] + 12, fort[1] - 30));\n  t.ok('open ground does not', !g.sfx.blocked(fort[0] + 12, fort[1] - 52));\n\"\"\")\nif \"import { SITES\" not in s:\n    s=s.replace(\"import { MISSIONS } from '../../src/content/missions.js';\",\"import { MISSIONS } from '../../src/content/missions.js';\\nimport { SITES } from '../../src/content/sites.js';\")\nopen('tests/suites/systems.mjs','w').write(s)\ns=open('tests/ISSUES.md').read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- [C] The hands and the gear lever were below the frame in the cab: the wheel's torus size is a diameter, so the rim was half the size I had placed the grips and forearms for. Moved to ten and two with forearms that reach their hands, a test that they are in frame.\n- The dash arrow floated away from its dial, and the dial was a plain slab: now a small compass box with the arrow on it.\n- [C] Fort Clement's walls were my own plain boxes, and the plan names the library's stone wall and battlement. Rebuilt in bays; nesting them in one long model made 4,000+ physics boxes, so each bay has one, and the gate is open to the pathfinder.\n- The plan's step types steal, escort and ride were missing, and the M3 tanker was scripted by hand: added, M3's alt route now steals through the data.\n- Far-off sounds were never muffled by land or walls: the fire roar and the nearest engine now ask.\n- The Holster clip existed and never played: the gun now goes over the shoulder at the town limit.\n\"\"\"\nopen('tests/ISSUES.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/exit.mjs 2>&1 | tail -2 | cut -c1-200\ncat src/content/issue-counts.js | cut -c1-200\nnode tools/build.mjs --verbose 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c150-\ntimeout 300 node tests/run.mjs --only systems 2>&1 | grep -v '^`\\|WebGPURenderer\\|^file:' | grep -v 'pixel-engine.js:' | cut -c1-500 | grep -v '^    at' | tail -6","description":"Add muffle and holster tests, log issues, rebuild, rerun","timeout":330000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2506,"cache_read_input_tokens":107043,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2506},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"c1fce924-edc8-480a-aef6-b97389d81594","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:12:50.025Z","request_id":"req_011CgkwgHT5xdbRiz9fgJRKB","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Js9YKHvTJLAqvEX2o8PkFA":{"command":"set -e\ntail -4 tests/ISSUES.md | cut -c1-200\ngrep -n \"ISSUES\\|\\[C\\]\" tools/exit.mjs | head -5 | cut -c1-200\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('tests/suites/systems.mjs').read()\na=\"  t.ok('then it is back on the wheel', cab.cabGripR.visible && !cab.cabHandR.visible);\\n\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,a+\"\"\"  g.driving.eject(); e.step(10);\n  // The town limit: the gun goes over the shoulder, and comes back.\n  g.weapons.slung = false; e.step(30); g.vm.action = null; g.vm.actionName = '';\n  g.weapons.slung = true; e.step(1);\n  t.eq('slinging plays the holster clip', g.vm.actionName, 'Holster');\n  g.weapons.slung = false; g.vm.action = null; e.step(1);\n  t.eq('unslinging brings it back', g.vm.actionName, 'Equip');\n  // Sound through stone: the fort's wall stands between these two places, and nothing between those two.\n  const fort = SITES['fort-clement'].at;\n  g.player.teleport(fort[0] + 12, fort[1] - 44); e.step(5);\n  const y = g.world.heightAt(g.player.feet.x, g.player.feet.z) + 1.7;\n  g.camPos.set(fort[0] + 12, y, fort[1] - 44);\n  t.ok('a wall muffles what is behind it', g.sfx.blocked(fort[0] + 12, fort[1] - 30));\n  t.ok('open ground does not', !g.sfx.blocked(fort[0] + 12, fort[1] - 52));\n\"\"\")\nif \"import { SITES\" not in s:\n    s=s.replace(\"import { MISSIONS } from '../../src/content/missions.js';\",\"import { MISSIONS } from '../../src/content/missions.js';\\nimport { SITES } from '../../src/content/sites.js';\")\nopen('tests/suites/systems.mjs','w').write(s)\ns=open('tests/ISSUES.md').read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- [C] The hands and the gear lever were below the frame in the cab: the wheel's torus size is a diameter, so the rim was half the size I had placed the grips and forearms for. Moved to ten and two with forearms that reach their hands, a test that they are in frame.\n- The dash arrow floated away from its dial, and the dial was a plain slab: now a small compass box with the arrow on it.\n- [C] Fort Clement's walls were my own plain boxes, and the plan names the library's stone wall and battlement. Rebuilt in bays; nesting them in one long model made 4,000+ physics boxes, so each bay has one, and the gate is open to the pathfinder.\n- The plan's step types steal, escort and ride were missing, and the M3 tanker was scripted by hand: added, M3's alt route now steals through the data.\n- Far-off sounds were never muffled by land or walls: the fire roar and the nearest engine now ask.\n- The Holster clip existed and never played: the gun now goes over the shoulder at the town limit.\n\"\"\"\nopen('tests/ISSUES.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/exit.mjs 2>&1 | tail -2 | cut -c1-200\ncat src/content/issue-counts.js | cut -c1-200\nnode tools/build.mjs --verbose 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c150-\ntimeout 300 node tests/run.mjs --only systems 2>&1 | grep -v '^`\\|WebGPURenderer\\|^file:' | grep -v 'pixel-engine.js:' | cut -c1-500 | grep -v '^    at' | tail -6","description":"Add muffle and holster tests, log issues, rebuild, rerun","timeout":330000}}}
