{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Js9YKHvTJLAqvEX2o8PkFA","type":"tool_result","content":"- [C] A fever collapse during the finale teleported the player away from the Pass and stranded the ending.\n- [C] The two-button prompt's alt action ate every real F and Triangle press, so melee and weapon switching did nothing on a real keyboard or pad.\n- [C] Dying before the first sleep, or between M9 and the Pass, left a chained mission with no giver: the story could not go on after Continue.\n- A guest's syrette and surgery healed only on the guest's screen in Cash Run: the host's next snapshot took it back.\n7:const log = readFileSync('tests/ISSUES.md', 'utf8').split('\\n').filter((l) => l.startsWith('- '));\n8:const all = log.length, critical = log.filter((l) => l.startsWith('- [C]')).length;\n9:writeFileSync('src/content/issue-counts.js', `// Written by tools/exit.mjs from tests/ISSUES.md.\\nexport const ISSUE_COUNTS = { all: ${all}, critical: ${critical} };\\n`);\n12:const fill = (s) => s.replace('%ISSUES%', all).replace('%CRITICAL%', critical);\nexit-interview.json written; 29 issues, 17 critical\n// Written by tools/exit.mjs from tests/ISSUES.md.\nexport const ISSUE_COUNTS = { all: 29, critical: 17 };\n7.html 5.7 MB\nFAIL [systems] slinging plays the holster clip: \"\" !== \"Holster\"\nFAIL [systems] unslinging brings it back: \"\" !== \"Equip\"\n416 passed, 2 failed, 0 suites unchanged","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"88eff41e-e5da-44aa-aef7-d35f7eca6632","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:13:30.495Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"- [C] A fever collapse during the finale teleported the player away from the Pass and stranded the ending.\n- [C] The two-button prompt's alt action ate every real F and Triangle press, so melee and weapon switching did nothing on a real keyboard or pad.\n- [C] Dying before the first sleep, or between M9 and the Pass, left a chained mi