{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxPRsjpgP5EkpAVoguy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My test set the wrong timer value: 7 % 7 only hits the look window at exact multiples. I'll fix that and also tighten the wave assertion, which had a weak escape clause."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":598,"cache_read_input_tokens":195193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":598},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"c41081db-35ae-4bea-87d8-d1857de5a9dc","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:21:50.195Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxPRcNWsenCD7VsGLg3"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxPRsjpgP5EkpAVoguy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B8r8SR1mKMxpjuTuxmgxsk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('tests/suites/systems.mjs').read()\na=\"man.dutyT = 7; man.sitting = false; man.brainDuty(1 / 60); t.ok('on guard he looks about'\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"man.dutyT = 1; man.sitting = false; man.brainDuty(1 / 60); t.ok('on guard he looks about'\")\na=\"t.ok('a local lifts a hand as you pass', played.includes('Wave') || local.speed !== 0);\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"t.ok('a local lifts a hand as you pass', played.includes('Wave'), `speed ${local.speed}`);\")\nopen('tests/suites/systems.mjs','w').write(s)\ns=open('tests/ISSUES.md').read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- The engine's clip checker found 9 of my people clips with feet or knees 5 to 19 cm through the floor (kneeling, sitting, the drag, the burning run). Lifted them, and the static suite now runs analyzeClip and validateClip on every clip I wrote.\n- Most of the stock clips went unplayed, and crouchAim was a field nothing ever set, so nobody crouched: men now kneel to shoot, come in low when hunting, shout on spotting you, sit down and get up; a mate drags himself before he sits; locals wave.\n- Every vehicle shared one cab: each kind now has its own wheel and dash.\n\"\"\"\nopen('tests/ISSUES.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/exit.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-120\nnode tools/build.mjs --verbose 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c150-\ntimeout 280 node tests/run.mjs --only systems 2>&1 | grep -v '^`\\|WebGPURenderer\\|^file:' | grep -v 'pixel-engine.js:' | cut -c1-420 | grep -v '^    at' | tail -8\ntimeout 300 node tools/shots.mjs cabtruck cabtanker 2>&1 | grep -v '^`\\|WebGPURenderer\\|^file:' | grep -v 'pixel-engine.js:' | cut -c1-200 | tail -2\nmagick montage tests/shots/cabtruck.png tests/shots/cabtanker.png -tile 2x1 -geometry 960x540+2+2 -background '#222' -font /usr/share/fonts/truetype/dejavu/DejaVuSans.ttf check/m.png 2>&1 | head -1 | cut -c1-100","description":"Fix test, log issues, rebuild, rerun, shoot truck cabs","timeout":595000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":598,"cache_read_input_tokens":195193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":598},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"bf4f84be-7ae8-4f47-be3a-d0b750f93317","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:21:57.493Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxPRcNWsenCD7VsGLg3","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01B8r8SR1mKMxpjuTuxmgxsk":{"command":"set -e\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('tests/suites/systems.mjs').read()\na=\"man.dutyT = 7; man.sitting = false; man.brainDuty(1 / 60); t.ok('on guard he looks about'\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"man.dutyT = 1; man.sitting = false; man.brainDuty(1 / 60); t.ok('on guard he looks about'\")\na=\"t.ok('a local lifts a hand as you pass', played.includes('Wave') || local.speed !== 0);\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"t.ok('a local lifts a hand as you pass', played.includes('Wave'), `speed ${local.speed}`);\")\nopen('tests/suites/systems.mjs','w').write(s)\ns=open('tests/ISSUES.md').read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- The engine's clip checker found 9 of my people clips with feet or knees 5 to 19 cm through the floor (kneeling, sitting, the drag, the burning run). Lifted them, and the static suite now runs analyzeClip and validateClip on every clip I wrote.\n- Most of the stock clips went unplayed, and crouchAim was a field nothing ever set, so nobody crouched: men now kneel to shoot, come in low when hunting, shout on spotting you, sit down and get up; a mate drags himse