hovel placed. `Math.random === 0` oddity removed.\n\n## Left unused on purpose\n- Stock clips `Push` and `Climb`: the plan has no ladders or doors (section 5), and no scene calls for them.\n- `gaitClip`, `SpringChain`, `Squash`, `twoBoneIK`: listed as available tools; the walks, runs and arms were built without them.\n\n## What remains\n1. The final `node tests/run.mjs --all` (running in the background) must report 0 failed; if a suite fails, fix it, log it in `tests/ISSUES.md`, run `node tools/exit.mjs`, rebuild, rerun.\n2. Delete the generated `check/` folder, run `node tools/handin.mjs`.\n3. Final chat reply: Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from `src/content/about.js` (counts from `src/content/issue-counts.js`), the hand-in result, and honest caveats. Nothing is committed to git.\n\n## Notes\n- tools/shots.mjs names: title main day rust town map nightfire truckmap cab cabtruck cabtanker shift rack talk surgery surgery2 fight dev pause ledger ending harrow fort fort2 fort3 mine river rescue m0 soldiers convoy train herd night nofog ads scope kill card cash about about2 xbox burn\n- A new bug: add a line to tests/ISSUES.md, then `node tools/exit.mjs` (counts feed About + exit interview), then rebuild.\n- `pgrep` on `tests/run.mjs` also matches other agents on this machine: check `/proc/PID/cwd` before believing a process is mine, and never stop theirs.\n"}}}
