{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm1xpwqoyWR65r1ZkAXq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015HJLCdKVfdwMfEHxSAJJ9K","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('tests/ISSUES.md').read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- Twenty pad glyphs (shoulders, triggers, sticks, Xbox's face buttons, Options, Create, Menu, View) were text in a box where the plan asks for pixel art: all now 11 px sprites, and the static suite holds every pad action to it.\n- About, Game Over, the ending card and Credits covered the view; the plan lets only the title and pause menus do that. They are overlays now, and the dim has real densities (anything above 0.6 used to be solid).\n\"\"\"\nopen('tests/ISSUES.md','w').write(s)\ns=open('src/content/about.js').read()\na=\"ragdolls, plus procedural sway and recoil.'\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"ragdolls, plus procedural sway and recoil, a generated limp (gaitClip), two-bone arms at the wheel (twoBoneIK), flags on a spring chain and a spring landing dip.'\",1)\na=\"The engine\\\\'s clip checker earned its place too: run late, it found nine of my clips through the floor.\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"The engine\\\\'s clip checker earned its place too: run late, it found nine of my clips through the floor. So did walking every screen in all three glyph sets, which found a Game Over with no prompt.\",1)\nopen('src/content/about.js','w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/exit.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80\nnode tools/build.mjs --verbose 2>&1 | tail -1 | sed 's#.*/##' | cut -c1-80\ntimeout 560 node tools/shots.mjs ps2 xbox2 about gameover ending 2>&1 | grep -v '^`\\|WebGPURenderer\\|^file:' | grep -v 'pixel-engine.js:' | cut -c1-100 | tail -5\nmagick montage tests/shots/ps2.png tests/shots/xbox2.png tests/shots/about.png tests/shots/gameover.png -tile 2x2 -geometry 900x506+2+2 -background '#222' -font /usr/share/fonts/truetype/dejavu/DejaVuSans.ttf check/m.png 2>&1 | head -1 | cut -c1-100\nmagick tests/shots/ending.png -resize 900x506 check/e.png","description":"Log issues, update About, rebuild, shoot glyphs and overlays","timeout":595000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6037,"cache_read_input_tokens":448064,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6037},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ec49de-27ff-45fb-a784-9f3cf302f915","uuid":"c247f1cb-3688-4f76-a20f-f3986c4bcc63","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:08:50.712Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm1xpdEWrxS1QFizjHF9","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015HJLCdKVfdwMfEHxSAJJ9K":{"command":"set -e\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('tests/ISSUES.md').read().rstrip('\\n')\ns+=\"\"\"\n- Twenty pad glyphs (shoulders, triggers, sticks, Xbox's face buttons, Options, Create, Menu, View) were text in a box where the plan asks for pixel art: all now 11 px sprites, and the static suite holds every pad action to it.\n- About, Game Over, the ending card and Credits covered the view; the plan lets only the title and pause menus do that. They are overlays now, and the dim has real densities (anything above 0.6 used to be solid).\n\"\"\"\nopen('tests/ISSUES.md','w').write(s)\ns=open('src/content/about.js').read()\na=\"ragdolls, plus procedural sway and recoil.'\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"ragdolls, plus procedural sway and recoil, a generated limp (gaitClip), two-bone arms at the wheel (twoBoneIK), flags on a spring chain and a spring landing dip.'\",1)\na=\"The engine\\\\'s clip checker earned its place too: run late, it found nine of my clips through the floor.\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"The engine\\\\'s clip checker earned its place too: run late, it found nine of my cl